  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luka Manye Munyu Ɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka Manye Munyu ɔ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Ye huɛ kpakpa Tiofilo, i le kaa nihi fuu ngma Kristo wami he sane ɔ momo. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Nɛ ngmali nɛ ɔmɛ da nihi nɛ ya nɔ nɛ nihi na kɛ a hɛ ngmɛ, kɛ níhi nɛ kekle kaseli ɔmɛ de ngɛ e he ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ ngma e wami he sane slɔɔto ɔmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Se e pee mi kaa e maa hi ke i hyɛ sanehi nɛ a ngma amɛ a mi ekohu kɛ je sisije kɛ ya si nyagbe, nɛ i bi nihi a mi fitsofitso bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma dla kulaa ma ngma kɛ mane mo, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />konɛ o na anɔkuale ɔ nɔ mi mami nɛ o yi mi nɛ e tɛ mo ngɛ níhi nɛ a tsɔɔ mo ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔfo je e he si tsɔɔ Zakaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Sane ɔ je sisi ngɛ Yudea Matsɛ Herode yi nɔ. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yuda no osɔfo ko hi si nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Zakaria, nɛ e je Abija osɔfohi a weku ɔ mi. E yo ji Elizabet, nɛ lɛ hu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a osɔfohi a wɛtso mi no ji lɛ, nɛ e ji Aaron bibimibi kaa e huno ɔ kɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Zakaria ke Elizabet kulaa ji Mawu gbeye yeli nɛ a yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Se Elizabet ya pee yosa, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ a be bi, nɛ mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ tsuo a bwɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />E ba mi kaa benɛ e su e asafo ɔ nɔ nɛ a ma sɔmɔ ɔ, e ya ngɛ e ni tsue kaa osɔfo ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ngɛ osɔfo ɔmɛ a blɔ nya tomi nya a, Zakaria tutuutu nɔ nɛ sɔ ɔ nɔ, kaa e ya Sɔlemi We ɔ he nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ e ya sa la su ku womi tsopa kɛ via a ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Nɛ nimli babauu nɛ ba jami ɔ tsuo ngɛ sɔlee ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ agbo ɔ nya kaa bɔ nɛ a pɔɔ peemi ngɛ tsopa kɛ via sami be ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Zakaria ngɛ ni nɛ ɔ tsue ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ he klɔuklɔu ɔ, nɛ tlukaa nɛ e maa hyɛ ɔ, o nɛ bɔfo ko nɛ daa si ngɛ bo sami la tɛ ɔ hiɔ nɔ ma je. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Nɛ Zakaria na lɛ ɔ, e hɛli si nɛ e tsui po.<verse eid="LUK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Se bɔfo ɔ de lɛ ke, “Koo ye gbeye, Zakaria, ejakaa i ba nɛ ma ba de mo ke Mawu nu o kue fami ɔ, nɛ o yo Elizabet ma fɔ binyumu ha mo; nɛ biɛ nɛ o maa wo lɛ ji Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Bi nɛ ɔ fɔmi ma ha nyɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ tsuo bua jɔmi, nɛ nihi fuu kɛ nyɛ ma nya. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ejakaa e maa pee Mawu nimli ngua amɛ a ti nɔ kake. Bi nɛ ɔ e kɔ ji kaa e be wai loo da nɛ nya wa ko nue. Nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma hyi lɛ kɛ je e nyɛ muklii mi tɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nɛ lɛ e ma kudɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ fuu a yi kɛ ba a tsɛ Mawu he. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Anɔkuale ji kaa e mumi he maa wa nɛ e he wami maa hi kaa blema Gbalɔ Elia nɔ, nɛ lɛ nɛ e maa sɛ Mesia a hlami nɛ e ma dla nimli ɔmɛ a juɛmi kɛ ha e bami ɔ. E maa dɔ tsɛmɛ a tsui kɛ ba bimɛ a he, nɛ e ma tsake tue gboli a juɛmi kɛ ba dali a ni lemi mi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Se Zakaria de bɔfo ɔ ke, “Kɛ enɛ ɔ maa pee kɛ ba mi kɛɛ? Piɔ nɛ ɔ i wa; nɛ ye yo ɔ hu pee yomoyo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔ de Zakaria ke, “Ami ji Gabriel ɔ nɛ. Mawu hɛ mi nɛ i daa. Nɛ lɛ nɛ e tsɔ mi ke ma ba tu mo manye munyu nɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Se akɛnɛ o he we yi he je ɔ, o maa tɔ mu, o be munyu nyɛe maa tu kɛ ya si be nɛ a ma fɔ bi ɔ. Ejakaa ye munyu ɔ maa ba mi ngɛ be nɛ sa mi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, asafo ɔ kulaa ngɛ Zakaria mlɛe, nɛ a nɛ nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ e tlɔ si ja a ngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Benɛ e ba je kpo ɔ, e nyɛ we munyu nɛ e tu. E nine kɛkɛ nɛ e kɛ ngɛ okadi pee ha mɛ, nɛ a na kɛ je okadi ɔ mi kaa e na nina ko ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Zakaria hi Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ ya si e sɔmɔmi be ɔ nya ta loko ji e kpale kɛ ho we mi ya. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ngɛ enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e kɛ we nɛ Elizabet da si; nɛ e laa e he hlami enuɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Nɛ nɔ́ nɛ e de ji, “Mawu mɔbɔ nami kle kaa e je ye bi nɛ i fɔ we ɔ he zo kɛ ahlua a ngɛ ye nɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A wo Yesu fɔmi he si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Elizabet si dami ɔ hlami ekpa mi pɛpɛɛpɛ ɔ, Mawu tsɔ bɔfo Gabriel nɛ ɔ nɔuu kɛ ho Galilea kɔpe ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Nazaret ɔ ya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />A tsɔ lɛ zangmayo ko nɛ li nyumu nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Maria a ngɔ. Maria nɛ ɔ, a bi e si ha Matsɛ David bibimibi ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yosef ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Gabriel ya je e he kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ Maria nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mo he manye, mo nɔ nɛ a dloo mo; Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ mo ngɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ngami nɛ ɔ pee Maria he mi yaa nɛ e hao. Kɛkɛ nɛ e bɔni ngami ɔ he susumi.<verse eid="LUK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Se bɔfo ɔ de lɛ ke, “Maria, o tsui nɛ ko po, Mawu to e yi mi kaa e maa jɔɔ mo ngɛ nyakpɛ blɔ pɔtɛɛ ko nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />E be kɛe kulaa nɛ o maa da si, nɛ o ma fɔ binyumu. Biɛ nɛ o maa wo lɛ ji ‘Yesu.’ <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Bi nɛ ɔ ma ba pee Nɔmlɔ ngua, nɛ a ma tsɛ lɛ Mawu Bi; nɛ Mawu ma wo lɛ ngɔ hi e nɛnɛkasowa David Matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Nɛ lɛ nɛ e maa ye Israel nɛ ji Yakob we ɔ nɔ matsɛ kɛ ya neneene. Nɛ e matsɛ yemi ɔ se be poe ligbi ko.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maria bi bɔfo ɔ ke, “Kɛ i ma plɛ kɛ fɔ kɛɛ? Ejakaa zangmayo nɛ li nyumu ji mi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Bɔfo ɔ ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ maa ba o nɔ, nɛ Mawu he wami ɔ maa ha o nɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, bi ɔ nɛ o ma fɔ ɔ maa pee klɔuklɔu, Mawu nitsɛ Bi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />O nɛ, o weku no Elizabet nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ le lɛ kaa yosa a, e na mi mi ngɛ e bwɔmi si, hlami ekpa ji nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Ejakaa ke Mawu wo si ɔ, ja e ba mi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Nɛ Maria de bɔfo ɔ ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ Sɔmɔlɔ ji mi, i ngɛ he tsui kaa ma pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ngɛ hlae. E ba mi ha mi ngɛ o munyu ɔ nya.” Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔ laa.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Be bɔɔ se ɔ, Maria pue nɔ kɛ ho yo ɔ nɔ ya ngɛ Yudea ma a mi he nɛ <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Zakaria ngɛ ɔ nɛ e ya slaa Elizabet.<verse eid="LUK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Benɛ Elizabet nu Maria ngami ɔ pɛ nɛ bi ɔ hua ngɛ e muklii mi. Kɛkɛ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ hyi Elizabet tɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Nɛ e de Maria kɛ bua jɔmi ke, “A jɔɔ mo ngɛ yihi a kpɛti, nɛ bi nɛ o ma fɔ ɔ hu a jɔɔ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nɛ hyɛ kaa a bu mi nɛ a wo ye hɛ mi nyami kaa ye Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ e nyɛ ba mi slaami. <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />O nɛ, benɛ i nu o ngami ɔ pɛ kɛkɛ nɛ bi ɔ hua kɛ bua jɔmi ngɛ ye muklii mi. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Akɛnɛ o he ye kaa Mawu maa pee nɔ́ nɛ e de ɔ, lɔ ɔ he je nɛ e jɔɔ mo kikɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Maria hu ha heto nɛ e de ke, “I ngɛ Mawu yi jee; <verse eid="LUK 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />nɛ i na ye yi wami helɔ Mawu ɔ he bua jɔmi. <verse eid="LUK 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ejakaa e hɛ ji e mawayo humi bi ɔ nɔ. Nɛ kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ yaa a, yi nɔhi tsuo ma tsɛ mi ke nɔ nɛ Mawu jɔɔ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Ejakaa Mawu Ope ɔ tsu ni nguahi ha mi. <verse eid="LUK 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />E naa yi nɔ tsuaa yi nɔ bihi nɛ buu lɛ ɔ mɔbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />E kɔni si wa, nɛ e gbɛɛ he nɔ woli kɛ pupuupu peeli ngɔ fiaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />E kpa matsɛmɛ kɛ je a matsɛ sɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ e wo humi bimɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Nihi nɛ hwɔ ngɛ mɛ yee ɔ, e ha nɛ a tɔ kɛ ni kpakpahi, nɛ ni nali ɔmɛ ɔ e fie mɛ kɛ ho kɛ dɛ mi gu. <verse eid="LUK 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ e ye kɛ bua e sɔmɔlɔ Israel ha; nɛ e hɛ ji si nɛ e wo kaa e maa na lɛ mɔbɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ejakaa e wo wa tsɛmɛ nɛ ji Abraham kɛ e bimɛ ɔmɛ si kaa e maa na mɛ mɔbɔ daa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maria ye maa pee hlami etɛ ngɛ Elizabet ngɔ loko ji e kpale kɛ ho lɛ nitsɛ e we mi ya.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ fɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Maa pee be nɛ ɔ mi nɔuu nɛ Elizabet be su nɛ e ma fɔ; nɛ e fɔ binyumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Nihi nɛ e kɛ mɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kɛ e wekuli ɔmɛ tsuo nu e fɔmi ɔ he; nɛ a na bua jɔmi saminya nɛ a na Mawu si ngɛ e dloomi ɔ he.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Jokuɛ ɔ fɔmi e nɔ otsi ɔ, huɛmɛ kɛ wekuli ba kpe kɛ ha bi ɔ kpo jemi kɛ nyumu mi womi. Nɛ jinɛ a to kaa a ma wo bi ɔ e tsɛ biɛ nɛ ji Zakaria a kɛ wo lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Se e nyɛ ɔ kplɛɛ we nɔ. E ke biɛ nɛ a maa wo bi ɔ ji Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi pee mɛ yaa nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Nɔ ko be o weku ɔ mi nɛ hɛɛ jamɛ a biɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ a wo nine kɛ pee okadi kɛ bi tsɛ ɔ nɛ e tsɔɔ biɛ nɛ a maa wo bi ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Lɛ hu e wo nine kɛ pee okadi kɛ bi nɛ a ha lɛ womi nɛ e ngma biɛ ɔ ngɛ nɔ. Nɛ e ngma ke, “Bi ɔ biɛ ji Yohane.” Enɛ ɔ pee nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nyakpɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Zakaria nya bli nɔuu nɛ e bɔni munyu tumi ekohu; nɛ e bɔni Mawu yi jemi.<verse eid="LUK 1:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Munyu nɛ ɔ pɛ ngɛ Yudea kpo ɔ mi tsuo. Nɛ nihi nɛ e kɛ mɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ a nya kpɛ a he. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nu munyu ɔ bi ke, “Mɛni nɔmlɔ kulaa bi nɛ ɔ ma ba hine? Ejakaa e fɔɔ si paa kaa Mawu suɔ bi nɛ ɔ ngɛ nɔ́ ko pɔtɛɛ ko he je.”<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba e tsɛ Zakaria nɔ nɛ e gba nɛ e de ke,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Nyɛ ha wa je Nutsɔ nɛ ji Israel Mawu ɔ yi, ejakaa e ba slaa e nimli ɔmɛ nɛ e kpɔ mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />E tsɔ Yiwamihelɔ Ngua kɛ je e tsɔlɔ Matsɛ David weku ɔ mi ngɔ mane, <verse eid="LUK 1:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />kaa bɔ nɛ e wo si kɛ gu e gbali ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ je blema lokoo, <verse eid="LUK 1:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />ke nɔ ko ma ba kpɔ wɔ kɛ je wa he nyɛli kɛ nihi nɛ sume wɔ ɔ a dɛ mi.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />E na wa nɛmɛ mɔbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />E na nɛnɛ Abraham nitsɛ mɔbɔ, ejakaa e hɛ ji si nɛ e wo lɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />E ha wɔ he blɔ nɛ wa sɔmɔ lɛ, nɛ wa be nɔ ko gbeye yee; ejakaa e kpɔ wɔ kɛ je wa he nyɛli a dɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 1:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />E dla wɔ nɛ wa he nɛ tsɔ nɛ waa sa e hɛ mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa nyɛ da e hɛ mi daa kɛ daa.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nɛ mo ye binyumu, a ma tsɛ mo anunyami Mawu ɔ e gbalɔ, ejakaa o maa sɛ hlami ma dla blɔ kɛ ha Mesia a bami ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />O maa tsɔɔ e nimli ɔmɛ bɔ nɛ a maa pee ma na yi wami hemi kɛ gu a he yayami nɛ a ma kɛ ke mɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Enɛ ɔmɛ tsuo maa ba mi, ejakaa Mawu mɔbɔ nami kle nɛ e dloomi je ko maa ho nami ya ha wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Nɛ e ma ha la ma kpɛ ha nihi nɛ ngɛ diblii mi nɛ gbenɔ nini nɔ a nɔ ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na blɔ nɛ woɔ nɔ kɛ yaa he jɔmi mi ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Niinɛ, bi nɛ ɔ ba suɔ Mawu sane saminya kɛ je e jokuɛ si, nɛ benɛ e ba wa a, e je ya hi nga nɔ lɛ nɔ kake too hluu kɛ ya si benɛ e je e he ngɔ tsɔɔ Israel ma a kaa Mawu sɔmɔlɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu fɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu nɛ Roma Nɔyelɔ nɛ ji Kaisare Augusto gbi ba kaa a kane zugba a mi nimli ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ a le a yi bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />A pee ma nimli a kanemi nɛ ɔ benɛ Kirenio ngɛ amlaalo yee ngɛ Siria.<verse eid="LUK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Nɛ a ha lemi kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ya e ma mi he nɛ e je ɔ nɛ e ya ngma e biɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Akɛnɛ Yosef je Matsɛ David weku ɔ mi he je ɔ, e ba mi kaa e hia blɔ kɛ je Nazaret ngɛ Galilea kɛ ho Betlehem nɛ ji Matsɛ David ma a mi ya ngɛ Yudea nɛ e ya ngma e biɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />E kɛ Maria nɛ e bi e si nɛ e maa ngɔ, nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi e hɔ wa a nɛ a hia blɔ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Benɛ a ngɛ Betlehem ɔ, Maria be su, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />nɛ e fɔ e kekle binyumu; nɛ e wo tako kɛ blaa e he nɛ e wo lɛ ngɔ wluɔ lohwehi a niye ni nɔ́ mi, ejakaa a nɛ blɔ ngɛ nibwɔhi a to he ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Jamɛ a nyɔ ɔ mi ɔ, to hyɛli komɛ ngɛ a tohi hwɔe ngɛ Betlehem nga a nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Si kake too nɛ a maa hyɛ ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ bɔfo ko ji nɛ ngɛ a kpɛti. Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ anunyami ɔ kpɛ kɛ bɔle mɛ nɛ a hɛli si nɛ a ye gbeye. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Se bɔfo ɔ ha mɛ tsui nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛ tsui nɛ ko po, ejakaa i ma nyɛ manye kɛ bua jɔmi munyu titli ko nɛ hine je ɔ tsuo nɔ́ demi. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kaa mwɔnɛ ɔ, a fɔ Mesia, Yiwamihelɔ nɛ ji Kristo Nutsɔ ɔ ngɛ Betlehem. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Nɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ maa pee kɛ le e mi tso ji, nyɛ maa na bimwɔyo ɔ nɛ a wo tako ngɔ blaa e he nɛ a wluɔ lɛ si ngɛ lohwehi a niye ni nɔ́ mi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />E nya nɔɛ si nɛ hiɔwe bɔfohi fuu ba piɛ e he nɛ a ngɛ lae kɛ ngɛ Mawu yi jee ke,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Anunyami ha Mawu ngɛ hiɔwe lokoo, nɛ tue mi jɔmi nɛ ba zugba a nɔ ha nihi nɛ a ni peemi ni sa e hɛ mi ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Benɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya a, to hyɛli ɔmɛ de a bi ke, “Nyɛ ha waa ho Betlehem ya ko nɛ wa ya hyɛ nyakpɛ ni nɛ ba nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ha a ba bɔ wɔ ɔ kɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa hɛ ngmɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />A sa fo kɛ ho ma a mi ya nɛ a ya na Maria kɛ Yosef kɛ bimwɔyo ɔ nɛ hwɔɔ si ngɛ lohwehi a niye ni nɔ́ mi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />To hyɛli ɔmɛ bɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɔ nɛ ba ngɛ nga a nɔ ɔ kɛ nɔ́ nɛ bɔfo ɔ de mɛ ngɛ bi ɔ he ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Anɔkuale ji kaa, to hyɛli ɔmɛ a munyu ɔ pee nɔ tsuaa nɔ nyakpɛ kɛ gbeye. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Se Maria lɛɛ e wo munyu ɔmɛ kɛ wo e tsui mi nɛ e hii he susue.<verse eid="LUK 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, to hyɛli ɔmɛ kpale kɛ ho a lohwe ɔmɛ a he ya ngɛ nga a nɔ kɛ Mawu yi jemi kɛ bua jɔmi ngɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ a he si nɛ a ba je ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ kɛ bi ɔ hu nɛ a ya na kaa bɔ nɛ bɔfo ɔ ba de mɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />E nɔ otsi ligbi nɛ ji kpaanyɔ ɔ, a wo bi ɔ nyumu mi nɛ a wo lɛ biɛ ke Yesu; lɔ ɔ ji biɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔ tsɔɔ nɛ a wo lɛ ngɛ e fɔmi he si womi be ɔ mi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Benɛ Maria fɔmi tsu mi jemi kɛ he tsumi ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ be ɔ su ɔ, fɔli ɔmɛ wo bi ɔ kɛ ho Yerusalem ya konɛ a ya sã bɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ Mose mlaa a tsɔɔ kaa a pee ɔ, konɛ a wo bi ɔ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Mawu dɛ ngɛ mlaa nɛ ɔmɛ a mi ke, “Binyumu tsuaa binyumu nɛ ma bli yo muklii mi nya a, a maa jɔɔ e nɔ ngɔ ha Nutsɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu nɛ Yesu fɔli ɔmɛ wo a he tsukɔmi bɔ sami nɔ́ ɔmɛ nɛ ji okponyɛhi enyɔ loo obleku lahuɛ bimɛ enyɔ ɔ ngɛ mlaa a nya a ya ngɔ ha. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ, Yerusalem no ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Simeon, nɛ e ji dalɔ nɛ yee Mawu gbeye ɔ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ. E ji nɔ ko nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ hyi lɛ tɔ nɛ e ngɛ Mesia a blɔ hyɛe daa nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ je ngɔ tsɔɔ lɛ kaa e maa na Matsɛ nɛ Mawu pɔ lɛ nu ɔ loko ji e ma si je mi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ yi Simeon nɔ kaa e ya Sɔlemi We ɔ. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Yosef kɛ Maria ba nɛ a ba wo bi ɔ ngɔ ha Nutsɔ ɔ ngɛ mlaa a nya a, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeon ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ e wo bi ɔ nɛ e je Mawu yi nɛ e de ke,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Nutsɔ, jehanɛ ɔ, mo ha nɛ o tsɔlɔ ɔ nɛ e ya ngɛ he jɔmi mi ngɛ o si womi ɔ nya. <verse eid="LUK 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ejakaa i na Yiwamihelɔ ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />nɔ nɛ o kɛ ha je ɔ kɛ ami nitsɛ ye hɛ ngmɛ kaa bɔ nɛ o wo mi si kaa i ma na lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Nɛ lɛ ji la nɛ ma kpɛ kɛ ha je ɔ, nɛ e maa pee Israel nɛ ji o nimli ɔmɛ a anunyami.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Yosef kɛ Maria daa si ngɛ nyakpɛ munyu nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɛ tue ngɛ bi ɔ he ɔ nue nɛ a hɛ mi pee mɛ yaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeon gbaa fɔli ɔmɛ nɛ e de bi ɔ nyɛ ɔ ke, “A maa gbɔ o tsui mi ha nɛ o maa hao ngɛ o mumi mi tɔɔ ngɛ bi nɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Ejakaa nihi fuu ngɛ Israel ma kua lɛ, nɛ enɛ ɔ kɛ a hɛ mi kpatami maa ba. Se lɛ kɛ nɛ e ma ha nihi fuu hu ma na bua jɔmi nɛ pe kulaa. Nɛ kɛ gu e nɔ ɔ, tsui mi laami nihi fuu maa je kpo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Gbalɔ yo ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Hana a hu ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ jamɛ a ligbi ɔ. Asher wɛtso ɔ mi no ko nɛ e biɛ ji Fanuel ɔ bi ji lɛ. Nɛ e bwɔ kotokoto. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />E kɛ e huno hi si jeha kpaago nɛ e huno ɔ gbo kɛ je e he jeha nyingmi kpaanyɔ kɛ eywiɛ ji lɔ ɔ nɛ. Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛkɛ se e ngɛ kɛ sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami kɛ ngma himi.<verse eid="LUK 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Benɛ Simeon kɛ fɔli ɔmɛ ngɛ munyu ɔ tue pɛ nɛ Hana hu ba su lejɛ ɔ. Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ lɛ hu e bɔni Mawu si nami nɛ e bɔni nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ Mesia a bami ɔ blɔ hyɛe ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ demi ke Yiwamihelɔ ɔ ba su si.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A kpale kɛ ho Nazaret ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Benɛ Yesu fɔli ɔmɛ tsu kusumi ɔmɛ tsuo ta ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ ngɛ Mawu mlaa a nya a, a kpale kɛ ho Nazaret ya ngɛ Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ Yesu wa ngɛ, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ye e he odase kaa e ji jokuɛ lɛɛ se e ni lemi nya wa saminya; nɛ Mawu jɔɔmi ngɛ e nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41-42" />Benɛ Yesu ye jeha nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔ, e kɛ e fɔli ɔmɛ ya Yerusalem kɛ ha Hebemi Jeha a yemi kaa bɔ nɛ a peeɔ daa jeha a. <verse eid="LUK 2:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Benɛ a gbe jeha yemi ɔ nya a, a kpale kɛ yaa Nazaret; se Yesu tlɔ se nɛ e fɔli ɔmɛ li. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Ejakaa a susu kaa e nyɛɛ e huɛhi a se nɛ a ngɛ blɔ hiali kpa amɛ a kpɛti. Se kɛ ya si gbɔkuɛ be mi nɛ loloolo a nɛ lɛ ɔ, a bɔni lɛ hlami kɛ e si bimi ngɛ a wekuli kɛ a huɛmɛ a ngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Se a nɛ lɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a kpale kɛ ho Yerusalem ya nɛ a ya hla lɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ligbi etɛ se loko ji a ya na lɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ mlaa amɛ a mi munyu nguahi a he sɛsɛe. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Nɛ e nile kɛ e níhi a sisi numi nɛ je kpo ngɛ e munyu bimi kɛ hetohi nɛ e ngɛ hae ɔ pee mɛ nyakpɛ saminya.<verse eid="LUK 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Nɛ e fɔli ɔmɛ na lɛ ɔ, a nya mi jɔ. E nyɛ ɔ bi lɛ ke, “Binyumu, kɛ o pee wɔ nɛ ɔ kɛɛ? I kɛ o tsɛ kpa he tsuaa he ngɛ mo hlae.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ní nɛ e bi mɛ ji, “Nɛ mɛni hia kaa nyɛ hla mi? Nyɛ kai we kaa i ma hi hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ ji ye Tsɛ We ɔ lo?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Se e fɔli ɔmɛ nui nɔ́ nɛ e de nɛ ɔ sisi.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e kɛ mɛ kpale kɛ ho Nazaret ya, nɛ e ya ba e he si ha mɛ. Se e nyɛ ɔ wo sane nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ngɔ to e yi mi. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Nɛ Yesu wa ngɛ nile kɛ nɔmlɔ tso blɔ fa mi, nɛ nimli kɛ Mawu suɔ e sane.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yohane je e ni tsumi sisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ngɛ Matsɛ Ngua Kaisare Tiberio jeha nɛ ji nyɔngma kɛ enuɔ ngɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ mi ɔ, Zakaria bi Yohane na Mawu sɛ titli ko ngɛ nga a nɔ. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Pilato nɛ ngɛ amlaalo yee ngɛ Yudea; nɛ Herode ngɛ Galilea nɔ yee, nɛ e nyɛmi Filipo hu ngɛ Iturea kɛ Trakoniti nɔ yee, nɛ Lisania ngɛ Abilene nɔ yee. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Hana kɛ Kaiafa ji Osɔfo Nikɔtɔmahi nɛ daa si ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nya jamɛ a be ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Nɛ Yohane ngɛ Yordan Pa a e kpo he hiɛ kɛ hiɛ tsuo kpae ngɛ fiɛe ke nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ha nɛ a baptisi lɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ maa tsɔɔ kaa e ba Mawu ngɔ, nɛ e kpale ngɛ e he yayami ɔmɛ a se, konɛ a ngɔ kɛ pa lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kaa bɔ nɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia gba be ko mi lokoo nɛ e de ke, “Gbi ko ngɛ pɛe ngɛ nga a nɔ nɛ e ngɛ dee ke, ‘Nyɛ dla Nutsɔ ɔ blɔ ɔ kɛ ha lɛ nɛ e nyɛɛ nɔ. Nyɛɛ je blɔ dadɛ gbajaa ha lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Nyɛɛ gbɛ yoku ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ tsi muɔ tsuaa muɔ nɛ blɔ ɔ hɛ mi nɛ da nɛ kɔtɔ nɛ ko hi he ko. <verse eid="LUK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, je ɔ tsuo maa na Yiwamihelɔ ɔ nɛ je Mawu ngɔ kɛ ba a.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Bɔ nɛ Yohane fiɛ ha nimli asafo nɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e baptisi mɛ ɔ ji, “Sinɔhi a bimɛ, mɛnɔ de nyɛ ke nyɛɛ tu tue gblami nɛ ma a nya fo? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ke nyɛ hla we nɛ nyɛɛ ya abosiamihi a je ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ha nɛ nyɛ si himi kɛ subai nɛ tsɔɔ kaa nyɛ tsake nyɛ tsui. Nɛ e ko pee nyɛ kaa Abraham bibimibimɛ ji nyɛ mo, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ nyɛ ye nyɛ he. Lɔ ɔ kɛkɛ hiɛ́. Mawu ma nyɛ bɔ bimɛ kɛ je tɛ nɛ ɔmɛ a mi ngɔ ha Abraham. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Nyɛ nɛ, tue gblami gbiɛ ɔ fɔɔ si ngɛ nyɛ nɔ momo, nɛ a maa poo nyɛ kɛ nyɛ sipoku ɔmɛ ngɔ pue si. Anɔkuale ji kaa tso tsuaa tso nɛ wui yiblii kpakpa a, a maa hɛ lɛ ngɔ fɔ si nɛ a ma sake lɛ kɛ fɔ la mi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ni ɔmɛ ha heto nɛ a bi ke, “Mɛni o ngɛ hlae nɛ waa pee?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />E ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Ke mo nɔ ko o ngɛ hiɔwe tade enyɔ ɔ, moo ngɔ kake ke ha ohiafo nɛ be eko ɔ; nɛ ke o ngɛ niye ni bɔ nɛ o be nyɛe maa ye ɔ, moo ngɔ eko kɛ ha nɔ nɛ hwɔ ngɛ lɛ yee ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Nɛ jua kɛ ma sika tsuli nɛ ji juli kɛ ojo fiali ɔmɛ hu ba Yohane ngɔ nɛ e baptisi mɛ; nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Kɛ wa maa pee kɛ tsɔɔ kaa wa ngmɛɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he kɛɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />E ha mɛ heto nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ye anɔkuale; nyɛ ko he sika a pe nɔ nɛ Roma amlaalo ɔ tsɔɔ kaa nyɛ he ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Nɛ soja komɛ hu ba Yohane ngɔ nɛ a ba bi lɛ ke, “Nɛ wɔ hu nɛɛ?” Yohane ha heto nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ko fia ojo, nyɛ ko wo he gbeye womi kɛ basabasa peemi kɛ kpɔ sika ngɛ nihi a dɛ. Nɛ nyɛ ko po munyu ngɔ fɔ nɔ ko nɔ; nɛ nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nyɛ hiɔwo he.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ Mesia a blɔ hyɛe, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ susue nɛ a ngɛ bie ke, “Nɔmlɔ nɛ wa ngɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔ nɛɛ, tsa pi lɛ ji nɛ ɔ lo?”<verse eid="LUK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohane ha a sane ɔ heto nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ami lɛɛ nyu kɛkɛ nɛ i kɛ ngɛ nyɛ baptisie, se nɔ ko ma piɔ nɛ e ngɛ he wami kɛ blɔ nya kulaa pe nɔ nɛ i ngɛ ɔ. Anɔkuale ji kaa i sɛ e tokota nya kpa pinelɔ pohu. Jamɛ a nɔ ɔ lɛɛ la kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ e kɛ maa baptisi nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />E maa sa ngma a mi nɛ e ma bua niye ni ɔ nya kɛ wo ngmato he ɔ, nɛ e maa sa toto kɛ dudusa a kɛ la nɛ be gboe ligbi ɔ ko.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Nɛ bɔ nɛ Yohane plɛ kɛ fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ wo ni ɔmɛ si ha ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Benɛ Yohane ka Herode nɛ ji Galilea amlaalo ɔ hɛ mi ngɛ ma hɛ mi ngɛ e senɔ yo Herodia nɛ e wo ngɔ ɔ, kɛ tɔmi kpahi fuu nɛ e pee ɔ he ɔ, Herode ha nɛ a nu Yohane kɛ wo tsu mi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Enɛ ɔ hu pee tɔmi kpa nɛ e pee kɛ piɛ e tɔmi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="LUK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ligbi ɔ ko benɛ Yohane baptisi ni ɔmɛ ta a, e baptisi Yesu nitsɛ hu. Nɛ benɛ e ngɛ sɔlee ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ hiɔwe nya bli, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kple si kaa balahuɛ kɛ ba ma e yi kpɛti nɛ gbi ko de kɛ je hiɔwe ke, “Mo ji ye Binyumu nɛ i suɔ saminya a nɛ, Mo nɛ ye tsui suɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu weku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu ye maa pee jeha nyingmi etɛ nɛ e bɔni e ni tsumi. A le Yesu kaa Yosef bi, nɛ Yosef tsɛ ji Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli tsɛ ji Matat; Matat tsɛ ji Levi; Levi tsɛ ji Melki; Melki tsɛ ji Yanai;Yanai tsɛ ji Yosef. <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25-26" />Yosef tsɛ ji Matatia; Matatia tsɛ ji Amos; Amos tsɛ ji Nahum; Nahum tsɛ ji Esli; Esli tsɛ ji Nagai; Nagai tsɛ ji Maat; Maat tsɛ ji Matatia; Matatia tsɛ ji Semein; Semein tsɛ ji Yosek; Yosek tsɛ ji Yoda; Yoda tsɛ ji Yohanan. <verse eid="LUK 3:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yohanan tsɛ ji Resa; Resa tsɛ ji Zerubabel; Zerubabel tsɛ ji Shealtiel; Shealtiel tsɛ ji Neri. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri tsɛ ji Melki; Melki tsɛ ji Adi; Adi tsɛ ji Kosam; Kosam tsɛ ji Elmadam. <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Elmadam tsɛ ji Er; Er tsɛ ji Yoshua; Yoshua tsɛ ji Eliezer; Eliezer tsɛ ji Yorim; Yorim tsɛ ji Matat; Matat tsɛ ji Levi. <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi tsɛ ji Simeon; Simeon tsɛ ji Yuda; Yuda tsɛ ji Yosef; Yosef tsɛ ji Yonam. <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Yonam tsɛ ji Eliakim; Eliakim tsɛ ji Melea; Melea tsɛ ji Mena; Mena tsɛ ji Matata; Matata tsɛ ji Natan; Natan tsɛ ji David. <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />David tsɛ ji Isai; Isai tsɛ ji Obed; Obed tsɛ ji Boaz; Boaz tsɛ ji Salmon. <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Salmon tsɛ ji Nahashon; Nahashon tsɛ ji Aminadab; Aminadab tsɛ ji Admin; Admin tsɛ ji Arni; Arni tsɛ ji Hezron; Hezron tsɛ ji Perez; Perez tsɛ ji Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda tsɛ ji Yakob; Yakob tsɛ ji Isak; Isak tsɛ ji Abraham; Abraham tsɛ ji Tera; Tera tsɛ ji Nahor. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor tsɛ ji Serug; Serug tsɛ ji Reu; Reu tsɛ ji Peleg; Peleg tsɛ ji Eber; Eber tsɛ ji Shela. <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela tsɛ ji Kainan; Kainan tsɛ ji Arpakshad; Arpakshad tsɛ ji Shem; Shem tsɛ ji Noa; Noa tsɛ ji Lamek. <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek tsɛ ji Metusela; Metusela tsɛ ji Henok; Henok tsɛ ji Yared; Yared tsɛ ji Mahalalel. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Mahalalel tsɛ ji Kainan; Kainan tsɛ ji Enos; Enos tsɛ ji Set; Set tsɛ ji Adam; Adam tsɛ ji Mawu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Benɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba kple Yesu nɔ ɔ, e kpale e se kɛ je Yordan Pa a nya nɛ Mumi ɔ kpaka lɛ kɛ ho Yudea nga a nɔ ya; <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />nɛ Abosiami ya ka lɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ligbi nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu; nɛ akɛnɛ e yi nɔ ko nɔ ko jamɛ a be ɔ mi he je ɔ, hwɔ ngɛ lɛ yee.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Nɛ Abosiami ba de lɛ ke, “Ke Mawu Bi ji mo ɔ, mo de tɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ e plɛ pee abolo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Se Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “A ngma ke, ‘Tsa pi abolo nɛ haa nɔmlɔ yi naa wami, se Mawu munyu ɔ mohu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Nɛ Abosiami wo lɛ kɛ kuɔ kɛ ho hiɔmi ya; kɛkɛ nɛ si kake too ɔ, e je je nɛ ɔ mi matsɛ yemi slɔɔto ɔmɛ kulaa ngɔ tsɔɔ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Nɛ e de lɛ ke, “I ma wo matsɛmɛ a mahi fini nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ a mi anunyami ɔmɛ kulaa ngɔ ha mo, ejakaa ye níhi ji mɛ nɛ i ngɛ he blɔ nɛ i kɛ haa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ i suɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ke o ma kpla si ma ja mi ɔ, enɛ ɔmɛ tsuo kulaa maa pee o nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu ha Abosiami heto nɛ e de ke, “A ngma ke Mawu pɛ wa ngɛ he blɔ nɛ wa jaa, nɛ lɛ kɛkɛ wa sɔmɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Abosiami wo lɛ kɛ ho Yerusalem ya ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ yi kpɛti ploplooplo nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ke Mawu Bi ji mo ɔ, tuu kɛ je hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ ke ya ma si. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ejakaa a ngma ke Mawu ma fa e bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ a bu o he, <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />nɛ a maa hɛɛ mo ngɛ a dɛ mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ o ko wo o he ya si tɛ ko.”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Ngmami ɔ de hu ke, ‘Koo ka Nutsɔ o Mawu ɔ.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Nɛ benɛ Abosiami ka lɛ ta a, e si lɛ lolo nɛ e je.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu je e ni tsumi ɔ sisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu kpale kɛ ba Galilea nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he wami hyi lɛ tɔ. E kɛ we nɛ e biɛ jiji ngɛ lejɛ ɔ zugba a mi tsuo. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nɛ nihi kulaa nɛ nu sɔlemi ɔmɛ nɛ e pee ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ ɔ je e yi saminya.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Benɛ e ba su Nazaret he nɛ e hi ngɛ e jokuɛ mi ɔ, e ya Sɔlemi We ɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ e pɔɔ peemi ɔ, nɛ e te da si nɛ e maa kane Ngmami ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Nɛ a wo Gbalɔ Yesaia womi ɔ ngɔ ha lɛ. Nɛ e bli womi ɔ he nɛ a ngma ngɛ ke,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Nutsɔ ɔ Mumi ɔ ngɛ ye nɔ nɛ e pɔ mi nu nɛ ma fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ ohiafohi, e tsɔ mi nɛ ma ba tsa nihi nɛ hao ɔ, nɛ ma fiɛ kɛ ha nyɔguɛ ɔmɛ kaa a maa ye a he; nɛ hɛ ngmɛ yuyuitsɛmɛ a hɛ ma bli, nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ nisɛ ni a ni pee ɔ, a ma kpɔ mɛ ke je a nɔ yeli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi; nɛ Mawu pee klaalo nɛ e maa gbaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ maa ba e ngɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Nɛ ma fiɛ kaa Nutsɔ ɔ dloomi be ɔ su.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e nga womi ɔ nya nɛ e wo ngɔ ha sɔmɔlɔ ɔ nɛ e ho hi si. Nihi nɛ ngɛ kpe he ɔ tsuo bɔni lɛ hyɛmi gaa. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Nɛ e ya nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ngmami nɛ ɔmɛ ba mi mwɔnɛ nɛ ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ nu nɛ a kane ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Nihi nɛ ngɛ tsu ɔ mi ɔ tsuo ye he odase, nɛ a nya kpɛ a he ngɛ dloomi munyuhi nɛ je e nya a he. Nɛ a bi ke, “Tsa pi Yosef bi ɔ ji nɛ ɔ lo?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “I le kaa nyɛ maa bu mi abɛ nɛ ɔ, nɛ nyɛ ma de mi ke, ‘Tsopatsɛ, mo tsa mo nitsɛ o he!’ Nɛ e sisi tsɔɔ kaa, ‘Mɛni he je nɛ i tsu we nyakpɛ nɔ ko ngɛ ami nitsɛ ye ma nɛ ɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ i tsu ngɛ Kapernaum ɔ lo?’ <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Se i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke bumi be gbalɔ ko he ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e ma mi. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Munyu nɛ ma ngɔ tsɔɔ nya ji, nyɛ ma kai kaa ngɛ Gbalɔ Elia yi nɔ benɛ sapu yobu ɔ ba ye jeha etɛ kɛ fa sɔuu nɛ e ha hwɔ ba a, yihi nɛ a hunohi gbo ngɛ Israel jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ a he hiɛ; <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />se Mawu tsɔɛ Elia a ti nɔ ko ngɔ ke e ya ye kɛ bua lɛ. Se mohu Zarefat nɛ gbo ɔ e yo nɛ pi Israel no se e je Zidon ɔ, lɛ e ngɔ nɛ Mawu tsɔ Elia nɛ e ya tsu nyakpɛ ni kɛ ye kɛ bua lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Nyɛ ma kai hu kaa ngɛ Gbalɔ Elisha yi nɔ ɔ, hiɔ tsutsɛmɛ fuu ngɛ Israel, se a tsa we a ti nɔ ko pe Naeman nɛ ji Siria no ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Yesu munyu ɔ hua tsui ha ni ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ kpe he ɔ, nɛ e pee mɛ tai hulɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Nɛ a te si nɛ a nyɛɛ e se kɛ ho yoku ɔ he nɛ a to ma a sisi ngɛ ɔ ya konɛ a tsiɛ lɛ kɛ wo kɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Se e gu a kpɛti zaa nɛ e je a he.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Nɛ e ba Kapernaum ngɛ Galilea, nɛ daa Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ, e ya fiɛɔ nɛ e tsɔɔ ni ngɛ kpe he ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Nɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ hu e munyu ɔmɛ pee ni ɔmɛ nyakpɛ. Ejakaa e tuɔ munyu kɛ he wami kaa nɔ nɛ le anɔkuale ɔ, se tsa pi nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ nɔ ko de momo dee.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Ligbi ɔ ko benɛ e ngɛ ni tsɔɔe ngɛ kpe he ɔ, nyumu ko nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ nɔ́ dee ha lɛ ɔ te si nɛ e bɔni ngmlaa kpami kɛ ngɛ Yesu woe ke, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Moo je hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ o ho; wa hla we nɛ waa kɛ mo nɛ pee nɔ́ ko, mo Yesu nɛ je Nazaret ɔ. O ba nɛ o ba kpata wa hɛ mi. Wa le o mi tso kaa mo ji Mawu Bi Klɔuklɔu ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Se Yesu kpɔ munyu ɔ wo e nya. Nɛ e nga mumi yayami ɔ yi ke, “O nya nɛ pee dii! Moo je kpo kɛ je e mi!” Nɛ ngɛ nimli asafo ɔ hɛ mi nɔuu ɔ, mumi yayami ɔ po nɔ ɔ ngɔ fɔ si, kɛkɛ nɛ e je e mi nɛ e yi lɛ awi ko.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Ni ɔmɛ a nya kpɛ a he nɛ a bi ke, “Mɛni ngɛ Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ nya mi munyu mi nɛ haa nɛ mumi yayamihi po buɔ e munyu tue ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Munyu nɛ ɔ gbɛ fia lejɛ ɔ zugba a mi tsuo. <verse eid="LUK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Benɛ e je kpe he ɔ jamɛ a ligbi ɔ, e ho Simon we ɔ mi ya nɛ e ya na Simon nganyɛ nɛ asla yaya fia lɛ ngɔ fɔ si. Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e tsa lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu ya da si ngɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔ sa a he nɛ e nga hiɔ ɔ yi, nɛ nane ɔ nya nɔuu ɔ, yo ɔ he mi la a nya ba si nɛ e te si nɛ e sɔmɔ mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ benɛ pu nɔ si ɔ, ma a mi bi ɔmɛ tsuo wo a we mi hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ, nɛ a ti nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ e ta e he ɔ, e na he wami. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Ni ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ lɛɛ mumi yayami nɛ ngɛ nɔ dee ha mɛ. Yesu nga mumi yayami ɔmɛ a yi nɛ a hia kɛ je hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ a mi kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Mo ji Mawu Bi ɔ nɛ.” Nɛ akɛnɛ a le kaa lɛ ji Kristo ɔ he je ɔ, e fia a nya ma ke a pee dii.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />E nɔ jena mɔtu mla a, e ho nga a nɔ ya. Nɛ ni ɔmɛ hla lɛ hluu kɛ ya si a ya na lɛ nɛ a kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e ko je a he se e hi a ngɔ ngɛ Kapernaum. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Se Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “E sa kaa ma fiɛ Matsɛyemi ɔ he Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ he kpahi hulɔ, ejakaa jamɛ a ni tsumi ɔ he nɛ a tsɔ mi kɛ ba ngɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e tsa e si kpami kɛ fiɛmi ɔ nɔ ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ ngɛ Yudea he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsɛ kaseli komɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ligbi ko ɔ, e ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ Genesaret taku ɔ nya nɛ nihi fuu ba bua wo e he ngɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ tue bue. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Nɛ e na kaa lɛ mi guhi enyɔ ngɛ taku ɔ nya, nɛ hɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ a ya amɛ a he fɔe. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />E sɛ lɛ ɔ kake mi nɛ e de Simon nɛ ji lɛtsɛ ɔ ke e hlui lɛ ɔ kɛ ya pa a nɔ bɔɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e hi si ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi kɛ fiɛ ha asafo ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Benɛ e fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ ni ɔmɛ ni ta a, e de Simon ke, “Jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ mo hlui lɛ ɔ kɛ ya he nɛ kuɔ bɔɔ nɛ o ya pue ya a ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ o maa gbe lo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simon de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, wa hɛ nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ nɛ ɔ tsuo nɛ wa nɛ nɔ́ ko; se nɛ mo nɛ o de nɛ ɔ, wa ma pa ka hyɛ ha.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nɛ a fɔ ya a, a gbe lo fuu nɛ ya a maa ho gbami ya. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a fɔ nine tsɛ lɛ mi gu kaketsɛ ɔ mi bi ɔmɛ nɛ a hlui a lɛ ɔ kɛ ba na mɛ. Nɛ bɔɔ se ɔ, lɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ tsuo hyi kɛ lo nɛ a maa ho mumi ya.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Benɛ Simon Petro na nɔ nɛ ba a, e ba kpla si ngɛ Yesu hɛ mi nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, moo sa kɛ ya se bɔɔ, ejakaa yayami peelɔ nɛ he tsɔ we ji mi, nɛ e sɛ nɛ ma sa kɛ su o he.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Ejakaa lo ɔ nɛ a gbe ɔ hiɛmi ɔ pee e kɛ e lɛ mi bi ɔmɛ kulaa a hɛ mi yaa, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />nɛ ja a nɔuu e he piɛli Yakobo kɛ Yohane nɛ ji Zebedeo bi ɔmɛ hu a nya kpɛ a he. Yesu ha Petro heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Koo ye gbeye, kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi ke yaa nɛ ɔ, o maa hɛ nimli.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Benɛ a ba kple ɔ, a si a lɛ ɔmɛ kɛ a mi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ba nyɛɛ Yesu se.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsa nihi fuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Yesu ya slaa kɔpe ko nɛ e na nyumu ko nɛ ngɛ hiɔ tsu nue wawɛɛ. Benɛ nyumu ɔ na Yesu ɔ, e kpla si ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ e wo e hɛ mi ngɔ bu si nɛ e kpa lɛ pɛɛ nɛ e de ke, “Ke o suɔ ɔ, o ma nyɛ tsa ye hiɔ nɛ ɔ ha mi nɛ ye he ma tsɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu bɔle e nine nɛ e ta hiɔtsɛ ɔ he nɛ e de lɛ ke, “I suɔ, mo na he wami.” Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, nɔmlɔ ɔ na he wami. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Nɛ e de lɛ ke, e ko sɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba nɛ ɔ ha nɔ ko, se mohu e ya amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ e wo e he kɛ ya tsɔɔ osɔfo ɔ nɛ e ya sã bɔ nɛ a to ngɛ Mose mlaa a nya a, nɛ e kɛ tsɔɔ kaa e na he wami. <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Jehanɛ ɔ Yesu biɛ pɛ ngɛ nyakpɛ ni nɛ e ngɛ tsue ɔ he nɛ nihi fuu ba e ngɔ ba bu lɛ tue; nɛ e tsa hiɔtsɛmɛ fuu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Se be tsuaa be ɔ, e jee zaa kɛ yaa nga a nɔ nɛ e ya sɔleɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ligbi ɔ ko benɛ e ngɛ ni tsɔɔe ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ ekomɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ ekomɛ hii si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. E peeɔ kaa a je Galilea kɛ Yudea kɔpekɔpe ɔmɛ kɛ Yerusalem hu kɛ ba pue si ligbi ɔ. Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ tsami mumi ɔ he wami ba e nɔ wawɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kɛkɛ benɛ a maa hyɛ ɔ, a na ni komɛ nɛ a wo nɔ ko nɛ e ku nɛ e hwɔɔ si ngɛ sa nɔ kɛ ma. A bɔ mɔde kaa a ma wo hiɔtsɛ ɔ kɛ gu ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ ba fɔ Yesu hɛ mi lo, se a nɛ blɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a wo hiɔtsɛ ɔ kɛ kuɔ tsu ɔ nɛ a hia tsu ɔ yi mi nɛ a kple lɛ si kɛ e sa a kɛ gu lejɛ ɔ kɛ ba fɔ si ngɛ Yesu hɛ mi ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Benɛ Yesu na nihi nɛ wo hiɔtsɛ ɔ kɛ ba a a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ, e de hiɔtsɛ ɔ ke, “Ye huɛ, a wo o he yayami ɔmɛ ngɔ ke mo!”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Munyu nɛ ɔ nɛ e tu kikɛ ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ bi a he ke, “Mɛnɔ nɛ Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ susu kaa e ji? Musu bɔmi munyu ji nɛ ɔ nɛ! Mawu se ɔ nɛɛ, mɛnɔ hu ma nyɛ wo yayami ngɔ ke?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Se Yesu le nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ susue ɔ nɛ e ha mɛ heto nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ e hine musu bɔmi munyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Te nɔ́ nɛ wa pe e nyɛmi nɛɛ, kaa a ma de ke a wo e he yayami ngɔ ke lɛ, aloo kaa a ma tsa lɛ? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Se jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ i ma wo hiɔ tsami kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ paa kaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ngɛ he wami kɛ he blɔ ngɛ zugba a nɔ nɛ e woɔ yayami kɛ kee.” Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ nɛ e de nɔmlɔ nɛ ku kɛ pue si ɔ ke, “Moo te nɛ o wo o sa a nɛ o ho we mi ya, ejakaa a tsa mo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Nɛ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ɔ, nɔmlɔ nɛ e ninehi kɛ e nanehi gbo ɔ te da si nɛ e wo e sa a nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e nyɛɛ kɛ ho we mi ya nɛ e ngɛ Mawu yi jee. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Nɔ nɛ ɔ pee nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ gbeye kɛ nyakpɛ nɛ a wo yi jemi kɛ ha Mawu nɛ a de ke, “Mwɔnɛ nɛ ɔ wa na nyakpɛ ni.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Nɛ pee se benɛ Yesu je ma a mi kɛ yaa a, e na jua tsulɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ Levi ɔ nɛ e hii si ngɛ jua tsumi he ɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Moo nyɛɛ ye se.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Nane ɔ nɔ nɔuu nɛ Levi te si nɛ e je nɔ tsuaa nɔ he nɛ e nyɛɛ Yesu se.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Pee se ɔ, Levi tsɛ Yesu okplɔɔ ngɛ e we ɔ mi nɛ e tsɛ a bi jua tsuli ɔmɛ kɛ ni kpahi fuu ni yemi ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ bi Yesu munyuhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Se enɛ ɔ dɛ ha Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ kaa Yesu hii si nɛ e kɛ jua tsuli nɛ ji ojo fiali kɛ nimli yayami nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ ni yee, nɛ a kã e kaseli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi saminya ngɛ enɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Se Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Tsopatsɛ he hia we nɔ nɛ ngɛ kpakpataa; hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ nɛ tsopa peelɔ he hia. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />I bɛ ngɛ dali a he, se mohu nɔ tɔli kɛ yayami peeli a he nɛ i ba ngɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na tsui tsakemi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Nɛ a pa bi lɛ ke, “Kɛ e peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ Yohane kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ a kaseli ɔmɛ pɔɔ ngma himi kɛ sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami, se o kaseli ɔmɛ lɛɛ be tsuaa be nɛ ɔ a ngɛ ni yee nɛ a ngɛ ni nue ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ na nɔ ko nɛ e bua jɔ nɛ e hi ngma hyɛ lo? Nɛ mɛnɔ nɛ e hii ngma ngɛ yo kpeemi okplɔɔ he? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Se be ma nɛ a ma wo yotsɛ ɔ kɛ je a he nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi loko ji a maa hi ngma.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ e de ke, “Mɛnɔ hu nɛ e woɔ bo he nya kɛ taa bo momo? Ke a pee ja a, tsa pi bo he ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ a ngɛ dae, se mohu bo ɔ he nɛ a ta a hu maa pee yayaa. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Nɛ nɔ ko wo we wai he kɛ wui tɔ momo mi, ejakaa ke a pee ja a, wai he ɔ ma pɛ tɔ momo ɔ nɛ wai ɔ ma pue si. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Wai he ɔ, tɔ he mi nɛ a kɛ woɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko nu wai momo ɔ, e bi we wai he si hu. Nɔ nɛ a deɔ ji, ‘Wai momo hi pe wai he.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ Nutsɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ eko ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ya gu blɛfo ngmɔ komɛ a mi nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ kpɔ blɛfo ɔ eko nɛ a hluɛ bɔni kpemi.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Farisi bi komɛ ka a hɛ mi nɛ a de ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ mlaa a nɔ tɔe? Nyɛ be he blɔ ngɛ mlaa a nya kaa nyɛ tsuɔ ni ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu ha Farisi bi ɔmɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Anɛ nyɛ kane we Ngmami ɔ lo? Nyɛ kane we nɔ nɛ Matsɛ David pee benɛ hwɔ ngɛ e ke e we bi ɔmɛ yee ɔ lo? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Kaa e sɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e ya muɔ abolo nɛ a kɛ maa Mawu hɛ mi ɔ, nɛ osɔfo ɔmɛ pɛ nɛ a ngɛ he blɔ nɛ a yeɔ ɔ, nɛ e ye nɛ e ha e we bi ɔmɛ hu eko nɛ a ye ɔ lo?” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Nɛ Yesu de kɛ fia se ke, “Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ngɛ he wami ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ tete nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Hejɔɔmi Ligbi kpa ko nɔ hu e ya ngɛ ni tsɔɔe ngɛ kpe he ɔ nɛ nyumu ko ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ e hiɔ nine gbo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ bɔni lɛ hwɔɔmi kaa e ma tsa hiɔtsɛ ɔ lo bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na nɔ ko nɔ nɛ a da nɛ a po e nya, ejakaa ligbi ɔ hine Hejɔɔmi Ligbi.<verse eid="LUK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Yesu na a juɛmi momoomo. Se e tsɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke e te si nɛ e ba da si ngɛ he nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa na lɛ ngɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ ke, “I ngɛ munyu ko nɛ i suɔ nɛ ma bi nyɛ. Anɛ e da kaa a pee kpakpa aloo a pee yayami ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ? E hi kaa a he nɔ yi wami aloo a kpata e hɛ mi?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu plɛ nɛ e hyɛ a hɛ mi kakaaka kɛ kpe, kɛkɛ nɛ e de hiɔtsɛ ɔ ke, “Moo bɔle o nine ɔ.” Nɛ e bɔle e nine ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ e nine ɔ mi wa kaa kaketsɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Se enɛ ɔ puɛ e he nyɛli ɔmɛ a tsui nɛ a na e he abofu nɛ a bɔni ga hlami wo e he nɛ a tane e yi.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kaseli ɔmɛ a tsɛmi kɛ a ni tsɔɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e kɛ we nɛ e ho yoku ɔmɛ a nɔ ya nɛ e ya sɔle nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ kɛ je nanɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Benɛ je na a, e tsɛ e se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ kɛ ba bua nɛ e hla a kpɛti ni nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ e wo mɛ ngɔ pee e kaseli ɔmɛ a nya dali. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14-16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14-16" />Mɛ ji: Simon, nɔ nɛ e wo lɛ ke Petro ɔ, Andrea nɛ ji Simon nyɛmi ɔ, Yakobo, Yohane, Filipo, Bartolomeo, Mateo, Toma, Yakobo, Alfeo bi ɔ, Simon, nɔ nɛ e biɛ kpa hu ji Zelote, nɛ e sisi ji “Hɛ dɔ” ɔ, Yuda nɛ ji Yakobo bi ɔ, kɛ Yuda Iskariot, nɔ nɛ pee se nɛ e tsɔɔ Yesu se blɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:14-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Benɛ a kple si kɛ je yoku ɔ nɔ ɔ, a ba da si ngɛ magbɛ ko nɔ nɛ nimli babauu ba bua wo Yesu kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ e hla a kɛ e se nyɛɛli kpa amɛ a he. A ji nihi nɛ je Yudea kɛ Yerusalem kɛ Tiro kɛ Zidon wo nya ma amɛ a mi tɔɔ kɛ ba nɛ a ba bu Yesu tue nɛ e tsa a hiɔhi ha mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Nɛ e hia mumi yayamihi ngɛ nihi fuu a mi. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ bɔ mɔde kaa e maa ta Yesu he, ejakaa ke e ngɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ tsae ɔ, he wami jee e mi nɛ ke mo nɔ ɔ ta e he ɔ, e he wami ɔ sɛɔ o mi, kɛkɛ mo hu o na he wami. <verse eid="LUK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu plɛ e he kɛ kpee e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:20">“A jɔɔ nyɛ nihi nɛ nyɛ be nɔ ko ɔmɛ, ejakaa nyɛ nɔ ji Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />“A jɔɔ nyɛ nihi nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ hwɔ ngɛ nyɛ yee ɔ, ejakaa e maa wo nyɛ nya ngma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:21">“A jɔɔ nyɛ nihi nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ nyɛ ngɛ ya foe, ejakaa nyɛ ma ba muɔ kɛ bua jɔmi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“A jɔɔ nyɛ ke ji nihi maa nyɛ nyɛ, a ma jɛ nyɛ, a ma je nyɛ we nɛ a ma puɛ nyɛ biɛ ngɛ ye he. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Nyɛ nya nɛ nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ kaa nyɛ ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ nae, ejakaa nyɛ ngɛ hiɔwo ngua ko hwɔɔ se ngɛ hiɔwe. Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ a pee blema gbali ɔmɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Se due ha nihi nɛ ngɛ kpɔtɔɔ mi amlɔ nɛ ɔ; hwɔɔ se bua jɔmi ko be ha mɛ hu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />“A kle nɛ a plɔke mwɔnɛ ɔ; se anɔkuale ji kaa hwɔ yobu ko ma ba ye mɛ pee se. Mwɔnɛ ɔ muɔ ngɛ a nya, se a muɔ ɔ ma ba plɛ ya. <verse eid="LUK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Kpoo ha nyɛ ke ji kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ nyɛ yi jee nɛ a ngɛ nyɛ he munyu kpakpa tue mwɔnɛ ɔ; ejakaa ja a nɛ a jeɔ lakpa gbali ɔmɛ a yi daa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Nyɛ tsuo nyɛɛ bu nɔ nɛ i ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ tue saminya. Nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he nyɛli. Nɛ nyɛɛ pee nihi nɛ nyɛɛ nyɛ ɔ kpakpa. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Nyɛɛ sɔle kaa e hi ha nihi nɛ gbiɛɛ nyɛ ɔmɛ; nɛ nyɛ bi Mawu gbaami kɛ ha nihi nɛ peeɔ nyɛ yayami ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />“Ke nɔ ko gba o tue mi ma a, mo ha nɛ e gba kaketsɛ ɔ hu. Ke nɔ ko kpɔ o yi nɔ tade ɔ, mo je sisi nɔ ɔ hu ngɔ piɛ he kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Ke nɔ ko bi mo nɔ ko ɔ, mo ha lɛ. Nɛ ke nɔ ko wo nɔ ko ngɛ o dɛ ɔ, koo di se hu. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Nɔ nɛ o suɔ nɛ nihi nɛ a pee ha mo ɔ, mo hu moo pee ja a kɛ ha mɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Ke ji nihi nɛ suɔ mo ɔ kɛkɛ a sane o suɔ ɔ, mɛni yi jemi o susu kaa o ma na? Nihi nɛ li Mawu ɔ hu peeɔ ja a nɔuu. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Nɛ ke ji kaa nihi nɛ peeɔ mo kpakpa pɛ nɛ mo hu o peeɔ mɛ kpakpa a nɛɛ, anɛ e ji nyakpɛ nɔ ko lo? Wɔ jali tete peeɔ ja. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Nɛ ke ji o paa sika kɛ haa nihi nɛ o le kaa a ma ba ha mo ɔ nɛɛ, mɛni kpakpa o pee? Ejakaa nihi nɛ a yi kpɛti wa saminya tete paa sika kɛ haa a huɛmɛ, ejakaa a le kaa a ma ba to nane mi ha mɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />“I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he nyɛli nɛ nyɛɛ pee mɛ kpakpa. Nyɛɛ pa mɛ nɔ nɛ nyɛ ko hyɛ blɔ kaa a ba to nane mi ha nyɛ. Ke nyɛ pee ja a, nyɛ hiɔwo nɛ nyɛ ma na kɛ je hiɔwe ɔ maa kle; nɛ a maa na nyɛ kaa Mawu bimɛ niinɛ, ejakaa e dlooɔ yi kpɛti wali kɛ nihi nɛ li sina tete po.”<verse eid="LUK 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />“Nyɛɛ na mɔbɔ kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ Tsɛ ɔ naa nyɛ mɔbɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Nyɛ ko kojo, nɛ nyɛ ko bu fɔ konɛ a ko kojo nyɛ nɛ a bu nyɛ fɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />“Ke nyɛ haa nɔ nɔ ɔ, nihi ma ha nyɛ hu nɔ fuu kɛ be nɔ. A maa wo ha nyɛ nɛ e ma hyi kɛ be nɔ nɛ a maa nyɛ nɔ nɛ a ma pue nɔ ekohu. Ejakaa nɔ ka nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ ka ha nihi ɔ, zaa jio, agbo jio, jamɛ a nɔ ka nɔ ɔ nɛ a ma kɛ ka ha nyɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu ya nɔ nɛ e bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ níhi nɛ e ngɛ mɛ dee ɔ nya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:39">“Nyɛ na hɛ yuyuilɔ nɛ tsɔɔ hɛ yuyuilɔ kpa blɔ hyɛ lo? Mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ tsuo a ma ya nɔ muɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ kaselɔ maa le ni pe e Tsɔɔlɔ? Se kaselɔ tsuaa kaselɔ nɛ ma wlua e he kɛ kase ni ɔ, e ma ba le ni kaa e tsɔɔlɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Kɛ o peeɔ kɛ naa tso fɛfɛ nyafii nɛ sɛ o nyɛmi hɛ ngmɛ mi kɛɛ, nɛ ji e tɔmi bɔbɔyoo ko ɔ, be mi nɛ tso agbo nɛ hɔɔ si ngɛ mo nitsɛ o hɛ ngmɛ ɔ mi ɔ lɛɛ o nɛ lɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Kɛ o ma plɛ kɛ de o nyɛmi ke, ‘Ma je nɔ ngɛ o hɛ ngmɛ mi ɔ ha mo,’ be mi nɛ tso puɛ ngɛ mo nitsɛ o hɛ ngmɛ mi kɛɛ? Osatotsɛ, moo hia plai ɔ ngɛ o hɛ ngmɛ mi kekle, kɛkɛ o maa hyɛ nɔ, nɛ o ma nyɛ ma je nɔ nɛ sɛ e hɛ ngmɛ mi ɔ ha lɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Tso kpakpa tsa wui yiblii yaya; nɛ tso yaya hu wui yiblii kpakpa. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Tso fɛɛ tso ɔ, e wowoe nɛ a kɛ leɔ e mi tso. Mɛnɔ hu nɛ e hlaa mangoo ngɛ akutu tso nɔ, aloo kpɛte ngɛ agowa tso nɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Nɔmlɔ kpakpa jee tsui kpakpa mi kɛ tsuɔ nɔ́ kpakpa. Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ nɔ yayami pɛ nɛ nɔmlɔ yayami tsuɔ. Nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ ko e tsui mi ɔ, lɔ ɔ nɛ jeɔ kpo ngɛ e nya mi munyu mi.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, kɛɛ peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ nyɛ tsɛɛ mi ‘Nutsɔ’ se nyɛ bui mi tue ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ baa ye ngɔ nɛ e nuɔ ye munyu ɔ, nɛ e yeɔ nɔ ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />e ngɛ kaa nɔ nɛ e gba muɔ nɛ e muɔ tɛ wo mi loko ji e fia gbogbo ngɔ ma nɔ. Nyu ko be nɛ maa hule jamɛ a tsu ɔ, ejakaa a to tsu ɔ sisi saminya ngɛ tɛ nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Se nihi nɛ nuɔ ye munyu ɔmɛ se a yi nɔ ɔ, a ngɛ kaa nɔ nɛ e tui tsu ɔ sisi loko ji e fia gbogbo ɔ ngɔ fɔ nɔ. Ke nyu sɛ jamɛ a tsu ɔ sisi ɔ, e maa hule lɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Nyakpɛ okadihi enyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Benɛ Yesu tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ se ɔ, e kpale kɛ ho Kapernaum ya.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />E ba mi kaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, Roma sojahi lafa a nyatsɛ ɔ sɔmɔlɔ nɛ buu lɛ saminya a be he wami kulaa nɛ e fɔɔ si ngɛ gbenɔ muɔ nya. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Benɛ e nu Yesu he ɔ, e tsɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ekomɛ konɛ a ya na Yesu nɛ e ba tsa hiɔtsɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Nikɔtɔma amɛ ya na Yesu nɛ a je sojahi lafa a nyatsɛ ɔ yi ha lɛ saminya nɛ a kpa lɛ pee kaa e bɔ mɔde nɛ e ya hyɛ e hiɔtsɛ ɔ ha lɛ. A de lɛ ke e hine a nɔmlɔ kpakpa saminya. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ejakaa e suɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a sane, nɛ lɛ po nɛ e ma a kpe he ɔ ha mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu kplɛɛ nɛ e kɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ pue blɔ. Se benɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ a maa su sojahi lafa a nyatsɛ ɔ we ɔ mi ɔ, a kɛ e huɛmɛ nɛ e tsɔ ɔ ya kpe nɛ a de lɛ nɔ́ nɛ e de mɛ ɔ ke, “Awetsɛ, koo na nɔ nɛ o de ke o ma ye we ɔ mi, ejakaa e ji he ko nɛ sɛ mo. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je hu nɛ i bui ye he kaa i sa nɔ nɛ baa o ngɔ ɔ nɛ. Moo lɛɛ moo tu o nya mi munyu kɛkɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔ ma na he wami. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />I le enɛ ɔ, ejakaa i ngɛ ye nikɔtɔmahi nɛ yeɔ ye nɔ, nɛ ami hu i ngɛ sisi bimɛ. Nɛ ye nya mi munyu nɛ i ma tu nɔ nɛ ɔ ke, ‘Moo ya!’ Kɛkɛ e yaa. ‘Moo ba!’ Kɛkɛ e ma. Nɛ ke i de ye sɔmɔlɔ ke, ‘Moo pee enɛ ɔ’ ɔ, kɛkɛ e pee.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Munyu nɛ ɔ pee Yesu nyakpɛ. E plɛ nɛ e de asafo nɛ nyɛɛ e se ɔ ke, “I ngɛ nyɛ dee faii kaa, ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti ngɛ Israel kulaa a, i kɛ nɔ ko nɛ hɛɛ kikɛmɛ a hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ɔ eko kpi hyɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Nɛ benɛ sojahi lafa a nyatsɛ ɔ huɛ ɔmɛ kpale kɛ ba we ɔ mi ɔ, a ba na kaa sɔmɔlɔ ɔ na he wami kulaa.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e kɛ we nɛ Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ho kɔpe ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Nain ɔ ya. Nɛ nihi fuu nyɛɛ e se kaa bɔ nɛ he tsuaa he nɛ e gu nɛ a fieɔ e se ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Kɔpe ɔ agbo ɔ nya nɛ a su pɛ nɛ a kɛ nihi kpe nɛ a wo nɔ ko kɛ yaa gɔ mi. Niheyo nɛ gbo nɛ ɔ e nyɛ ɔ yalɔyo i, nɛ e nyɛ ɔ bi kake too ji lɛ; nɛ nihi fuu nɛ je ngmlaa ha lɛ ɔ nyɛɛ gbogboe ɔ se.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Benɛ Nutsɔ ɔ na yo ɔ nɛ e bi gbo ɔ, e ni pee lɛ mɔbɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ko fo ya!” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />E nyɛɛ kɛ ho gbogboe daka a he ya nɛ e ya ta he, nɛ nɔ tlooli ɔmɛ ho da si. Kɛkɛ nɛ e de ke, “Niheyo, moo te si!”<verse eid="LUK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Niheyo ɔ te si hi si nɛ e bɔni munyu tumi. Yesu wo lɛ ngɔ ha e nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Ni ɔmɛ ye gbeye nɛ a wo sina kɛ yi jemi ngɔ ha Mawu nɛ a de ke, “Anɔkuale ji kaa gbalɔ ngua ko te si ngɛ wa kpɛti. Mwɔnɛ ɔ wa na Mawu nine nya ni tsumi paa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nɛ a nu nɔ́ nɛ e tsu jamɛ a ligbi ɔ he ngɛ Yudea zugba a mi kɛ he kpahi tsuo.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kɛ Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />E kɛ we nɛ Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ kaseli ɔmɛ hu nu nihi nɛ Yesu ngɛ tsue ɔ he nɛ a ya bɔ Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Nɛ Yohane tsɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni enyɔ nɛ e tsɔ mɛ ke a ya bi Yesu ke, “Anɛ mo ji Yiwamihelɔ nɛ ma a, aloo waa hyɛ nɔ kpa blɔ lo?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Nɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ ba Yesu ngɔ nɛ a ba de lɛ ke, “Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ ke wa ba bi mo ke, ‘Mo ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ nɛ ma a, aloo waa hyɛ nɔ kpa blɔ lo?’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Jamɛ a ngmlɛfia a nɔ nɔuu ɔ, a ba na Yesu nɛ ngɛ hiɔtsɛmɛ slɔɔtohi tsae, nihi nɛ ngɛ nyɛɛe ngɛ gbongu mi, hɛ ngmɛ yuyuili kɛ nihi nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ nɔ́ dee ha mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛɛ ya nɛ nyɛ ya bɔ Yohane nihi nɛ nyɛ ba nu kɛ níhi nɛ nyɛ ba na amɛ tsuo kaa, gbongu mi nyɛɛli ngɛ nyɛɛe tutuutu, hɛ ngmɛ yuyuili ngɛ nɔ hyɛe, tsitsɛmɛ a he ngɛ tsɔe, tue kpokutsɛmɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nue. A ngɛ gbogboehi si tlee, nɛ a ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe kɛ ngɛ ohiafohi tsɔɔe. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Nɛ nyɛ pa de Yohane ke, ‘A maa jɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ ye mi ɔ be laae.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Benɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ je ɔ, Yesu bi asafo ɔ ke, “Mɛni nɛ nyɛ ya Yudea nga a nɔ ya hyɛ ɔ? Nɔ́ ko kɛkɛ kaa nga nɔ gla nɛ kɔɔhiɔ ngɛ fiae kɛ ngɛ yae ngɛ bae lo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Aloo nɔ ko nɛ dla e he saminya nɛ nyɛ ya hyɛ ɔ? He dlali kɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ kpɔtɔɔ mi ɔ, matsɛmɛ a we nɛ a naa mɛ ngɛ, tsa pi nga nɔ nɛ a hii. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Aloo gbalɔ nɛ nyɛ ya na? I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, nyɛ ya na nɔ ko nɛ pe gbalɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Lɛ e he munyu nɛ a tu ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi ke, ‘I ngɛ ye tsɔlɔ ɔ tsɔe kɛ se o hlami nɛ e ya dla blɔ ha mo’ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ngɛ yihi a bimɛ a kpɛti ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo ɔ, nɔ ko be nɛ kle pe Yohane, se nɔ nɛ ji nyafii pe kulaa ngɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi ɔ e kle pe lɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Nihi kulaa nɛ nu Yohane fiɛmi ɔ, a ti nihi nɛ ji jua tsuli tete nu he ngɛ a mi kaa dalɔ ji Mawu, nɛ a ha nɛ Yohane baptisi mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ja Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ Mose mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ pɛ. Mɛɛ lɛɛ a kua Mawu yi wami hemi blɔ nɛ e je ha nɔmlɔ adesa a, nɛ a ha we nɛ Yohane nɛ e baptisi mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Nɛ Yesu bi ke, “Mɛni ma de ngɛ nimli kaa kikɛ ɔmɛ a he? Nɛ mɛni he ma wo mɛ kɛ to? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />A ngɛ kaa jokuɛwi nɛ ngɛ kotlokoo fiɛe ngɛ ma nɔ nɛ a ngɛ a bi dee ke, ‘Wa wo fiɛmi do ha nyɛ se nyɛ dui; wa wo ya hu, se nyɛɛ kɛ wɔ fo we.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ejakaa Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ haa hwɔ, nɛ e nui da nya wawɛ ko, nɛ nyɛ de ke, ‘Mumi yayami ngɛ e mi.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Ami lɛɛ i yeɔ ni nɛ i nuu wai, nɛ nyɛ de ke, ‘Yimayitsɛ ji lɛ, nɛ e kɛ nimli yayami se bɔɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Se nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ maa na paa kaa nyɛ munyu ɔmɛ dɛ tɛ kake nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simon tsɛ Yesu ni yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Farisi bi ɔmɛ eko tsɛ Yesu ni yemi ngɛ e we mi nɛ e ya. Benɛ e hii si ngɛ niye ni ɔ se ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />yo ajuamatsɛ ko nɛ na le kaa Yesu ba jamɛ a we ɔ mi ɔ wo nu je via he jua wawɛ tɔ kake kɛ to e dɛ kɛ ba lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Nɛ benɛ a ngɛ ni ɔ yee ɔ, yo nɛ ɔ ya je Yesu se, nɛ e ya kpla si ngɛ e nane he. E fo ya ngɔ pue Yesu nane nɔ nɛ e wo e yi bwɔmi kɛ tsu, e fiɔ e nane he, nɛ e plɛ nu je via a ngɔ pue e nane nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Benɛ okplɔɔ tsɛlɔ ɔ na nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ, e susu ngɛ e yi mi ke, “Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ faii kaa nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ pi gbalɔ; kaa Mawu nɛ tsɔ lɛ niinɛ jinɛ e ko le yo mimi nɛ ba ngɛ ni nɛ ɔ tsue ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛ lɛ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Simon, ma bi mo nɔ́ ko.” Simon ha lɛ heto ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, mo bi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Nɔ ko pa sika ha nihi enyɔ. E pa maa pee sidi lafa enuɔ kɛ ha nɔ kake, nɛ e pa maa pee sidi nyingmi enuɔ kɛ ha nɔ kpa a hu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Se a ti nɔ ko nyɛ we e hiɔ ɔ nɛ e wo, nɛ e wo hiɔ ɔ ngɔ ke mɛ tsuo. Nihi enyɔ nɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ te nɛ maa suɔ e sane saminya nɛɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simon ha heto nɛ e de ke, “E peeɔ mi kaa nɔ nɛ hiɔ ɔ kle ɔ.” Yesu de lɛ ke, “O heto ɔ da.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ hyɛ yo ɔ, nɛ e de Simon ke, “O na yo nɛ ɔ nɛ kplaa si ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ lo? Benɛ i ba o we ɔ mi ɔ o ha we mi nyu nɛ ma kɛ fɔ bunyuku ɔ ngɛ ye nane he, se lɛɛ e wo e vo nyu kɛ fɔ ye nane he, nɛ e wo e yi bwɔmi kɛ tsu vo nyu ɔ ngɛ ye nane he. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Kusumi nya fiɔmi ngami nɛ wetsɛ kɛ nyaa e nubwɔ he ɔ hu o kɛ nga we mi. Se yo nɛ ɔ lɛɛ kɛ je benɛ i ba sɛ o we nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, e fiɔ ye nane he pe si abɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Kusumi nya a, e sa kaa o ha mi nu nɛ ma kɛ wo ye yi mi. Se enɛ ɔ hu o pee we ha mi. Yo nɛ ɔ wo nu je via nɛ he jua wa nɛ ɔ kɛ pɔ ye nane! <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a wo e yayami fuu ɔmɛ ngɔ ke lɛ, ejakaa e je suɔmi agbo kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ mi. Nɔ nɛ a wo bɔbɔyoo ngɔ ke lɛ ɔ, e suɔmi ɔ he pi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Nɛ Yesu de yo ɔ ke, “A wo o he yayami ɔmɛ ngɔ ke mo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Kɛkɛ nɛ ni ɔmɛ nɛ hii si ngɛ okplɔɔ ɔ he ɔ de a he ke, “Mɛnɔ po ji nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ e nyɛɛ nɛ e woɔ nihi a he yayami kɛ kee mɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Nɛ Yesu plɛ nɛ e de yo ɔ ke, “O hemi kɛ yemi he o yi wami; moo ya ngɛ he jɔmi mi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ni dulɔ ɔ he sane ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e ke we nɛ Yesu wo e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ kɛ bɔni Galilea ma amɛ kɛ kɔpe tsɔwi ɔmɛ a nɔ kpami ngɛ fiɛe ke Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Nɛ yi komɛ nɛ e tsa mɛ kɛ yi komɛ hu nɛ e hia mumi yayami kɛ je a mi kaa Maria Magdalena, nɔ nɛ e hia mumi yayamihi kpaago kɛ je e mi ɔ hu piɛ a he. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Kɛ Yohana, nɛ ji Matsɛ Herode tsɔlɔ nɔkɔtɔma nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Kusa, nɛ ngɛ e we ɔ nya a, e yo, kɛ Susana kɛ ni kpahi fuu nɛ a jee a kotoku mi kɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ɔ hu piɛ he.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Ligbi ko nɛ nihi fuu je hehihehi kɛ ba bua nɛ a ngɛ lɛ tue bue ɔ, e bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />E de mɛ ke, “Ngmɔ hulɔ ko ya ni dumi ngɛ e ngmɔ mi, nɛ benɛ e ngɛ wu ɔ fiae ɔ, ekomɛ ya pue blɔ nɔ nɛ nihi naa nɔ nɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi ya kukuɔ nɛ a ye. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ekomɛ ya pue zu nɛ mi kuɛ nɔ, ejakaa tɛ ngɛ zu ɔ mi. Wu ɔmɛ puɛ se e kɛ we nɛ a gbo, ejakaa a nɛ nyu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Wu ɔ ekomɛ ya pue miohi a mi nɛ e kɛ we nɛ mio ɔmɛ gbe mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ekomɛ lɛɛ a ya pue zugba kpakpa nɔ nɛ a puɛ nɛ a wo yiblii fuu ngwɔ he lafa.” Benɛ e bu abɛ ɔ ta a, e de ni ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ lɛ tue bue ɔ ke, “Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue nɛ e ma kɛ nu ɔ, e nu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />E kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ abɛ ɔ sisi.<verse eid="LUK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />E ha heto nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ lɛɛ Mawu ha nyɛ he blɔ kaa nyɛɛ le abɛ nɛ ɔmɛ a sisi, ejakaa a tsɔɔ nihi nɛ kɔɔ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he. Se ni nɛ ɔmɛ lɛɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ blema gbali ɔmɛ gba ngɔ fɔ si ɔ, a nuɔ abɛ ɔ, se a nui sisi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“E sisi ji nɛ, wu ɔ ji Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ a ngɔ ha nimli adesahi ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Nane blɔ ɔ nɛ wu ɔmɛ ya pue nɔ ɔ daa si ha nɔmlɔ tsui nɛ wa. Kikɛmɛ a tsɛ ɔmɛ a nuɔ munyu ɔ se Abosiami ba juɔ munyu ɔ kɛ jee, nɛ e hí a mi konɛ a he nɛ a ye nɛ a na yi wami hemi. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Tɛ zugba a daa si kɛ ha nihi nɛ nuɔ munyu ɔ kɛ bua jɔmi se munyu ɔ hi a mi nɛ e maa wa, ejakaa a be sipoku. A le kaa anɔkuale munyu i, nɛ a heɔ yeɔ, se ke haomi ba na mɛ pɛ a hɛ je munyu ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Wu ɔmɛ nɛ ya pue miohi a mi ɔ daa si kɛ ha nihi nɛ buɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ tue nɛ a heɔ yeɔ, se pee se ɔ, je mi ni nami kɛ haomi kɛ je mi bua jɔmi gbee munyu ɔ ngɛ a mi nɛ a nyɛ we nɛ a yeɔ kɛ buaa ni kpahi nɛ a he Manye Munyu ɔ ye.<verse eid="LUK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Se zugba kpakpa a ji tsui kpakpatsɛ ɔmɛ nɛ. A nuɔ munyu ɔ nɛ a pɛtɛɔ he nɛ a woɔ yiblii, nɛ a bɔɔ ni kpahi hulɔ nɛ mɛ hu a heɔ yeɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Be kpa hu e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ nɛ e suɔ kane nɛ e woɔ sowe ngɔ buɔ nɔ konɛ e ko tso? Kane ɔ, nɔ nɔ nɛ a kɛ maa konɛ e kpɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa be ko maa su nɛ a ma je nimli a tsui mi nɔ tsuaa nɔ kpo, nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ maa na faii. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ bu tue saminya. Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ ko ɔ, a maa piɛ he ha lɛ; nɛ nɔ nɛ be nɔ ko ɔ, bɔbɔyoo ɔ nɛ e ngɛ ɔ hu a ma he ngɛ e dɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ligbi ko ɔ, e nyɛ ke e nyɛminyumu ɔmɛ ba nɛ a ba na lɛ. Se Nɔmlɔ hiɛ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a nyɛ we nɛ a sɛ we ɔ mi he nɛ e ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Benɛ a de Yesu kaa a ngɛ kpo ɔ nɔ nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a na lɛ ɔ, nɔ nɛ e de ji.<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />“Ye nyɛ kɛ ye nyɛmimɛ ji ni nɛmɛ nɛ nuɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ a yeɔ nɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu jɔɔ wo nɔ kɔɔhiɔ he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ligbi ko ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ lɛ mi nɛ e de mɛ ke a hlui lɛ ɔ kɛ ho wo ɔ se ya. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Se benɛ a ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi kɛ yaa a, e ho ya kpasa si bɔɔ nɛ mahe nɔ e nɔ. E ngɛ mahe ɔ mi nɛ kɔɔhiɔ te nɛ nyu bɔni fiami kɛ ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi sɛe nɛ lɛ ɔ miɔ nɛ e ma butu.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />A sa fo kɛ ho he nɛ e hwɔɔ si ngɛ ɔ ya nɛ a ya tsiɛ lɛ nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, Nutsɔ, lɛ ɔ maa ho mumi ya!” E te si nɛ e nga kɔɔhiɔ ɔ yi nɛ e de ke, “Moo ngmɛ!” Kɛkɛ nɛ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ jɔɔ fiami nɛ wo ɔ ngmɛ dii. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Jije nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ ngɛ?” A ye gbeye, nɛ a bi a he ke, “Mɛnɔ po ji nɛ ɔ nɛ kɔɔhiɔ kɛ oslɔke tete buɔ lɛ tue ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, a ya su wo ɔ se ngɛ Gerasene bi ɔmɛ a zugba a nɔ ngɛ Galilea ha nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Benɛ e ngɛ kpo jee ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi pɛ nɛ nyumu godotsɛ ko je ma a mi kɛ lɛ ba kpe. Nyumu nɛ ɔ godo ɔ nya wa, nɛ e nyɛɛɔ he gu, nɛ gohi a mi ji he nɛ e hii. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Benɛ e na Yesu pɛ nɛ e hia ngmlaa nɛ e tsɔ fia si ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mɛni sane i kɛ mo ngɛ, mo Yesu hiɔwe lokoo Mawu ɔ Bi? I kpa mo pɛɛ, mo ko hao mi!”<verse eid="LUK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ejakaa Yesu bɔni mumi yayami ɔ yi ngami nɛ e je godotsɛ ɔ mi. Anɔkuale, nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ godo ɔ nya wa saminya bɔ nɛ ke a wo lɛ pã mi pohu e tsɔɔ ga amɛ nɛ e woɔ fo kɛ sɛɔ nga. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Kɛ a tsɛɛ mo kɛɛ?” Godotsɛ ɔ ha lɛ heto ke, “Asafo,” ejakaa mumi yayamihi nɛ ngɛ e mi ɔ a hiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Nɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ ngɛ Yesu pɛɛ kpae ke e ko je mɛ we kɛ ya wo muɔ nɛ mi kuɔ mi.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Kpotoo komɛ ngɛ ni yee ngɛ yoku ɔ he ngɛ a kasa nya nɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e ha mɛ he blɔ nɛ a ya sɛ a mi. Nɛ Yesu kplɛɛ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Kɛkɛ nɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ je nɔmlɔ ɔ mi nɛ a ya sɛ kpotoo ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, kpotoo ɔmɛ kulaa wo fo kɛ ya nɔ taku ɔ mi nɛ a gbo. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ni ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ lohwe ɔmɛ poe ɔ wo fo kɛ ho ma a mi ya ya bɔ ma mi bi ɔmɛ sane nɛ ba a.<verse eid="LUK 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />E kɛ we nɛ nihi fuu je ma a mi kɛ ba nɛ a ba hyɛ nɔ nɛ ba a ha. Nɛ a ba na godotsɛ ɔ kaa e hɛ mi tsɔ nɛ e ha bo nɛ e hii si kpoo ngɛ Yesu nane nya. Enɛ ɔ pee mɛ tsuo nyakpɛ saminya. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ na nɔ nɛ ba a, bɔ ma a mi tsɛ ɔmɛ bɔ nɛ Yesu plɛ kɛ tsa godotsɛ ɔ ha. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kpa Yesu pee kaa e je a ma a mi nɛ e ho, ejakaa gbeye nu mɛ. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e kpale sɛ lɛ ɔ mi nɛ e po pa a kɛ ho e se ya.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Nɔ ɔ nɛ e tsa lɛ ɔ kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e kɛ lɛ maa ya; se Yesu kplɛɛ we nɔ. Nɛ e de lɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Moo kpale kɛ ho o wekuli ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya nɛ o ya bɔ mɛ nyakpɛ ni nɛ Mawu tsu kɛ ha mo ɔ.” Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ho ya kpa ma a mi kulaa nɛ e fiɛ nyakpɛ nɔ́ agbo nɛ Yesu tsu kɛ ha lɛ ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɛ je gbenɔ mi kɛ ba wami mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Benɛ e ya su pa a se ɔ, ni ɔmɛ fua lɛ atuu, ejakaa a ngɛ lɛ mlɛe.<verse eid="LUK 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Nɛ nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yairo nɛ e ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe he ɔ nya nikɔtɔma amɛ eko ɔ ba nɛ e ba nɔ Yesu nane nya nɛ e kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e kɛ lɛ nɛ a ho e we mi ya. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Ejakaa e bi yoyo kake too nɛ ye jeha nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔ fɔɔ si nɛ e maa ho gbomi ya. Yesu kɛ lɛ gu ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ ho we ɔ mi ya. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Se benɛ a yaa a, yo ko nɛ muɔ ngɛ bee ngɛ e he jeha nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ sɔuu ji nɛ, nɛ e nyɛɛ tsopatsɛmɛ a nɔ hluu nɛ e dɛ mi ta se hiɔ ɔ jɔɛ ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />ba je Yesu se blɔ nɛ e ta e tade ɔ he, ejakaa e ngɛ hlae nɛ a tsa lɛ. Kɛkɛ nɛ amlɔ ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, muɔ ɔ jɔɔ bemi ngɛ e he. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu bi ke, “Mɛnɔ nɛ e ta ye he ɔ?” Se nɔ tsuaa nɔ ke e tɛ e he. Nɛ Petro de lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, mo nitsɛ o na kaa nimli ɔmɛ hiɛ kɛ bɔle mo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Nɔ ko je blɔ ta ye he, ejakaa i nu he kaa tsami he wami je ye mi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Benɛ yo ɔ na kaa Yesu le kaa e ta e he ɔ, e wo he kpokpomi kɛ ba kpla si ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ e de lɛ nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ e ta e he ngɛ ɔ; nɛ e tsɔɔ nya hu kaa amlɔ nɛ ɔ e na he wami. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Biyo, o hemi kɛ yemi tsa mo, yaa ngɛ he jɔmi mi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Benɛ Yesu kɛ yo ɔ ngɛ munyu ɔ tue ɔ nɔuu nɛ tsɔlɔ ko je Yairo we ɔ mi kɛ ba nɛ e ba de Yairo ke, “O biyo ɔ yi ta, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e he hia we kaa o hao Tsɔɔlɔ ɔ hu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Se benɛ Yesu nu sɛ ɔ nɛ tsɔlɔ ɔ ba de ɔ, e de bitsɛ ɔ ke, “Koo ye gbeye! Mo wo o hɛ kɛ fɔ ye nɔ nɛ e maa hi ha o biyo ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Benɛ a ya su we ɔ mi ɔ, Yesu ha we nɛ nɔ ko nɔ ko nɛ sɛ tsu ɔ mi he nɛ gbogboe ɔ ngɛ ɔ, ja lɛ nitsɛ kɛ Petro kɛ Yakobo kɛ Yohane kɛ biyo ɔ tsɛ kɛ e nyɛ pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Nihi ba hyi we ɔ mi fuu kɛ ya. Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ jɔɔ ya fomi, nɔ ɔ gbo we; mahe kɛkɛ nɛ e hwɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Se ni ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ muɔ lɛ nɛ a ye e he fɛu, ejakaa mɛɛ lɛɛ a le kaa biyo ɔ yi ta.<verse eid="LUK 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesu pɛtɛ bi ɔ nine he nɛ e tsɛ lɛ nɛ e de ke, “Biyo, moo te si!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, mumi kpale kɛ ba e mi nɛ e tu kɛ da si. Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha lɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ e ye.” <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Fɔli ɔmɛ a bua jɔ a he kɛ be nɔ. Se Yesu bɔ mɛ kɔkɔ ke a ko fiɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba a nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e nu.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Yesu tsɛ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ e ha mɛ he wami ngɛ mumi yayamihi a nɔ, nɛ a hia mɛ ngɛ nihi a mi, nɛ a tsa hiɔ fɛɛ hiɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Nɛ e tsɔ mɛ nɛ a ya fiɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ bami ɔ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ; nɛ a tsa hiɔtsɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />E de mɛ ke, “Nɛ nyɛ yaa nɛ ɔ, nyɛ ko de ke nyɛ maa hɛɛ kotoku loo dema tso loo niye ni loo sika loo tade kɛ piɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ wo ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ke nyɛ ya a, nyɛ ya to he kake pɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ke nyɛ ya ma ko mi nɛ nimli ɔmɛ ha we nyɛ hɛ mi ɔ, nyɛɛ kpale; nɛ ke nyɛ maa je ma a mi ɔ, nyɛ blɛ ma a mi zu nɛ du nyɛ nane si ɔ ngɔ pue si ha mɛ kɛ pee odase loko nyɛɛ je.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ hia blɔ nɛ a fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ ma amɛ a mi nɛ a tsa hiɔtsɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Herode kɛ ni ɔmɛ a nya kpɛ a he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Benɛ Herode nɛ ji amlaalo ɔ nu nyakpɛ ni slɔɔtohi nɛ Yesu ngɛ tsue ɔ he ɔ, e tsui po. Ejakaa nihi ngɛ dee ke, “Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ nɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje.” <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Nɛ ni komɛ hu de ke, “Elia loo blema gbali ɔmɛ a ti nɔ ko nɛ te si ekohu.” Ja a sɔuu nɛ a ngɛ dee ngɛ zugba a mi kulaa kɛ ngɛ si bɔlee.<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herode de e he ke, “I ha nɛ a po Yohane yi; nɛ mɛnɔ hu pa ji Nɔmlɔ nɛ ngɛ nyakpɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsue nɛ ɔ mɔ?” Nɛ ja a he je ɔ e hla kaa e maa na lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Benɛ kaseli ɔmɛ je a sikpa a kɛ ba nɛ a ba bɔ Yesu a nyɛɛmi mi amaniɛ ɔ, e kɛ mɛ je kɛ ho he ko banee ya ngɛ Betsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Se nihi nɛ ngɛ lɛ hlae ɔ na le he nɛ ya nɛ e ho nɛ a bu e nɔ. Benɛ a ya na lɛ ɔ, e fie we mɛ; e he mɛ atuu nɛ e fiɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he sane ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ nɛ e tsa ni nɛmɛ nɛ be he wami ɔmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Kɛ yaa gbɔkuɛ nya si mi ɔ, e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ tsuo ba e ngɔ nɛ a ba de lɛ ke, “Mo ha nɛ ni ɔmɛ nɛ a ho ma a mi ya nɛ a ya hla niye ni kɛ hwɔ he, ejakaa niye ni ko be nga a nɔ hiɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ha mɛ ni.” Kaseli ɔmɛ ha lɛ heto nɛ a de ke, “Abolo enyɔ kɛ lo enyɔ pɛ ji niye ni nɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa hɛɛ nɛ wa maa ye. Aloo o ngɛ hlae nɛ wa ya he niye ni nɛ maa su ma mluku nɛ pueɔ si nɛ ɔ tsuo lo?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Ejakaa nihi nɛ ba pue si ɔ, a hiɛmi maa su akpe enuɔ. Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ ha nɛ a bua kɛ hi si nyingmi enuɔɔnuɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ ha nɛ a hi si ja.<verse eid="LUK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu wo abolo enuɔ ɔ kɛ lo enyɔ ɔ nɛ e hyɛ hiɔwe nɛ e na si nɛ e poo abolo ɔ ngɔ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ konɛ a kɛ ha ni ɔmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Nɛ niye ni ɔ su nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ye nɛ a tɔ nɛ bibliwi nɛ pue si nɛ a kukuɔ ɔ, e hyi kusii nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ligbi ko ɔ, lɛ nɔ kake e hii si ngɛ sɔlee benɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ hii si ngɛ se; nɛ benɛ e sɔle ta a, e ba a ngɔ ba bi mɛ ke, “Kɛ ni ɔmɛ deɔ ngɛ ye he kɛɛ? Mɛnɔ nɛ a ke i ji?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />A de lɛ ke, “Nihi ngɛ dee ke Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ ji mo; nɛ nihi hu ngɛ dee ke o maa pee Elia loo blema gbali ɔmɛ eko nɛ te si kɛ je gbeje.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Jehanɛ ɔ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ nɛ nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ susu kaa i ji?” Petro ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Mo ji Mesia a, Mawu e Kristo ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />E bɔ mɛ kɔkɔ ke a ko de nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e nu. Nɛ e ya nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />“Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa na nisɛ ni a ni; nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ ma kua lɛ, nɛ a maa gbe lɛ. Se ligbi etɛ se ɔ, e maa te si ekohu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Nɛ e pa de mɛ ke, “Mo nɔ nɛ o suɔ nɛ o nyɛɛ ye se ɔ, o ngmɛɛ o akɔnɔ nihi a he nɛ o wo o sɛumi tso ɔ nɛ o nyɛɛ ye se. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma hla kaa e baa e he lo yi ɔ, e maa laa e klaa. Se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e hɛ mi ma kpata ngɛ ye he ɔ, e yi ma na wami. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Nɛ mɛni se nɛ nɔ ko ma na ke ji kaa e nine maa su je nɛ ɔ tsuo nɔ se e maa laa lɛ nitsɛ e klaa?<verse eid="LUK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ke ye tsɔɔmi ɔ kɛ ami nitsɛ ye he peeɔ nɔ ko zo ɔ, benɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa ba ngɛ e kɛ Tsɛ ɔ kɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ a anunyami ɔ mi ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ ɔ hu e he maa pee Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ zo. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Se e ji anɔkuale kaa nyɛ nihi nɛ daa si ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ ti nihi maa na Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ loko ji a ma si je mi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nɔmlɔ tso su tsakemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />E tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ se ligbi kpaanyɔ nɛ e tsɛ Petro kɛ Yakobo kɛ Yohane ngɔ piɛ e he nɛ a ho yoku ko nɔ ya nɛ e ya sɔle. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Nɛ benɛ e ngɛ sɔlee ɔ, e hɛ mi bɔni tsakemi, nɛ tade nɛ e wo ɔ bɔni peemi futaa hluu kɛ ya si e bɔni la pomi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Kɛkɛ benɛ a maa hyɛ ɔ, a na nihi enyɔ, Mose kɛ Elia ba je kpo nɛ a kɛ lɛ ngɛ munyu tue. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Mɛ hu a he pee fɛu saminya, nɛ a ji anunyami nimli; nɛ a kɛ lɛ ngɛ gbenɔ nɛ e ma ya gbo ngɛ Yerusalem, ngɛ Mawu yi mi tomi ɔ nya a, he munyu tue.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, mahe gbe Petro kɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ e he ɔ, nɛ a hwɔ mahe pɔpɔɔpɔ. Se a he tsiɛ nɛ a na bɔ nɛ Yesu ngɛ kpɛe kɛ anunyami, kɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ a kɛ lɛ daa si ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Benɛ Mose kɛ Elia maa ho Yesu ngɔ jemi ya a, Petro hia ngmlaa nɛ e de ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, nɔ́ nɛ ɔ ngɛ nyakpɛ. Mo ha nɛ waa ma tsuhi etɛ ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ ha nyɛ, o nɔ kake, Mose nɔ kake kɛ Elia hu nɔ kake.”<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Se Petro nya nɔɛ si nɛ bɔ kuu ko ba ha mɛ tsuo a nɔ, nɛ gbeye nu mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Kɛkɛ nɛ gbi ko pɛ kɛ je bɔ kuu ɔ mi ke, “Ye Binyumu, Nɔ Nɛ i hla a ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, nyɛɛ bu lɛ tue.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Benɛ gbi ɔ pɛ se ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ pɛ nɛ piɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ; nɛ a ti nɔ ko wui munyu nɛ ɔ nɔ ta kɛ de we nɔ ko ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsa jokuɛ ɔ nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ e mi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />E nɔ jena benɛ a kple si kɛ je yoku ɔ nɔ kɛ ma a, nihi fuu kɛ lɛ ba kpe. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ ko hia ngmlaa ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ tsɛ lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, ye binyumuyo kake too ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Se mumi yayami ngɛ lɛ haoe. E nuu lɛ nɛ e haa nɛ e kpaa ngmlaa nɛ e woɔ e he kɛ hii si fiae kaa kɔkɔtsɛ; kɛkɛ ɔ, e nya mi fiaa hwɔli; e pɔɔ lɛ numi nɛ e ha we nɛ e na he jɔmi ko kulaa. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />I kpa o kaseli ɔmɛ pɛɛ nɛ a hia mumi yayami ɔ ngɛ e mi nɛ e na he jɔmi se a nyɛ we.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de ke, “Mɛni nimli ji nɛ ɔ nɛ a tue mi ti, nɛ a be hemi kɛ yemi kikɛ ɔ? Mɛni be i kɛ nyɛ maa hi si kɛ ya si? Mo wo lɛ ke ba hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Benɛ bi ɔ nyɛɛ ke ma Yesu ngɔ ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ mumi yayami ɔ pa po lɛ kɛ fɔ si. Se Yesu nga mumi yayami ɔ yi nɛ e de lɛ ke e je e mi; kɛkɛ nɛ jokuɛ ɔ na he wami, nɛ e wo lɛ kɛ ha e tsɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Nihi nɛ na Mawu he wami ni tsumi nɛ ɔ ye gbeye saminya, nɛ benɛ a ngɛ nyakpɛ ni kpahi nɛ Yesu ngɛ tsue ɔ he munyu tue ɔ, e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Nyɛɛ bu mi tue saminya nɛ nyɛ kai nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee ɔ. A maa tsɔɔ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ se blɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Se kaseli ɔmɛ nui munyu ɔ nɛ e tu ɔ sisi, ejakaa a ngɔ laa mɛ, nɛ a ngɛ gbeye yee hulɔ kaa a ma bi lɛ munyu ɔ he nɔ́ ko.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Nya sami mohu nɛ ba te si ngɛ a kpɛti kaa a ti mɛnɔ nɛ maa pee nguaa pe kulaa ngɛ Matsɛyemi nɛ ma a mi lo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Se Yesu le nɔ nɛ a ngɛ susue ɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ e tsɛ jokuɛ ko kɛ ba da si ngɛ e kasa nya. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ maa baa jokuɛ kaa nɔ nɛ ɔ yi saminya a, ami nɛ e pee kɛ ha; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ maa hyɛ ye nɔ ɔ, Tsaatsɛ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ nɛ e pee kɛ ha. Ejakaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ maa ba nyɛ he si kɛ ha ni kpahi ha a, lɔ ɔ nɛ maa pee nyɛ nimli nguahi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Nɛ e kaselɔ Yohane ba ba de lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, wa na nɔ ko nɛ e wo o biɛ kɛ ngɛ mumi yayamihi hiae ngɛ nihi a mi nɛ wa tsi e nya nɛ wa de lɛ ke e be he blɔ nɛ e peeɔ ja, ejakaa e be wa kpɛti.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “E sɛ nɛ o tsiɔ e nya, ejakaa nɔ nɛ ti si kɛ wui mo ɔ, lɛɛ e kɛ mo i.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Nɛ akɛnɛ e be nɛ e ma kɛ kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya a ngɛ sue he je ɔ, e wo e hɛ mi ngɔ pi Yerusalem blɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ligbi ko, e tsɔ nihi kɛ sɛ hlami nɛ a ya bi nɛ a si tsu ha mɛ ngɛ Samaria kɔpe ko mi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Se ma a mi tsɛ ɔmɛ fie tsɔli ɔmɛ, ejakaa a na kaa Yerusalem ji he nɛ a yaa.<verse eid="LUK 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Benɛ munyu nɛ ɔ ba su Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ɔ, Yakobo kɛ Yohane de Yesu ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, wa tsɛ la kɛ je hiɔwe nɛ e ba sa nimli nɛ ɔmɛ lo?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Se Yesu ka a hɛ mi ngɛ a susumi nɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Nɛ a ho ya to kɔpe kpa mi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Benɛ a yaa ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, nɔ ko de Yesu ke, “He tsuaa he nɛ o maa ya a, i ma nyɛɛ o se daa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Se Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Mo kai kaa i be he nɛ i woɔ ye yi kɛ fɔɔ. Kɔkɔbohi ngɛ a muɔhi nɛ a hwɔɔ mi, nɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi hu ngɛ a tsuhi, se Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ be we ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Be kpa ko lɛɛ lɛ nitsɛ e tsɛ nɔ ko ke e ba nyɛɛ e se. Nɔ ɔ kplɛɛ, se e de lɛ ke e mlɛ ha lɛ kɛ ya si be nɛ e maa pu e tsɛ konɛ e ba nyɛɛ e se.<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Mo ha nɛ nihi nɛ be nyagbe yi wami hemi ɔ nae ɔ, a tsu jamɛ a ni ɔmɛ. Se moo lɛɛ o blɔ nya ni tsumi ji kaa o ba fiɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ bami ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ je ɔ tsuo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nɔ kpa hu de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, i ma ba, se mo ha mi blɔ nɛ ma ya sɛ ye we mi bi ɔmɛ lolo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ haa nɛ nɔ́ kpahi jeɔ e juɛmi kɛ jee ni tsumi nɛ i to kɛ ha lɛ ɔ he ɔ, e sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsɔ e he piɛli ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ Nutsɔ ɔ hla kaseli nyingmi kpaago kpa nɛ e tsɔ mɛ, ni enyɔɔnyɔ, kɛ sɛ hlami nɛ a ya mahi kɛ kɔpehi kulaa nɛ e to kaa e ma ya slaa amɛ a mi. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ kpa nɔ́ kpami Nutsɔ ɔ pɛɛ nɛ e tsɔ ni tsuli kɛ ba nɔ́ kpami ɔ mi nɛ a ba piɛ nyɛ he, ejakaa ni tsumi ɔ hiɛ se ni tsuli ɔmɛ a he pi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nyɛɛ ho; nɛ nyɛ kai kaa i ngɛ nyɛ tsɔe kaa jijɔ bihi kɛ yaa ogbeteehi a kpɛti. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Nyɛ ko hɛɛ sika kɛ to dɛ, nɛ nyɛ ko hɛɛ ni bali a kotoku; nɛ nyɛ ko hɛɛ tokota kpa kɛ piɛ nɔ nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛ wo ɔmɛ a he. Nɛ nyɛ ko nga nɔ ko ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Nɛ ke nyɛ sɛ we ko mi ɔ, nyɛɛ jɔɔ we ɔ nɛ nyɛ de ke, ‘Nyɛ he manye.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ke jamɛ a we ɔ sa jɔɔmi ɔ, Mawu jɔɔmi ɔ maa hi we ɔ nɔ, se ke e sɛ ɔ, jɔɔmi ɔ maa kpale kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ.<verse eid="LUK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Ke nyɛ ya ma ko mi ɔ, nyɛɛ to we kake pɛ mi; nɛ nyɛɛ ye niye ni tsuaa niye ni nɛ a ma ha nyɛ ɔ kɛ nɔ nɛ a ma ha nyɛ ke nyɛɛ nu ɔ, ejakaa nɔ nɛ apaatsɛ tsu ɔ, lɔ ɔ nɛ e yeɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8-9" />Nɛ ma tsuaa ma nɛ ma he nyɛ atuu ɔ, nyɛɛ pee níhi enyɔ nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ: Nyɛɛ ye nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ma ha nyɛ ɔ. Nɛ nyɛ tsa hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ de mɛ ke, ‘Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ na nyɛ ta.’<verse eid="LUK 10:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Se ke ma ko he we nyɛ atuu ɔ, nyɛ ya da ma a gbɛjegbɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ nyɛ de ke, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Nyɛɛ hyɛ, nyɛ ma a mi bunyuku nɛ du wa nane sisi ɔ tete wa ngɛ blɛe pue si ha nyɛ kaa nyɛ ma na hɛ mi kpatami. Se nyɛ na nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ na nyɛ ta.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, ngɛ hwɔɔ se Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, e maa fani ha dikali a ma nɛ ji Sodom ɔ pe jamɛ a ma a. <verse eid="LUK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Kusiɛ ha mo Korazin! Kusiɛ ha mo Betsaida! Ejakaa e maa pee gbeye ha nyɛ hwɔɔ se. Mɛni he je ɔ, kaa a ke nyakpɛ ni nguahi nɛ i tsu ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ, Tiro kɛ Zidon nɛ i tsu ngɛ ɔ, jinɛ a mi bimɛ ko bu kpekpe nɛ a kpa la zu nɛ a kɛ mɔbɔ yemi kɛ he kuami pia a he momoomo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, e maa fani ha Tiro kɛ Zidon ngɛ Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ. A tue gblami be hiɛe kaa nyɛ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nɛ nyɛ Kapernaum bi hu nɛɛ, kɛ ma de ngɛ nyɛ he kɛɛ? Nyɛ maa suɔ kaa a wo nyɛ nɔ kɛ ya hiɔwe gojoo lo? Due, a maa ba nyɛ si kɛ ho abosiamihi a je ya.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Ni nɛmɛ nɛ ma he nyɛ atuu ɔ, ami nɛ a ngɛ hee ɔ nɛ; nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ be nyɛ hee ɔ, ami nɛ a kua a nɛ. Ke nɔ ko kua mi ɔ, Mawu nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ nɛ e kua a nɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Benɛ kaseli nyingmi kpaago ɔmɛ kpale kɛ ba a, a kɛ bua jɔmi ba bɔ lɛ amaniɛ nɛ a de ke, “Nutsɔ, mumi yayamihi tete po bu wɔ tue benɛ wa wo o biɛ kɛ tu mɛ munyu ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />E ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Niinɛ i, i na Abosiami nɛ e tsɔ kɛ je hiɔwe kaa oslabai nɛ gba. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Nɛ i ha nyɛ he wami nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ ku he nyɛlɔ ɔ he wami nya; nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ naa nyingmogblakotohi kɛ sinɔhi a nɔ nɛ nyɛ maa gbe mɛ, nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛ awi yee. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Se tsa pi nɔ́ nɛ he hia a ji kaa mumi yayamihi bu nyɛ tue ɔ, se mohu kaa a ngma nyɛ biɛ ngɛ hiɔwe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ha nɛ Yesu na bua jɔmi saminya nɛ e de ke, “Oo Tsaatsɛ, hiɔwe kɛ zugba Nutsɔ, i ngɛ o yi jee, nɛ i ngɛ mo si nae kaa o wo ni nɛ ɔmɛ ngɔ laa je nɛ ɔ mi ni leli kɛ juɛmitsɛmɛ, se o je kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ ngɛ kaa jokuɛwi nɛ heɔ o nɔ yeɔ ɔ. I naa mo si, Tsaatsɛ, ejakaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ ji ja a nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Tsaatsɛ to nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɔ wo ye dɛ, nɛ nɔ ko li Bi ɔ kɛ pi si, ja Tsɛ ɔ; nɛ nɔ ko hu li Tsɛ ɔ kɛ pi si, ja Bi ɔ kɛ nihi kulaa nɛ Bi ɔ suɔ kaa e ma je lɛ si ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ nɛ e de kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ zaa ke, “E ji dloomi agbo kɛ ha nyɛ kaa a ha nyɛ he blɔ nɛ nyɛɛ na níhi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nae nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Gbali ɔmɛ kɛ blema matsɛ ɔmɛ fuu hla kaa a ko hi si nɛ a na níhi nɛ nyɛ na kɛ níhi nɛ nyɛ nu nɛ ɔmɛ se a na we he blɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaria no mɔbɔ nalɔ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ligbi ko ɔ, nɔ ko nɛ le Mose mlaa amɛ saminya a ba ka Yesu nɛ e hyɛ ha kaa lɛ hu e le mlaa amɛ lo. E ba bi lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, mɛni nɛ nɔ ko maa pee nɛ e ma na neneene wami ngɛ hiɔwe?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni Mose mlaa a deɔ ngɛ enɛ ɔ he?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Mlaa lelɔ ɔ ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Moo suɔ Nutsɔ o Mawu ɔ kɛ o tsui kulaa, kɛ o klaa kulaa, kɛ o he wami kulaa, kɛ o juɛmi kulaa. Nɛ o suɔ o nyɛmi kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mo nitsɛ o he ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ja i pɛpɛɛpɛ! Moo pee enɛ ɔ nɛ o yi ma na wami.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Se nyumu ɔ hla kaa e maa tsɔɔ kaa dalɔ ji lɛ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e bi lɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ ji ye nyɛmi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu wo sane ko kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ nya nɛ e de ke, “Yuda no ko hia blɔ kɛ je Yerusalem kɛ yaa Yeriko nɛ ojo fiali ya po lɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ. A fiaa lɛ ni saminya nɛ a je e tadehi ngɛ e he. A kpɔ e sika nɛ e hɛɛ ɔ hu kulaa ngɛ e dɛ nɛ a si lɛ ngɔ fɔ si ngɛ blɔ ɔ he nɛ e gbo fa kɛ fa.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />E ba mi kaa Yuda no osɔfo ko ba gu jamɛ a blɔ ɔ nɔ, se benɛ e na nɔmlɔ ɔ nɛ fɔɔ si ngɛ blɔ ɔ he ɔ, e gba ya gu he kpa nɛ e je. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Lɔ ɔ se ɔ, Sɔlemi We ɔ mi sɔmɔlɔ ko hu ba gu jamɛ a blɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ e hyɛ lɛ nɛ e je e he.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Se Samaria no ko hu ba gu blɔ ɔ nɔ, nɛ benɛ e na nɔ ɔ nɛ a pla lɛ ngɔ fɔ si ɔ, e ni pee lɛ mɔbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />E kple si kɛ je e teji ɔ nɔ nɛ e ya ba si ngɛ e kasa nya nɛ e to e pa amɛ a nɔ tsopa ha lɛ. Jehanɛ ɔ, e wo lɛ ngɔ fɔ e teji ɔ nɔ nɛ e kpaka lɛ kɛ lohwe ɔ blɛuu kɛ ya si a ya su nibwɔhi a to he, nɛ e ya hyɛ e nɔ nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ kɛ ya si je nanɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Benɛ je na nɛ e ma tsa e blɔ hiami ɔ nɔ ɔ, e je e kotoku mi sika sidi akpe enyɔ ngɔ ha nibwɔhi a to hetsɛ ɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, ‘Moo hyɛ nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ nɔ ha mi; ke o puɛ sika nɛ pe nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ sie nɛ ɔ ngɛ e he ɔ, i ma ba gbe yi ha mo ke i kpale kɛ ba hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Nihi etɛ nɛ ɔmɛ nɛɛ, a ti mɛnɔ nɛ peeɔ nyumu nɛ a plaa le ɔ e nyɛmi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Nyumu ɔ ha heto nɛ e de Yesu ke, “Nɔ nɛ na lɛ mɔbɔ ɔ.” Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ja i; moo ya nɛ mo hu o ya pee ja.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ tsa a blɔ hiami ɔ nɔ kɛ yaa Yerusalem nɛ a ya su kɔpe ko mi. Yo ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Marta a nya a he nɛ e wo mɛ kɛ ho e we mi ya nɛ a ya to e ngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Benɛ a ya su we ɔ mi ɔ, Marta nyɛmiyo Maria ya hi si ngɛ Yesu nane nya nɛ e ngɛ munyuhi nɛ Yesu ngɛ tue ɔmɛ tue bue. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Se Marta lɛɛ e ya ngɛ dengme gboe ngɛ ni hooe kɛ ha nibwɔ ɔmɛ; nɛ e he ngɛ lɛ hiae kaa e nyɛmi ɔ ba piɛ we e he nɛ a kɛ hoo ni ɔ. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ya de Yesu ke, “Mawetsɛ, moo hyɛ ha kaa e sa nɛ ye nyɛmiyo ɔ nɛ e si ni hoomi ɔ kɛ ha ami nɔ kake lo? Mo de lɛ nɛ e ba piɛ ye he nɛ waa hoo ni ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Marta, Marta, mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ o he haoe babauu ngɛ níhi fuu a he kikɛ ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Nɔ́ kake pɛ nɛ he hia kaa waa hao wa he ngɛ he, nɛ Maria na jamɛ a nɔ́ ɔ momo nɛ a be hee ngɛ e dɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsɔɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Yesu ya ngɛ sɔlee ngɛ he ko nɛ benɛ e gbe nya a, e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, moo tsɔɔ wɔ hu Sɔlemi konɛ ke e pee ɔ waa hi sɔlee kaa bɔ nɛ Yohane tsɔɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Nɛ Sɔlemi nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ: “Tsaatsɛ, o biɛ ɔ he nɛ tsɔ; o Matsɛyemi ɔ nɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Mo ha wɔ wa nya ngma daa ligbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Nɛ o wo wa tɔmi ɔmɛ kɛ ke wɔ, ejakaa wɔ hu wa kɛ kee nihi nɛ tɔɔ wa nɔ ɔ. Nɛ o ko ha nɛ waa sɛ kami mi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Nɛ e tsa nɔ nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ ni nɛ kɔɔ sɔlemi he nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛɛ ngɔ lɛ kaa o ya o huɛ ngɔ nyɔ mi kpɛti nɛ o ya ba abolo etɛ ngɛ e dɛ. O ya tsɛ lɛ nɛ o de lɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />‘Ye huɛ ko ba to mi nubwɔ piɔ nɛ e ma mi slaami, se niye ni ko kulaa be ye dɛ ngɛ we ɔ mi nɛ ma ha lɛ. Taflaatsɛ, moo dloo mi abolo etɛ ko nɛ ma kɛ ha lɛ nɛ e ye.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ma de mo ke, ‘O le ɔ, piɔ ɔ, je jɔ nɛ wa hwɔ si nɛ a nga sinya a, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, piɔ lɛɛ nɔ́ ko be hiɛ maa pee.’<verse eid="LUK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Se i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ maa te si, tsa pi ngɛ e huɛ nɛ ngɛ lɛ tsɛɛ ɔ he je, se ngɛ bɔ nɛ nɔ́ balɔ ɔ ngɛ nɔ ngɛ sinya a sie nɛ e jɔɔ we ɔ he je, nɛ e ma ha lɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ngɛ hlae ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ sɔlemi blɔ fa mi; moo hi nɔ nɛ o hi o hiami ni ɔmɛ bie nɛ a maa hi mo hae; moo hi nɔ nɛ o hi hlae nɛ o maa hi nae; moo hi nɔ nɛ o hi sie nɛ sinya a ma bli ha mo. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ biɔ ɔ, e nine suu nɔ; nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hlaa a, e naa; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ siɔ ɔ, a bliɔ sinya a haa lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nyɛ tsɛmɛ ɔmɛ nɛɛ, ke nyɛ bi bi abolo ɔ, tɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ haa lɛ lo? Nɛ ke e bi lo ɔ nɛɛ, sinɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ woɔ e dɛ lo? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Nɛ ke e bi hlui ɔ nɛɛ, nyingmogblakoto nɛ nyɛ kɛ haa lɛ lo?<verse eid="LUK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ke nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ji nimli yayamihi ɔ, nyɛ le bɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ nɔ́ kpakpahi haa nyɛ bimɛ ɔ, anɛ nyɛ he we yi kaa nyɛ Tsɛ nɛ ngɛ Hiɔwe ɔ hu maa pee ja a, nɛ e maa ngɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ ha nihi nɛ biɔ lɛ ɔ lo?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Yesu hia mumi yayami kɛ je mumui ko mi nɛ nɔ ɔ bɔni munyu tumi. Ni nɛmɛ nɛ na nyakpɛ ni tsumi nɛ ɔ, a hɛ mi pee mɛ yaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Se nɔ́ nɛ ni komɛ hu de ji, “E be nyakpɛ kaa e nyɛ ngɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ hiae. Abosiami nɛ ji mumi yayami ɔmɛ kulaa a matsɛ ɔ e he wami nɛ e kɛ ngɛ ni ɔ tsue ɔ nɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Ni komɛ hu de lɛ ke e je Hiɔwe okadi ko kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ kaa lɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ niinɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Se akɛnɛ e le nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ susue he je ɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Ke ji kaa matsɛ yemi ko mi gba enyɔ nɛ e mi bi ɔmɛ gba ta wo a bi ɔ, matsɛ yemi ɔ hɛ mi ma kpata. Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ ke pɛ sɛ we ko mi bimɛ a kpɛti nɛ a bɔni a he ni fiaami ɔ, Jamɛ a we ɔ maa gbɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke ji nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ ngɛ mi anɔkuale ɔ, lɛɛ Abosiami kɛ lɛ nitsɛ e he ngɛ ta hwue. Ejakaa e ha mi he blɔ kaa ma hiaa lɛ nitsɛ e mumi ɔmɛ ngɛ nihi a mi, nɛ kɛ e maa pee nɛ e matsɛ yemi ɔ maa da si kɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nɛ ke ji Abosiami he wami nɛ i kɛ ngɛ ni tsue ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ɔ nɛɛ, mɛni he wami a kɛ ngɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ hiae? Anɛ nyɛ ngɛ dee ke Abosiami mumi ngɛ a mi lo? Nyɛ bi mɛ kaa nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ ngɛ mi anɔkuale lo? <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Se ke Mawu he wami nɛ i kɛ ngɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ hiae ɔ lɛɛ e tsɔɔ paa kaa Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ su si.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Ejakaa ke he walɔ fi gbaja nɛ e kpla ta hwumi nihi kɛ ngɛ e we he bue ɔ, e nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ́ yi naa wami. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ja benɛ nɔ ko nɛ he wa pe lɛ nɛ e ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ hi pe e ni ɔmɛ ba tua lɛ, nɛ e fiaa lɛ ni nɛ e kpɔ e ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ ngɛ e dɛ loko ji e maa muɔ e weto ni ɔmɛ kɛ je.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Ke nɔ ko pataa we ye he ɔ, lɛɛ e kɛ mi ngɛ hwue; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ yi kɛ bua we mi ɔ, e ngɛ mi awi yee.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Ke a hia mumi yayami kɛ je nɔ ko mi ɔ, e hiaa blɔ nɛ e ya nyɛɛɔ nga nɔ kɛ hlaa he jɔɔmi he. Ke ji e ya nɛ he ko kaa ja a, e kpaleɔ kɛ hoɔ he nɛ a hia lɛ kɛ je ɔ ya. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Nɛ e ya naa kaa a bɛɛ e we momo ɔ mi nɛ a dla mi saminya se nɔ ko be mi. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e yaa nɛ e ya tsɛɔ mumi yayamihi kpaago kpa nɛ yobu pe lɛ nitsɛ ngɔ piɛɔ e he kɛ ba sɛɔ nɔ ɔ e mi, nɛ a puɛɔ Nɔmlɔ ɔ pe kekle ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Benɛ e ngɛ munyu ɔ tue ɔ, yo ko hia ngmlaa ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ e de ke, “Mawu nɛ jɔɔ nyɛ ke muklii nɛ hɛɛ o hɔ kɛ nyɔ nɛ o pupɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ja i; se a maa jɔɔ nihi nɛ nuɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ a yeɔ nɔ ɔ pe ja.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Nɛ benɛ ni ɔmɛ ba bua wo e he fuu ɔ, e fiɛ tsɔɔ mɛ nɛ e de ke, “Be yobu kɛ yi nɔ yayami bimɛ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. A ngɛ bie kaa a tsɔɔ mɛ okadi mi mi slɔɔto ko kɛ je hiɔwe; se a be mɛ okadi kpa ko tsɔɔe pe Yona okadi ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Nɔ́ nɛ ba Yona nɔ ɔ ha Ninive bi ɔmɛ he ye kaa Mawu nɛ tsɔ lɛ niinɛ, ja a kɛ nɔ́ nɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa na a, maa tsɔɔ yi nɔ bi nɛ ɔmɛ kaa Mawu nɛ tsɔ lɛ nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, Sheba Manyɛ ɔ ma je e nine ngɔ tsɔɔ yi nɔ bi nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ e maa bu mɛ fɔ. Ejakaa e hia blɔ kɛ je he lokoo kɛ ya bu Salomo nile ɔ tue; nɛ nɔ nɛ pe Salomo si abɔ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti se nihi bɔɔ pɛ nɛ ngɛ lɛ tue bue. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ Ninive bi hu maa te si kɛ si yi nɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ a maa bu mɛ fo, ejakaa nɛ Yona ya fiɛ ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ, a pia a he nɛ a tsake a tsui. Nɛ nɔ nɛ pe Yona si abɔ ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ se ma nɛ ɔ bui lɛ tue.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Nɔ ko sui kane nɛ e ngɔ hɔɔ sowe sisi. Kane tso nɔ nɛ a woɔ kane ngɔ maa nɛ e ha nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ maa sɛ tsu ɔ mi ɔ nɛ e hyɛ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ e kane ji hɛ ngmɛ; ke o hɛ ngmɛ nɔ tsɔ ɔ, nɔmlɔ tso ɔ tsuo mi tsɔɔ; se ke o hɛ ngmɛ ɔ nɔ tsɔ we ɔ, e haa nɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ tlɔɔ diblii mi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ e hi nɛ nyɛ ko tlɔ diblii mi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ke la ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ mi nɛ diblii be he ko ɔ, o hɛ mi ma kpɛ kaa nɔ nɛ a kpɛ la ngɔ ma o nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ka osatotsɛ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Benɛ e tu munyu ɔ ta pɛ nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ eko ba tsɛ lɛ nɛ e kɛ lɛ a ya ye ni ngɛ e we mi. Benɛ Yesu ya su we ɔ mi ɔ, e ya hi si nɛ e bɔni ni ɔ yemi benɛ e fɔ we e he kaa bɔ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ peeɔ ngɛ a kusumi nya loko ji a yeɔ ni ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Se benɛ Yuda no ɔ na enɛ ɔ, e pee lɛ nyakpɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Nyɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ ɔ, nyɛ fɔɔ nyɛ kpo nɔ blɔ he, be mi nɛ nyɛ mi blɔ sɛ mu kɛ jiklɔɔ kɛ yi kpɛti wawɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Kuasiahi ji nyɛ; anɛ tsa pi Mawu nɛ pee kpo nɔ kɛ mi mi ɔ kulaa lo? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Nɔ nɔ́ hami ji nɔ nɛ yeɔ nɔ tsui mi tsɔmi he odase pe kulaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Due ha nyɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ! Nyɛ ngɛ veveeve kɛ fitsofitso ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ mi dlami nyɔngma a hami ɔ he, se nyɛ di we dami sane yemi kɛ Mawu suɔmi se. E sa kaa nyɛ woɔ mi dlami nyɔngma a, se lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa nyɛ si ni kpa amɛ se.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Due ba nyɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ! Nyɛ suɔ nyɛ he tsɔɔmi kɛ ngua ma je himi ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ, nɛ nyɛ suɔ kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ba si kɛ nga nyɛ ke e kɛ nyɛ kpe ngɛ jua amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Due ha nyɛ, ni gbogboe muɔhi nɛ hɔɔ si ngɛ nga mi nɛ a nɛ ji nyɛ. Nihi nyɛɛ nyɛ se nɛ a li bɔ nɛ nyɛ puɛ ha. Nyɛ kojomi maa kle hwɔɔ se.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Kɛkɛ nɛ mlaa lelɔ ko nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ de lɛ ke, “Awetsɛ, nɔ nɛ o de nɛ ɔ, o kɛ puɛ wɔ hu wa ni tsumi ɔ hɛ mi si.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Ee, ja i! Nyɛ hu nyɛ ma na nyɛ kojomi kɛ fɔ bumi hwɔɔ se ja a kɛ. Nyɛɛ kɛ jami he mlaahi nɛ a nɔ be hiɛ yemi yeɔ nihi awi, be mi nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ yi nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Due ha nyɛ, ejakaa nyɛ ngɛ kaa nyɛ nimeli ɔmɛ nɛ gbe gbali ɔmɛ blema a pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Nɔ gbeli kɛ dikali ji nyɛ, nyɛ kplɛɛ níhi nɛ nyɛ nɛmɛ pee ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ tsɔɔ kaa nyɛ hu nyɛ ko pee ja a pɛpɛɛpɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />“Nɔ́ nɛ Mawu de ngɛ nyɛ he ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, ‘I ma tsɔ gbali ɔmɛ kɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ ya a ngɔ se a maa gbe a ti ni komɛ nɛ a maa pee ni komɛ hu nisɛ ni a ni nɛ a maa fie mɛ kɛ je a ngɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 11:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, gbali ɔmɛ nɛ a gbe kɛ je benɛ a bɔ je ɔ hluu kɛ ba si amlɔ nɛ ɔ tsuo ɔ, nyɛ yi nɔ bi nɛ ɔmɛ nyɛ dɛ nɛ a ma bi a muɔ si ngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />A ma bi kɛ je Habel nɔ hluu kɛ ba si Zakaria, nɔ nɛ a gbe ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ kɛ Sɔlemi Tsu ɔ kpɛti ɔ, nɔ ngɛ nyɛ dɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Due ha nyɛ mlaa tsɔɔli! Ejakaa nyɛ woɔ anɔkuale ɔ kɛ laa ni ɔmɛ. Nɛ benɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ he we nɛ nyɛɛ ye ɔ, nyɛ ha we ni nɛmɛ nɛ ko suɔ ɔ hu he blɔ nɛ a he ye.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a mi mi fu Yesu nɛ a je a hɛ kɛ ka lɛ. Nɛ kɛ je jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a bɔni lɛ munyuhi bimi babauu, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />nɛ a kɛ hla e nya konɛ a da nɔ nɛ a wo e he munyu nɛ a nu lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kɛ ni ɔmɛ tu munyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />E kɛ we nɛ nihi fuu ba bua wo e he nɛ a ngɛ a bi a nɔ naae. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he nɛ e hi ngɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ a osato peemi ɔ he. A peeɔ a he kaa dali be mi nɛ a nɔ yayami peeli be je nɛ ɔ mi. Se nɔ́ ko be nɛ a ngɔ laa nɛ a be lɛɛ gbleegbleegblee. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ ji ɔ, e ma je e he kpo kaa bɔ nɛ ma sasɛ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Nɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ de ngɛ laami mi ɔ, a maa jaje ngɛ paa mi. Nɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ de ngɛ se tsu mi ɔ, a maa fiɛ ngɛ ma nɔ nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ maa nu.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Ye huɛmɛ, nyɛ ko ye nihi nɛ hlaa kaa a ma kpata nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso hɛ mi ɔmɛ gbeye. Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ pɛ nɛ a ma nyɛ maa gbe. A be susuma a nɔ he wami. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nɔ nɛ sa kaa nyɛ yee gbeye ji Mawu. Mawu nɛ ngɛ he wami nɛ ke benɛ e gbe nɔmlɔ tso ɔ se ɔ, e sakee susuma a hu kɛ fɔɔ abosiamihi a je.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Nyɛmɛ ji otoklii kake jua? E sui pɛsua. Se Mawu buu otoklii fɛɛ otoklii he akɔtaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ yi kpɛti bwɔmi po Mawu kane mɛ tsuo kakaaka nɛ e le nya. Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ maa ye gbeye mɔ? Nyɛ he jua wa hluu tsɔ ha Mawu pe otokliihi babauu.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />I ngɛ nyɛ si woe anɔkuale mi ke, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ maa le mi nɛ ma he mi ye kaa nɔ nɛ a tsɔ kɛ ba a, nɛ e maa ye jamɛ a odase ɔ paa ngɛ ma hɛ mi ɔ, Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ hu maa wo e hɛ mi nyami hwɔɔ se ngɛ hiɔwe bɔfo ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Nɛ ja a kɛ̃ nɛ ami hu i ma kua nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ kuaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ngɛ nimli a hɛ mi ɔ ngɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Se kɛ hu ɔ, a ma wo nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ tuɔ munyu kɛ siɔ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ he ngɔ ke lɛ; se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ tuɔ munyu ke siɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ, a be woe ngɔ ke lɛ kɔkɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Nɛ ke ji a wo munyu kɛ wo nyɛ he, nɛ a yaa kojo nyɛ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nɔ yeli ɔmɛ kɛ kpe he ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ a hɛ mi ɔ, nyɛ ko hao nyɛ he ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ma de he. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma wo nɔ́ nɛ sa nyɛ demi ɔ kɛ wo nyɛ nya ngɛ jamɛ a ngmlɛfia a nɔ nɔuu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ de lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, mo de ye nyɛmi ɔ nɛ e kɛ mi nɛ dla wa tsɛ gbosi ni ɔ mi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Se Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Ye huɛ, mɛnɔ nɛ wo mi kojolɔ ngɛ munyu kaa kikɛ ɔ mi?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he saminya nɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ ko tsu ngɛ níhi a he, ejakaa tsa pi ni nami fuu nɛ peeɔ nɔ ko nɔmlɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Nɛ e bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ ke, “Niatsɛ ko ngmɔ ba ni saminya. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />E kpa ni babauu nɛ e ni tomi he ɔmɛ kulaa hyi kɛ be nɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e bi e he ke, ‘Kɛ i peeɔ kɛɛ? Jije i ma to ngmɔ ni fuu nɛ ɔ ngɛ?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Nyagbe mi ɔ e de e he ke, ‘I le nɔ́ nɛ ma pee. I ma hule gba momo ɔmɛ nɛ ma ma ehehi nɛ kle pe mɛ, kɛkɛ i ma na blɔ ha ngmɔ ni fuu nɛ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ i be nɔ́ ko tsue hu, nɛ i ma de ye susuma ke, Ye huɛ, o nɛ ni sɔuu nɛ a bua nya ngɔ to si ha mo nɛ o maa hi yee hluu jehahi abɔ. Moo ye nɛ o nu kɛ yi ɔmɛ nɛ o bua nɛ jɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Se Mawu de nyumu nɛ ɔ ke, ‘Hyɛ kuasia ha! Hwɔɔ je be o yi nae. Nɛ ni babauu nɛ o bua nya nɛ ɔ nɛɛ, mɛnɔ nɛ e maa ye lo?’<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ toɔ ni ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi nɛ e susuu we hwɔɔ se he, nɛ e maa to ni ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ, kuasia ji lɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ ko hao nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ bi ke, jije wa ma na nya ngma kɛ je, nɛ jije wa ma na he bo kɛ je. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ejakaa wami he hia hluu pe nya ngma kɛ bo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ kɔɔkɔmitehi ha, a be ngmɔ nɛ a be ni tomi he, se Mawu lɛɛ mɛ. Nɛ nyɛ he jua wa kɛ ha lɛ si abɔ pe lohwe pɛlitsɛhi.<verse eid="LUK 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nɛ mɛni se nɛ nyɛ ma na ke nyɛ ye nyɛ tsui nɛ nyɛ hao? Anɛ nyɛ tsui yemi ɔ ma nyɛ pue nyɛ wami ligbihi a nɔ ha nyɛ lo? Dabi! <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nɛ ke ji tsui yemi be ni tsɔwitsɔwi kaa enɛ ɔmɛ nyɛe maa pee ha nyɛ ɔ nɛɛ, lɛɛ mɛni hia kaa nyɛɛ hao nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye tsui ngɛ nihi nɛ kle pe enɛ ɔmɛ a he?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Nyɛɛ fɔ nyɛ hɛ nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ nga nɔ mɔmɔ ɔmɛ ha. A gbo we dengme ko ɔ, a tsɛ we doti hulɔ, se a he fɛu pe Salomo he fɛu kɛ e anunyami si abɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mɔmɔhi nɛ wa naa mwɔnɛ ɔ se hwɔ pɛ wa nɛ mɛ hu ɔ, ke Mawu buɔ mɛ bo nɛ a he peeɔ fɛu ɔ, si nyɛmɛ nɛ e be nyɛ bo hae nɛ nyɛ maa ha lo? Kɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi hiɛ́ nɛ ɔ kɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Nɛ mɛni he nɛ nyɛ maa ye tsui ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ maa ye kɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ maa nu he? Nyɛ ko ye he tsui kulaa, Mawu ma ha nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Niinɛ, je ɔ tsuo gbo ɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he dengme, se nyɛ hiɔwe Tsɛ ɔ le nyɛ hiami ni ɔmɛ kulaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ hla Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ se blɔ kekle nɛ e ma ha nyɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ngɔ piɛ he.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko ye gbeye, nyɛ asafo nyafii, ejakaa nyɛ Tsɛ ɔ suɔmi nya ji kaa e ma wo Matsɛyemi ɔ ngɔ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Nyɛɛ jua níhi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ sika a nɛ ke nihi nɛ e hia mɛ ɔmɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ kɛ to níhi ngɛ hiɔwe. Hiɔwe ni tomi kpɛɛ ɔ wui momo nɛ e gba we hulɔ; nɛ nyɛ nito ni ɔmɛ be laae ngɛ lejɛ ɔ; nɛ julɔ ko be nɔ́ ko nyɛe maa ju ngɛ mi, nɛ lohwe tsɔwi hu puɛ we ni ngɛ e mi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />He fɛɛ he nɛ o weto ni ngɛ ɔ, lejɛ ɔ nɛ o tsui kɛ o susumi hii.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Nyɛ dla nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ pee klaalo <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />kɛ ha nyɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ maa je yo kpeemi okplɔɔ tsɛmi ɔ kɛ ba a, konɛ ke e ba si sinya a pɛ nɛ nyɛ bli ha lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ ma dla a he kɛ hi lɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔ, a ma nya nɛ a bua maa jɔ benɛ e ma ba su si ɔ. I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi kaa e ma ha nɛ a hi si, nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e maa wo sɔmɔmi tade nɛ e ma sɔmɔ mɛ be mi nɛ a hi si ngɛ ni yee ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Nɛ nyɔ mi kpɛti nɛ e maa ba jio, makɛ i jio, nihi kulaa nɛ ma dla a he kɛ hi lɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔ, mɛ nɛ a ma na bua jɔmi be mi nɛ e ma ba su si ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Nɛ jinɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ko dla e he kɛ hyɛ lɛ blɔ ke e maa le ngmlɛfia nɔ tutuutu nɛ e maa ba a. Kaa bɔ nɛ wetsɛ ko dlaa e he ke ji e maa le be nɛ julɔ maa ba a. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ dla nyɛ he be fɛɛ be, ejakaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa ba tlukaa be nɛ nyɛ hyɛ we lɛ blɔ kulaa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro bi lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, wɔ pɛ nɛ o ngɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ bue aloo nɔ tsuaa nɔ i.” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42-44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42-44" />Nutsɔ ɔ ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ji anɔkuale yelɔ, nɛ e hɛ mi ka si nɛ e wetsɛ wo lɛ ngɔ to tsɔli kpa amɛ a nya kaa e hyɛ a nɔ nɛ e lɛ mɛ ɔ nɛ i ngɛ dee ɔ nɛ. Ke ji e nutsɔ ɔ ba nɛ e ba na kaa e tsu ni kpakpa a, e ma na hiɔwo. E nutsɔ ɔ ma wo lɛ ngɔ to e nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ e dɛ ɔ nya.<verse eid="LUK 12:42-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Se ke ji tsɔlɔ nɛ ɔ ma susu kaa e wetsɛ ɔ be bae lolo, nɛ e ma bɔni sɔmɔli nyumu kɛ yi ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ ngɛ e sisi ɔ ni fiami, nɛ e ma bɔni da demi kɛ basabasa peemi ɔ, lɛɛ due ha lɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />E nutsɔ ɔ ma ba je kpo tlukaa be mi nɛ tsɔlɔ nɛ ɔ hɛ be e he nɔ nɛ e ma je lɛ kɛ je e blɔ he ɔ. E ma wo lɛ kɛ ya futu nihi nɛ yi anɔkuale ɔmɛ a kpɛti. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />E nutsɔ ɔ maa gbla e tue wawɛɛ, ejakaa e le e ni tsumi se e kua tsumi.<verse eid="LUK 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Se nɔ nɛ li kaa yayami nɛ e ngɛ pee ɔ, a maa gbla e tue bɔɔ ko kɛkɛ. Nɔ nɛ a ha lɛ fuu ɔ, a hyɛɔ blɔ kaa e ha fuu; nɛ nɔ nɛ a to fuu kɛ wo e dɛ ɔ, lɛ e dɛ nɛ a biɔ fuu si ngɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />I ba nɛ ma ba tsɔ je ɔ la, nɛ i na jinɛ be nɛ ɔ mi ɔ i gbe ye ni tsumi ɔ nya momo. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ta yobu ko ngɛ ye hɛ mi nɛ i ma hwu. Nɛ ye he ngɛ mi hiae kɛ yaa si be nɛ ma gbe nya.<verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Nyɛ ko susu kaa i wo tue mi jɔmi kɛ ma zugba a nɔ. Mi gbami kɛ pɛ mohu nɛ i kɛ ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Nɛ kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ yaa a, wehi a mi ma gba wo a bi. Nihi etɛ maa pi ye se, nɛ nihi enyɔ hu a be ye munyu hlae nɛ a nu; aloo nihi enyɔ maa hi ye blɔ fa mi nɛ nihi etɛ hu maa te si kɛ wo mi. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ye he ɔ, binyumu kɛ e tsɛ a kpɛti ma gba, nɛ nyɛ kɛ e biyo hu a be yee. Nganyɛ kɛ e binyumu yo hu maa ye aka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ nɛ e de ni ɔmɛ nɛ ba bua a ke, “Ke nyɛ na nɛ bɔ kuu wo ngɛ pu sinɔ he ɔ, tsɛ nyɛ deɔ ke hiɔmi maa nɛ. Nɛ ja i.<verse eid="LUK 12:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ke woyi kɔɔhiɔ te ɔ, kɛkɛ nyɛ ke, ‘Mwɔnɛ ɔ pu maa tso wawɛɛ.’ Nɛ nyɛ tɔ we. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Osatotsɛmɛ, nyɛ le nɛ nyɛ tsɔɔ kɔɔhiɔ mi tsakemi ɔmɛ a sisi pɛpɛɛpɛ, se nyɛ ke nihi nɛ maa ba amɛ a he okadi nɛ bɔle nyɛ ɔ lɛɛ nyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ sume kaa nyɛ maa na nɔ́ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ?<verse eid="LUK 12:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Moo hyɛ nɛ o kɛ nɔ nɛ wo munyu kɛ wo o he ɔ nɛ dla loko ji munyu ɔ nɛ e ya su sane yelɔ ɔ hɛ mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko ya bu mo fɔ ngɛ ma hɛ mi nɛ a ya wo mo tsu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ejakaa ke e ba mi ja a, o be o he yee, ja o wo o hiɔ ɔ kulaa loko ji a maa ngmɛɛ o he.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Hiɔwe blɔ ɔ bli we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Maa pee be nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, a ba de Yesu ke Pilato ha nɛ a gbe Yuda bi komɛ nɛ je Galilea ba ngɛ bɔ sae ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ ngɛ Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Nɛ e bi ke, “Anɛ nyɛ susuu kaa Yuda bi nɛ ɔmɛ a ji yayami peeli pe Galilea tsɛmɛ kpa amɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ a kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Dabi! I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, ja a kɛ̃ nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ hɛ mi ma kpata ke ji nyɛ tsakee we nyɛ tsui nɛ nyɛɛ ba Mawu ngɔ.<verse eid="LUK 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Nɛ nihi nyɔngma kɛ kpaanyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ Siloam tsu ɔ ku pue a nɔ nɛ a gbo ɔ nɛɛ, anɛ mɛ ji yayami peeli nɛ pe kulaa ngɛ Yerusalem lo? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Dabi! Se mohu ja a kɛ̃ nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ hɛ mi ma kpata, ja nyɛ tsake nyɛ tsui.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ ke, “Nɔ ko ya du tso ko nɛ ngɛ kaa mangoo tso ngɛ e ngmɔ mi. Se tso ɔ wui. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, e de ngmɔ nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ ke, ‘Jeha etɛ ji nɛ nɛ tso nɛ ɔ wui yiblii kake po. Mɛni he je nɛ e sa kaa ma puɛ be ngɛ e he. E sa nɛ wa wo lejɛ ɔ kɛ du nɔ́ kpa ko. Moo po lɛ kɛ fɔ si.’<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Se ngmɔ nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ de lɛ ke, ‘Mo ha lɛ jeha kake hu kɛ piɛ he. I ma wo e sisi niye ni nɛ ma hyɛ ha. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ke e wo yiblii hwɔɔ se jeha a, e hi, se ke pi ja a lɛɛ i ma po lɛ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ eko ɔ, benɛ e ngɛ ni tsɔɔe ngɛ kpe he ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />e na yo ko nɛ e se kpɛ, maa pee jeha nyɔngma kɛ kpaanyɔ sɔuu ji nɛ nɛ e nyɛ we e mi nɛ e kpa.<verse eid="LUK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu tsɛ lɛ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “A tsa o hiɔ ɔ ha mo!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Nɛ Yesu ta e he kɛkɛ nɛ e se ɔ bɔle nɛ e nyɛ da si tutuutu. Yo ɔ bua jɔ saminya nɛ e na Mawu si, nɛ e je e yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Se enɛ ɔ ngɔɛ Yuda no nɔkɔtɔma nɛ ji kpe he ɔ nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ nya. E mi mi fu, ejakaa Yesu tsa nɔ ɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi nɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e de ni ɔmɛ ke, “Ni tsumi ligbi ekpa sɔuu nɛ ngɛ otsi ɔ mi. Jamɛ a ligbi ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ e sa kaa nyɛɛ ba ngɛ nɛ a tsa nyɛ hiɔ ɔmɛ ha nyɛ, se tsa pi Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Se Nutsɔ ɔ ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mo osatotsɛ! Anɛ o tsu we ni ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ lo? O je we o nahi ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ nɛ o kpakaa mɛ nɛ a ya nuu nyu lo? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Anɛ e dɛ kaa i pineɔ Yuda yo nɛ ɔ nɛ Abosiami ngɔ lɛ nyɔguɛ jeha nyɔngma kɛ kpaanyɔ sɔuu ji nɛ ɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ lo?”<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />E heto nɛ ɔ ha nɛ zo gbe e he nyɛli ɔmɛ. Nɛ ni ɔmɛ a bua jɔ ngɛ nyakpɛ níhi slɔɔtohi nɛ e tsu ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="LUK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsa nɔ bɔni mɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he ni tsɔɔmi. Nɛ e bi ke, “Kɛ Matsɛyemi ɔ ngɛ kɛɛ, nɛ mɛni he nɛ wa ma wo lɛ kɛ to? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />E ngɛ kaa wu nyafii ko nɛ ngɛ kaa kabɔte wu nɛ a du ngɛ abɔɔ mi; be bɔɔ se ɔ, e puɛɛ nɛ e bɔɔ agbo nɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi ba maa tsu ngɛ mi nɛ a naa sihi he.” <verse eid="LUK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Nɛ e bi ekohu ke, “Mɛni he nɛ wa ma wo Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ ngɔ to? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />E ngɛ kaa tsopa nɛ haa nɛ ma fuɔ, nɛ ke a pɔtɔ ngɔ wo ma mi ɔ, o be nae kaa e ngɛ ni tsue kɛ ya si ma a ma fu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu kpa ma amɛ kɛ kɔpekɔpe ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ e ngɛ ni tsɔɔe. Se be tsuaa be ɔ, e wo e hɛ ngɔ pi Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Nɔ ko bi lɛ ke, “Awetsɛ, nihi bɔɔ pɛ a yi wami nɛ a ma he lo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Hiɔwe blɔ o bli we. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ wlua nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ na blɔ kɛ sɛ mi, ejakaa nihi fuu maa plee e mi sɛmi he, se a be nyɛe maa sɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Ejakaa ke be nɛ wetsɛ ɔ ngmɛ sinya a pɛ kɛkɛ be ɔ be. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi pɛ nyɛ tlɔ sinya a se. Nɛ ke nyɛ si nɛ nyɛ de ke,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">‘Nutsɔ, mo bli wɔ’ ɔ, e ma ha nyɛ heto ke, ‘I li nyɛ!’<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Nɛ nyɛ ma de ke, ‘Waa kɛ mo nɛ yeɔ ni nɛ o tsɔɔ ni, nɛ o fiɛɔ ngɛ wa ma mi gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Se e ma ka nɔ nɛ e ma de nyɛ ke, ‘I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke i li nyɛ. Nyɛ be hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ nyɛe maa ba. Nyɛɛ je hiɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ho, nyɛ nɛ nyɛ peeɔ níhi nɛ dɛ ɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Nɛ benɛ nyɛ tlɔ sinya a se ɔ; nyɛ maa na Abraham kɛ Isak kɛ Yakob kɛ gbali ɔmɛ tsuo ngɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi, nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi ji be nɛ nyɛ ma fo ya nɛ nyɛ ma kpe nyɛ lungu nya. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ejakaa nihi maa je jejeeje tsuo nɛ a ma ba hi a hi he ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Nɛ e maa ba mi kaa nihi nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ no ko bui mɛ ɔ, a maa wo a hɛ mi nyami ngɛ lejɛ ɔ; nɛ nihi nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, mɛ nɛ a buu saminya a, a be nɔ ko hinee kulaa ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />E tu munyu nɛ ɔ se, e kɛ we nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ ekomɛ ba de lɛ ke, “O nɛ, ke o suɔ kaa a ko gbe mo ɔ, lɛɛ moo je hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ o ho, ejakaa Matsɛ Herode ngɛ hlae ma kpata o hɛ mi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Nyɛ ya de jamɛ a kɔkɔbo ɔ ke, i ma ya nɔ ma hiaa mumi yayami ɔmɛ; nɛ i ma tsu nyakpɛ nihi; nɛ i ma tsa hiɔhi mwɔnɛ ɔ kɛ hwɔɔ; nɛ ligbi nɛ ji etɛ ɔ, i ma gbe ye ni tsumi ɔ nya. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Anɔkuale i, mwɔnɛ ɔ kɛ hwɔɔ kɛ hwɔɔ se; nɛ nɔ ko be Mawu gbalɔ ɔ nyɛe maa gbe ngɛ he kpa ko kaa ja ngɛ Yerusalem pɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Oo Yerusalem, Yerusalem, mo ma nɛ o gbee gbali ɔmɛ; mo ma nɛ o fiaa nihi nɛ a tsɔ mɛ nɛ a ba ye kɛ bua mo ɔ tɛ. Si nyɛmɛ nɛ i hla we kaa ma bua o bi ɔmɛ a nya kaa bɔ nɛ kungwɔ buaa e bimɛ a nya ngɔ woɔ e pɛli sisi nɛ e buu a nɔ ɔ, se o kplɛɛ we? <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />O nɛ, jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ a si o we ɔ ha mo we doku. Nɛ o be mi nae hu kɛ ya si be mi nɛ o ma de ke, ‘A gbaa nɔ nɛ ma ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ eko nɔ ɔ, Yesu ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe mi no ko we mi nɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ ngɛ lɛ hwɔɔe pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ejakaa a ngɛ hlae nɛ a hyɛ ha kaa e ma tsa nyumu hiɔtsɛ ko nɛ ngɛ kumi hiɔ nue ɔ lo.<verse eid="LUK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu bi Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ke, “E da kaa a tsaa hiɔtsɛ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ aloo e dɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Se a ha we lɛ heto. Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu ta hiɔtsɛ ɔ dɛ mi nɛ e tsa lɛ nɛ e wo lɛ blɔ kɛ ho.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Nɛ e plɛ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ti mɛnɔ nɛ e tsu we ni ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ? Ke o na yo nɔ muɔ mi ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, o be lɛ jee lo?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Se munyu nɛ ɔ hu a nyɛ we lɛ heto nɛ a ha. Nyɛ ko hua blɔ nya he. <verse eid="LUK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Benɛ e to he hɛ kaa nihi nɛ a tsɛ mɛ ni yemi ɔmɛ tsuo ngɛ hlae kaa a ma ya hi okplɔɔ ɔ yi ma je ɔ, e slɔ mɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Ke a kpee mo kɛ ya yo kpeemi niye ni he ɔ, mo ko sɛ hlami kɛ ya hi okplɔɔ yi ma je. Eko ɔ, a tsɛ nɔ ko nɛ hine nɔkɔtɔma nɛ hɛ mi jiɔ pe mo. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ke jamɛatsɛ ɔ ba a, nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ ni yemi ɔ ma ba de mo ke, ‘Mo ha awetsɛ nɛ ɔ blɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ o ya hi he kpa’. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi pɛ zo maa gbe mo nɛ o ma ya hi okplɔɔ nane si blɔ.<verse eid="LUK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Nɔ́ nɛ hi kaa o pee mohu ji kaa o ya hi okplɔɔ ɔ nane si ma je. Nɛ ke nɔ nɛ tsɛ ni yemi ɔ ba nɛ e ba na mo ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, e ma de mo ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ke, ‘Ye huɛ, moo ba hiɛ ɔ nɛ o ba hi okplɔɔ ɔ yi ma je.’ Jamɛ a be ɔ mi pɛ kɛkɛ a wo o hɛ mi nyami ngɛ ma hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hlaa kaa e ma wo e he nɔ ɔ, a maa ba lɛ si; nɛ nɔ nɛ baa e he si ɔ, a ma wo e nɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e de wetsɛ ɔ nɛ tsɛ lɛ ni yemi ɔ ke, “Ke o ngmɛ okplɔɔ ɔ, mo ko tsɛ huɛmɛ kɛ nyɛmimɛ kɛ wekuli kɛ niatsɛmɛ. Ejakaa mɛ hu a maa ngmɛ okplɔɔ nɛ a ma tsɛ mo ni yemi. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Se mohu ɔ, o tsɛ ohiafohi kɛ akpaketsɛmɛ kɛ hɛ yuyuili. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, a maa jɔɔ mo, nɛ ngɛ hwɔɔ se dali a si temi ɔ mi ɔ, Mawu maa wo mo hiɔ kaa o tsɛ nihi nɛ a be mo nane mi nyɛe maa to.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Benɛ e de enɛ ɔ, nɔ ko nɛ e kɛ lɛ ngɛ niye he ɔ de lɛ ke, “E ma ji he blɔ agbo kɛ ha nɔ nɛ maa sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi hwɔɔ se.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu bu abɛ nɛ ɔ kɛ ha munyu ɔ heto ke, “Nyumu ko ngmɛ okplɔɔ ngua ko nɛ e fɔ nine tsɛ nihi fuu ke a ba ye ni ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Benɛ a gbe nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nya a, e tsɔ konɛ a ya de ni ɔmɛ nɛ e tsɛ ni yemi ɔ kaa be ɔ su se a ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Se ni ɔmɛ bɔni a nya jemi kulaa. Nɔ kake ke e ya he zugba nɛ e yaa nɛ e ya hyɛ ha, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e be nyɛe maa ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Nɔ kake hu ke e he na kuhi nyɔngma nɛ e yaa nɛ e ya ka mɛ kɛ humi nɛ e hyɛ ha. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Nɔ kpa hu ke piɔ pɛ nɛ e ngɔ yo he, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e be nyɛe maa ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Tsɔlɔ ɔ kpale kɛ ba bɔ e nutsɔ ɔ nɔ́ nɛ ni ɔmɛ de ɔ. E nutsɔ ɔ muklii mi fu saminya nɛ e de tsɔlɔ ɔ ke e he nɛ sɔ nɛ e ya gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ blɔ kpɛ ɔmɛ nɛ e ya tsɛ ni bali ɔmɛ kɛ akpaketsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ hɛ yuyuili ɔmɛ nɛ e maa na a tsuo kɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Tsɔlɔ ɔ ba nɛ e ba de e nutsɔ ɔ ke e pee bɔ nɛ e de lɛ ɔ, se blɔ ngɛ kɛ sa.<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />E nutsɔ ɔ de lɛ ke, ‘Yaa kɔpekɔpe ɔmɛ a mi kɛ blɔ ɔmɛ a he nɛ o nyɛ a nɔ nɛ a ba, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ye we ɔ nɛ e hyi. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Se ma de nyɛ anɔkuale mi kaa niye ni nɛ ɔ nya bɔbɔɛ kake pohu be nihi nɛ i tsɛ kekle ɔ a ti nɔ ko nya mi yae.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Ligbi ko benɛ nihi fuu nyɛɛ e se ɔ, e plɛ e he nɛ e de mɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Nɔ nɛ maa nyɛɛ ye se ɔ, e sa kaa e suɔ mi pe e tsɛ loo e nyɛ loo e yo loo e bimɛ loo e nyɛmimɛ yihi kɛ nyumuhi. E sa nɛ e suɔ mi pe bɔ nɛ e suɔ lɛ nitsɛ e wami, ke pi ja a, e be nyɛe maa pee ye kaselɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ nɛ e kase mi ɔ, lɛɛ e wo lɛ nitsɛ e sɛumi tso ɔ ngɔ tloo nɛ e nyɛɛ ye se.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Se loko ji o maa nyɛɛ ye se ɔ, moo ka o he nɛ o hyɛ ha kaa o ma nyɛ lo? Ejakaa mɛnɔ nɛ ke e yaa ma tsu ɔ, e hyɛ ha kaa e ngɛ sika bɔ nɛ maa su tsu ɔ mami nya lo? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ke e pee we ja a, e be tsu ɔ nya nyɛe maa gbe, nɛ ma maa muɔ lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />A ma de ke, ‘Hyɛ nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ ha, e je tsu nɛ ɔ mami sisi se e nyɛ we nya nɛ e gbe ejakaa e sika ta.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Aloo matsɛ te nɔ nɛ hiaa ta ke e kɛ matsɛ kpa yaa kpe be mi nɛ e kɛ e ga woli kpi nɛ e hyɛ ha kaa e ta bimɛ akpe nyɔngma a ma nyɛ matsɛ kpa a e ta bimɛ akpe nyingmi enyɔ ɔ nya maa da lo?<verse eid="LUK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nɛ ke e na kaa e be nyɛɛ a nya maa da a, lɛɛ benɛ he nyɛlɔ ɔ ta a ba na we lɛ lolo ɔ, e tsɔɔ kɛ ya haa yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ ke nɔ ko suɔ kaa e nyɛɛ ye se ɔ, ja e hi si nɛ e hyɛ nihi slɔɔtohi nɛ ngɛ e dɛ ɔ, nɛ e ma nya si kaa ngɛ ye he ɔ, e ma si kulaa se, loko ji e ma nyɛ maa pee ye kaselɔ.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Mɛni se nami nɛ ngɛ ngo nɛ ngɔɔmi ta mi he? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Se nami ko kulaa be ngo nɛ mɛmɛɛmɛ ta mi he hu. O be nyɛe ma kɛ wo ngmɔ ni po sisi. E he be se nami hu nɛ e sa nɛ a muɔ kɛ pue he. Nyɛɛ bu tue saminya nɛ nyɛ kɔ ye munyu nɛ ɔ se.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Nɔ nɛ laa nɛ a na ekohu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Jua tsuli nɛ a le mɛ kaa ojo fiali kɛ yayami peeli kpanakuhi ba buɔ Yesu fiɛmi ɔ tue. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Se enɛ ɔ ngɔɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a nya; e dɛ ha mɛ kaa Yesu kɛ nihi kaa ja a ngɛ bɔe nɛ be komɛ tete po e kɛ mɛ yeɔ ni. Nɛ a bɔni nya si hɔɔmi ngɛ e he. <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, Yesu bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ ke, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ke o ngɛ to lafa nɛ kake tlɔ nga a, o be to nyingmi nɛɛ kɛ nɛɛ ɔ nɛ piɛ ɔ sie nɛ o ya hla nɔ nɛ laa a kɛ ya si o maa na lɛ lo? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ke o na lɛ ɔ, o be lɛ woe kɛ fɔ o konɔ kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ ba we mi lo? <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Nɛ ke o ba su we ɔ mi ɔ nɛ o ma tsɛ o huɛmɛ kɛ o piɛ nine nɔtsɛmɛ nɛ o bɔ mɛ amaniɛ nɛ o kɛ mɛ tsuo nɛ nya, ejakaa o na o lohwe ɔ lo?<verse eid="LUK 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ bua jɔmi maa ba hiɔwe ngɛ yayami peelɔ kake nɛ maa kpale kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ ɔ he, pe dali nyingmi nɛɛ kɛ nɛɛ nɛ tsui tsakemi ko he hia we mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Aloo yo ko ngɛ sika hiɔ kpɔ nyɔngma nɛ kake laa. Anɛ e be kane sue nɛ e hla lɛ ngɛ we ɔ mi he fɛɛ he, nɛ e be e puɔ tsuaa puɔ mi kɛ níhi a se kɛ ya si e maa na lɛ lo? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Nɛ lɛ hu ke e na e sika kpɔ nɛ laa nɛ ɔ nɛɛ, e be e huɛmɛ kɛ e piɛ nine nɔ bimɛ tsuo tsɛɛ nɛ e kɛ mɛ nɛ nya lo? <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ hiɔwe bɔfo ɔmɛ tsuo a bua jɔɔ ngɛ yayami peelɔ kake nɛ tsake e tsui ɔ he.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:10">Abɛ kpa hu nɛ e bu mɛ kɛ tsɔɔ e munyu ɔ nya ji, <verse eid="LUK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />“Nyumu ko hi si nɛ e ngɛ binyumuhi enyɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Wayotsɛ ɔ de e tsɛ ɔ ke, ‘Tsaatsɛ, i suɔ nɛ o wo níhi nɛ maa pee ye blɔ fa mi nɔ ngɛ o gbosi ni ɔmɛ a mi ɔ ngɔ ha mi nyɔnglo.’ E tsɛ ɔ kplɛɛ nɛ e dla ni ɔmɛ a mi nɛ e wo wayotsɛ ɔ nɔ ngɔ ha lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Be bɔɔ se ɔ, bi nɛ ɔ to e nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ e hia blɔ kɛ ho ma se lokoo ya. E ya bɔ huɛ yayahi nɛ e kɛ we kulaa nɛ e kpata e ni ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Be mi nɛ e ni ɔmɛ tsuo ta a pɛ nɛ hwɔ ngua ko ba zugba a nɔ; nɛ hwɔ bɔni lɛ yemi. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />E ya kpa zugba a nɔ ngmɔtsɛ ko pɛɛ nɛ e ha nɛ e ya hyɛ e kpotoohi a nɔ ha lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Hwɔ ye niheyo nɛ ɔ hluu kɛ su he ko nɛ e na nɛ nɔ ko ko ha lɛ lohwe ɔmɛ a niye ni ɔ eko nɛ e ko ye; se enɛ ɔ pohu e nɛ nɛ e ye.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Benɛ e ba hɛli e he si ɔ, e de e he ke, ‘Ami pɛ ji nɛ ɔ lo? Yaa hyɛ tsɔli kɛ sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ngɛ tsaatsɛ we ɔ mi be nɛ ɔ mi ha; a yeɔ ni hluu nɛ eko piɛɛ; nɛ ami ji nɛ ɔ nɛ muklii mi hwɔ nitsɛ maa ho mi gbemi ya. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />I ma kpale kɛ ho tsaatsɛ ngɔ ya nɛ ma ya de lɛ ke, Tsaatsɛ, i pee yayami kɛ si hiɔwe nɛ i tɔ mo hu o nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sɛ nɛ o tsɛɔ mi o bi pohu. Mo wo mi ngɔ pee o apaatsɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ ko kɛkɛ.’<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Nɛ bi nɛ ɔ ba te si nɛ e pue blɔ. Se benɛ e ma ngɛ lokoo ɔ nɛ e tsɛ ɔ na lɛ nɛ e muklii mi sa lɛ ngɛ e he nɛ e wo fo nɛ e kɛ lɛ ya kpe nɛ e ya fua lɛ atuu.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Bi ko bɔlɔ nɛ ɔ de e tsɛ ɔ ke, ‘Tsaatsɛ, i pee yayami kɛ si hiɔwe nɛ i tɔ mo hu o nɔ, nɛ e sɛ nɛ o tsɛɔ mi o bi pohu.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Se e tsɛ ɔ de e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ke, ‘Esɔ! Nyɛ ya wo tade nɛ hi, nɛ ngɛ fɛu pe kulaa a kɛ sika ga kɛ tokota amɛ nɛ nyɛ ba wo ha lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Nɛ nyɛɛ gbe na niheyo ɔ nɛ wa ngɛ lɛe nɛ e wo zɔ ɔ. Mwɔnɛ ɔ lɛɛ okplɔɔ nitsɛ nɛ wa ma tsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ejakaa ye bi nɛ ɔ ya gbeje nɛ e kpale kɛ ba, e laa nɛ wa na lɛ ekohu.’ Kɛkɛ nɛ we ɔ tsuo bɔni nyami.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Be mi nɛ enɛ ɔ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ, nɔkɔtɔmatsɛ ɔ hɛ dɔ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ ngmɔ mi. Benɛ e kpa kɛ ma we ɔ mi ɔ, e nu nɛ la kɛ do ngɛ pɛe ngɛ we ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ sɔmɔli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ e bi lɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba ngɛ we ɔ mi.<verse eid="LUK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />E de lɛ ke, ‘O senɔ ɔ nɛ ba nɛ o tsɛ ha nɛ wa gbe na niheyo nɛ wo zɔ ɔ, nɛ a ngmɛ okplɔɔ kɛ ngɛ e he nyae, ejakaa e kpale kɛ ba su we, nɛ e ngɛ kpakpataa.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Anɔkuale ji kaa sane ɔ hua tsui ha nɔkɔtɔmatsɛ ɔ saminya nɛ e kua we ɔ mi yami; se e tsɛ ɔ je kpo ba kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e ba we ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Se e de e tsɛ ɔ ke, ‘Tsaatsɛ, jehahi abɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ i ngɛ ni tsue ha mo, nɛ o de we mi hyɛ ke ma pee nɔ́ ko nɛ i kua; se apletsi bi kɛkɛ po o ha we mi kaa ma gbe nɛ i kɛ ye huɛmɛ wa kɛ nya. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Se nɛ o bi nɛ ɔ nɛ e kɛ ajuama bɔli ya kpata o nihi a hɛ mi ɔ ba a, o gbe na niheyo nɛ tu zɔ pe kulaa a ha lɛ.’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />E tsɛ ɔ de lɛ ke, ‘Hyɛ ha, ye bi, moo lɛɛ i kɛ mo ngɛ daa; nɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ji ye nɔ́ ɔ, o nɔ́ i. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Se e sa kaa wa bua nɛ jɔ nɛ wa nya, ejakaa o senɔ i; e gbo nɛ e kpale kɛ ba, e laa nɛ wa na lɛ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu bu abɛ kpa komɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Nɛ Yesu bu e kaseli ɔmɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ ke, “Niatsɛ ko hi si nɛ e ngɛ apaatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma ko nɛ e wo ngɔ to e nɔ́ ɔmɛ tsuo a nya. Se e ba na le kaa apaatsɛ nɛ ɔ yi lɛ anɔkuale.<verse eid="LUK 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e tsɛ lɛ nɛ e de lɛ ke, ‘I ngɛ nɔ́ komɛ nue ngɛ o he nɛ ngɔɛ ye nya. I na le kaa o ngɛ mi jue. I ma suɔ nɛ o ba bu mi ni ɔmɛ a he akɔtaa, ejakaa i ma he ni tsumi ɔ ngɛ o dɛ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Apaatsɛ nɛ ɔ de ngɛ e yi mi ke, ‘Tsaatsɛmɛ, i bɔ ahlua! Nɛ ni tsumi nɛ ɔ ngɛ ye dɛ jee nɛ ɔ nɛɛ kɛ i ma pee kɛɛ? I be ni tsumi kpakpataa ko nyɛe ma tsu amlɔ nɛ ɔ; nɛ bɔ nɛ i ngɛ nɛ ɔ, i ya be ni nyɛe ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />E he wɛ! I le nɔ́ nɛ ma pee kɛ na huɛmɛ nɛ maa ye kɛ bua mi hwɔɔ se ke i je hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Apaatsɛ ɔ ya tsɛ niatsɛ ɔ hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ kakaaka. E bi kekle no ɔ ke, ‘Hiɔ nyɛmɛ o hɛɛ ni tsumitsɛ ɔ?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Nɛ e ha lɛ heto ke, ‘Ye hiɔ ɔ nya ji, nu bale lafa.’ Apaatsɛ ɔ de hiɔtsɛ ɔ ke, ‘O nɛ, o hiɔ ɔ nɔ odase womi ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. Moo hi si nɛ o tsake hiɔ ɔ nɛ o pee lɛ nu bale nyingmi enuɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Apaatsɛ ɔ bi hiɔtsɛ enyɔne ɔ hu ke, ‘Nɛ mo nɛɛ, hiɔ nyɛmɛ o hɛɛ ni tsumitsɛ ɔ?’ E de lɛ ke, ‘Ngma kotoku lafa.’ ‘O nɛ, o womi ɔ ji enɛ. Moo hi si nɛ o pee lɛ nyingmi kpaanyɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />E ba mi kaa ni tsumitsɛ ɔ kɔ apaatsɛ julɔ nɛ ɔ ngɛ ga nɛ e to nɛ ɔ he je. Nɛ ja i, nimli yaya amɛ a jumi nya wa pe ni kpakpa amɛ a ní. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Se kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ i ma de nyɛ ke nyɛ hu nyɛɛ gu sisimi blɔ nɔ kɛ pee huɛ kɛɛ? Anɛ lɔ ɔ ma ha nyɛ neneene sihi he ngɛ hiɔwe hwɔɔ se lo? <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Dabi! Ejakaa ja nyɛ ye anɔkuale ngɛ ni tsɔwi a mi loko ji nyɛ ma nyɛ maa ye anɔkuale ngɛ ni agbohi a mi. Ke nyɛ fiaa ojo ngɛ ni tsɔwi a mi ɔ, nyɛ be anɔkuale nyɛe maa ye ngɛ blɔ nya agbo nɛ a ma kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ hu mi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko be he nyɛe ma ngɔ fɔ nyɛ nɔ ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi níhi a mi ɔ nɛɛ, mɛnɔ maa to hiɔwe níhi nɛ ji anɔkuale ni nami ɔ ngɔ wo nyɛ dɛ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ke nyɛ nyɛ we ni kpahi a sika nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ ɔ, kɛ maa pee nɛ a maa to nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ nɔ́ kɛ wo nyɛ dɛ kɛɛ?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Ejakaa nɔ ko be tsɛmɛ enyɔ nyɛe ma sɔmɔ. Bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ ji ɔ, e maa nyɛ nɔ kake nɛ e maa suɔ nɔ kake. Nyɛ be Mawu kɛ sika tsuo nyɛe ma sɔmɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Se e munyu ɔ pee Farisi bi ɔmɛ tai, ejakaa a suɔ sika saminya.<verse eid="LUK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ toɔ nyɛ hɛ mi ngɛ ma hɛ mi kaa nimli kpakpahi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nihi buu nyɛ; se Mawu lɛɛ e le nyɛ tsui mi yayami ɔmɛ. Nɛ nyɛ osato ni peemi ni ɔmɛ haa nɛ nimli woɔ nyɛ hɛ mi nyami, se Mawu lɛɛ a ji musu ngɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Loko ji Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ maa je e fiɛmi ɔ sisi ɔ, Mose mlaa amɛ kɛ gbali ɔmɛ a munyu ɔmɛ ji nyɛ blɔ tsɔɔmi níhi. Se Yohane ba fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ e de ke, Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ na nyɛ ta, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nihi fuu bɔni e mi sɛmi blɔ hlae jehanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Se lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa mlaa be he wami ko hu. Mlaa a daa si kpɛii kaa bɔ nɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba daa si ɔ. E mi eko tsakee we.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Nɛ ja a he je ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ fieɔ e yo nɛ e ya ngɔɔ yo kpa a, e puɛ gba; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɔɔ yo nɛ e huno ngmɛɛ e he ɔ, lɛ hu e puɛ gba.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Nɛ Yesu de ke, “Nyumu niatsɛ ko hi si nɛ e woɔ tade kpakpa nɛ e yeɔ ni kpakpa. E hi si ngɛ bua jɔmi mi saminya. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ligbi ko ɔ, a wo ohiafo patsɛ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Lazaro ɔ kɛ ba fɔ niatsɛ nɛ ɔ e we ɔ agbo ɔ nya. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Be mi nɛ e fɔɔ si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɛ niye ni bibliwi nɛ maa je niatsɛ ɔ okplɔɔ nɔ kɛ pue si hlae nɛ e ye ɔ, gbehi baa nɛ a ba hii e pa amɛ a nɔ lɔe ha lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, Lazaro ba gbo nɛ hiɔwe bɔfo ɔmɛ ba wo lɛ kɛ ho dali nɛ je je mi ɔ a hi he ya ngɛ Abraham mi si. Pee se ɔ niatsɛ ɔ hu ba gbo nɛ a ya to lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Nɛ a wo e susuma a kɛ ho abosiamihi a je ya. Benɛ e ngɛ nɔ́ nae ɔ, e na Lazaro mane jee ngɛ Abraham ngɔ.<verse eid="LUK 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Nɛ e hia ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ lɛ nɛ e de ke, ‘Tsaatsɛ Abraham, moo na mi mɔbɔ nɛ o ha nɛ Lazaro nɛ e wo e nine nguɛ kɛ ya gbɔ nyu mi nɛ e ba dɛ ngɔ fɔ ye lilɛ nɔ kɛkɛ ha mi, ejakaa i ngɛ nɔ́ nae ngɛ la nɛ ɔ mi.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Se Abraham de lɛ ke, ‘Binyumu, mo kai kaa o wami be ɔ mi ɔ nɔ́ ko he hia we mo; o na nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o ngɛ hlae, se Lazaro ye ohia. Nɛ ja a he je ɔ, a ngɛ lɛ hu e bua jɔɔe nɛ mo hu o ngɛ nɔ́ nae nɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ se hu ɔ, dɔ voo ko po wa kpɛti nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛe maa je wa ngɔ kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ, nɛ nɔ ko be nyɛe maa je nyɛ ngɔ kɛ ba wa ngɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Niatsɛ ɔ de Abraham ke, ‘Lɛɛ i kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o tsɔ lɛ kɛ ya tsaatsɛ we ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />I ngɛ nyɛmimɛ nyumuhi enuɔ ngɛ we ɔ mi nɛ e ya ha nɛ a le bɔ nɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ ngɛ ha; bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko ba hiɛ ɔ hwɔɔ se ke a gbo ɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Se Abraham de lɛ ke, ‘Ngmami ɔmɛ ngɛ a dɛ ngɛ mɛ si hɛlie daa. O nyɛminyumu ɔmɛ ma nyɛ kane be fɛɛ be nɛ a suɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Se niatsɛ ɔ ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, ‘Tsaatsɛ Abraham, a be se die nɛ a kane. Se ke nɔ ko je gbeje kɛ ya de mɛ ɔ, lɛɛ a ma pia a he nɛ a ma tsake a tsui.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abraham de lɛ ke, ‘Ke ji a be Mose kɛ gbali ɔmɛ tue bue ɔ, lɛɛ ke a tsɔ nɔ ko kɛ je gbeje kɛ ya a ngɔ nitsɛ po a be lɛ tue bue.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ligbi ko ɔ Yesu de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Ka nɛ haa nɛ nɔ peeɔ yayami ɔ, e ngɛ daa. Se mohu due ha nɔ nɛ nɔ nɛ ka maa gu kɛ ba a. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Afani nɛ a wo tɛ agbo ngɔ muɔ jamɛatsɛ ɔ kuɛ nɛ a ya sake lɛ ngɔ fɔ wo mi pe nɔ́ nɛ a ma de ke a ngɛ e tue sae, ke e ha nɛ bi tsɔwi nɛ ɔmɛ eko nane maa tɔtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Nyɛ ko de ke i de we nyɛ. I ngɛ nyɛ si woe!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Ke o nyɛmi pee yayami ɔ, mo kã e hɛ mi. Nɛ ke e na e tɔmi ɔ nɛ e pia e he ɔ, mo ngɔ ke lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ke ji kaa ngɛ ligbi kake mi tete ɔ, e ma tɔ o nɔ si kpaago se e ma kpa mo pɛɛ ngɛ eko fɛɛ eko he ɔ, mo wo ngɔ ke lɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hemi kɛ yemi kɛ si nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Ligbi ko ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ de lɛ ke, “Wa suɔ kaa wa na hemi kɛ yemi nɛ hiɛ pe bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ piɔ nɛ ɔ. Moo tsɔɔ wɔ bɔ nɛ wa maa pee kɛ na.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ke nyɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi bɔbɔyoo kaa wu nyafii ko nɛ ngɛ kaa kabɔte wu kɛkɛ po ɔ, nyɛ ma nyɛ de tso nɛ maa si nɛ ɔ ke, moo hia kɛ ya nɔ wo mi nɛ e maa hia. Nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma de ɔ, e maa ba mi nɔuu. <verse eid="LUK 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Ke sɔmɔlɔ je ngmɔ mi loo lohwehi a ni hami kɛ ba a, e ba hi we si nɛ e yeɔ ni. <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Se mohu e ya hooɔ e nutsɔ ɔ niye ni kekle nɛ e kɛ ya haa lɛ nɛ e yeɔ. Nɛ lɔ ɔ se loko ji lɛ nitsɛ hu e yeɔ ni. <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Nɛ jamɛ a sɔmɔlɔ ɔ na we sina ko tete, ejakaa e blɔ nya ni kɛkɛ nɛ e ngɛ tsue. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ ke nyɛ hu nyɛ bu mi tue nɛ nyɛ pee níhi nɛ i de nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ ko hyɛ blɔ kaa a ma je nyɛ yi. Ejakaa nyɛ blɔ nya ni kɛkɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsue.”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Benɛ a tsa a blɔ nyɛɛmi ɔ nɔ kɛ yaa Yerusalem ɔ, a ya su Galilea kɛ Samaria huzu ɔ nya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Nɛ a maa ho kɔpe ko mi sɛmi ya pɛ nɛ a na nyumuhi hiɔ tsutsɛmɛ nyɔngma nɛ daa si ngɛ se lokoo. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />A ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ngɛ dee ke, “Mawetsɛ Yesu, moo na wɔ mɔbɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />E hyɛ mɛ too nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ya nɛ nyɛ wo nyɛ he kɛ ya tsɔɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a osɔfo ɔ kaa a tsa nyɛ.” Nɛ benɛ a ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ kɛ yaa a, a na kaa hiɔ ɔ jɔ ha mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />A ti nɔ kake lɛɛ e kpale kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Sina ha Mawu, a tsa mi!” <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ba wo e hɛ mi ngɔ bu si ngɛ Yesu hlami nɛ e na lɛ si. Nyumu nɛ ɔ, Samaria bi nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ bui mɛ ɔ eko ji lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Se Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Tsa pi nihi nyɔngma nɛ i tsa a lo? Jije nihi nɛɛ ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ ngɛ? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Nubwɔ nɛ ɔ pɛ nɛ kpale kɛ ba Mawu si nami lo?”<verse eid="LUK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo te si nɛ o ho. O hemi kɛ yemi ɔ tsa mo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ dla nyɛ he kɛ to ye bami ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ bi Yesu ke, “Mɛni be nɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ maa je sisi?” E ha mɛ heto ke, “A be Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ bami ɔ nae kɛ hɛ ngmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Nɔ ko be nyɛe ma de ke, ‘E je sisi ngɛ hiɛ aloo ngɛ zugba a nɔ lejɛ ma je,’ ejakaa Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ nyɛ mi nɛ e ngɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Pee se ɔ, e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ tu enɛ ɔ he munyu ekohu nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Be ma nɛ nyɛ ma hla Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ nɛ e hi nyɛ ngɔ ligbi kake pɛ kɛkɛ se nyɛ be lɛ nae. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Nɛ nyɛ maa nu nɛ a ma de ke i kpale kɛ ba, nɛ i ngɛ hiɛ, aloo i ngɛ lejɛ. Nyɛ ko he ye, nɛ nyɛ ko hia blɔ ke nyɛ ngɛ mi hlae. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ejakaa ke i kpale kɛ ba a, nyɛ maa le paa kaa i ba. E maa je si paa kaa bɔ nɛ oslabai gbaa a. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Se loko ji jamɛ a be ɔ maa su ɔ, i ma na nɔ́ wawɛɛ nɛ ma a tsuo ma kua mi.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Be mi nɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa kpale kɛ ba a, je ɔ maa hi kaa bɔ nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ Noa yi nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />A ngɛ ni yee nɛ a ngɛ da nue; a ngɛ yo ngɔe nɛ a ngɛ gba hae; nɛ a ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ pee bɔ nɛ a peeɔ daa a kɛ ya si be nɛ Noa sɛ lɛ ɔ mi nɛ nyu ɔ ba kpata nɔ tsuaa nɔ hɛ mi ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Nɛ je ɔ maa hi kaa bɔ nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ Lot yi nɔ ɔ; a ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ pee kaa bɔ nɛ a peeɔ daa a. Nihi ya ni tsumi, a ngɛ ni yee nɛ a ngɛ ni nue; nihi ngɛ jua yee; a ngɛ ngmɔ hue nɛ a ngɛ tsu mae, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />hluu kɛ ya si mɔtu ɔ nɛ Lot hia blɔ kɛ je Sodom nɛ la kɛ hiɔmi tɛ ba nɛ pue ma a nɔ nɛ e kpata nɔ tsuaa nɔ hɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ e maa ba mi kɛ ya si ngmlɛfia nɔ nɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa kpale kɛ ba a.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, mo nɔ nɛ o be we mi ɔ, o ko de ke o maa ya we mi ya to o níhi ngɛ we ɔ mi. Nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ ngmɔ mi ɔ a ko de ke a ma ma a mi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Nyɛ kai nɔ́ nɛ ba Lot yo ɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma hla kaa e maa baa e wami yi ɔ, e maa je e dɛ; nɛ nɔ nɛ e wami maa je e dɛ ɔ, e nine maa su nɔ ekohu. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Jamɛ a nyɔ ɔ mi ɔ nyumuhi enyɔ maa hwɔ si ngɛ sa kake nɔ nɛ a ma wo nɔ kake nɛ a ma si nɔ kake. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Yihi enyɔ maa hi wɛ kake se. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />A ma wo nɔ kake nɛ a ma si nɔ kake. Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ nyumuhi enyɔ maa hi hue ngɛ a bi a kasa mi ngɛ ngmɔ mi nɛ a ma wo nɔ kake nɛ a ma si nɔ kake.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, jije a ma wo mɛ kɛ ho?” E ha mɛ heto ke, “He nɛ nɔ gbogboe ngɛ ɔ, lejɛ ɔ nɛ okpokuhi buaa a he nya ngɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ hɛɛ sɔlemi mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Ligbi ko ɔ Yesu bu e kaseli ɔmɛ abɛ ko kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ bɔ nɛ e he hia kaa a sɔle daa nɛ e ko ti mɛ kɛ ya si a nine maa su nɔ́ nɛ he pɛɛ nɛ a ngɛ kpae ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />E de mɛ ke, “Kojolɔ ko hi si ngɛ ma ko mi. E ji nɔ ko nɛ bui nɔmlɔ nɛ e yi Mawu gbeye hulɔ.<verse eid="LUK 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Yo ko nɛ e huno gbo, nɛ lɛ hu e ngɛ jamɛ a ma a mi ɔ ya kojolɔ nɛ ɔ ngɔ si abɔ ngɛ e kɛ nyumu ko nɛ ye lɛ awi ɔ a kpɛti munyu he ke e hyɛ mi ha lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kojolɔ nɛ ɔ pui yo ɔ nya mi kulaa. Se pee se ɔ, kojolɔ ɔ de e he ke, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />‘I yi Mawu gbeye nɛ i wo we nɔmlɔ kɛ pee we nɔ́ ko, se jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ yo nɛ ɔ munyu ba ti mi, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ma hyɛ ha lɛ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ de mɛ ke, “Ke ji nɔ́ bimi nɛ a yɛ se ɔ maa ti kojolɔ nɔmlɔ yayami nɛ ɔ po nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e maa ma nya si kaa e maa pee nɔ nɛ a ngɛ lɛ bie ɔ nɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />anɛ nyɛ he we yi kaa Mawu maa ye lɛ nitsɛ e nihi nɛ ngɛ lɛ pee kpae daa nyɔ kɛ pia a a sane ha mɛ lo? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />E ma ha mɛ heto mla! Se mohu sane ɔ ji kaa benɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa kpale kɛ ba a, nihi nyɛmɛ e ma ba na kaa a ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ zugba a nɔ nɛ a ngɛ sɔlee?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Nɛ e bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ kɔɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ fiaa kaa dali ji mɛ nɛ a bui ni kpahi ɔmɛ a he:<verse eid="LUK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Nyumuhi enyɔ ya Sɔlemi We ɔ ke a yaa sɔle. Nɔ kake ɔ, Farisi no he wolɔ kɛ he nɔ wolɔ nɛ buu e he dalɔ ji lɛ; nɛ nɔ kpa a hu jua tsulɔ kɛ nɔ sisilɔ ji lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Farisi no ɔ ho da si ngɛ he ko banee nɛ e sɔle ke, ‘Mawu, i naa mo si kaa i pi yayami peelɔ kaa ni komɛ, titli ɔ, kaa jua tsulɔ nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Ejakaa i sisi we nɔ ko hyɛ nɛ i bɔɛ ajuama. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />I hiɔɔ ngma si enyɔ ngɛ otsi mi; nɛ i woɔ ye níhi nɛ i naa kulaa a mi dlami nyɔngma mi kake ngɔ haa Mawu.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Se jua tsulɔ, ojo fialɔ ɔ da si ngɛ se lokoo, nɛ e wo we e hɛ mi nɔ nɛ e hyɛ hiɔwe po, se mohu e wo he hiami kɛ ngɛ e gugue gbee ngɛ kɔmɔ yee kɛ ngɛ dee ke, ‘Mawu, moo na ami yayami peelɔ nɛ ɔ mɔbɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi kaa tsa pi Farisi no ɔ, se mohu yayami peelɔ nɛ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ a wo e bimihi tsuo ngɔ ke. Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ woɔ e he nɔ ɔ, a maa ba lɛ si, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ baa e he si ɔ, a ma wo e nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Be ko ɔ binyɛmɛ komɛ wo a bi tsɔwi kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ ke e wo e nine ngɔ ta a he nɛ e jɔɔ mɛ. Se kaseli ɔmɛ wo fɔli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi la nɛ a fie mɛ ke a ho.<verse eid="LUK 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Se Yesu tsɛ jokuɛwi ɔmɛ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e de kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ bi tsɔwi ɔmɛ nɛ a ba ye ngɔ. Nyɛ ko tsi mɛ blɔ, ejakaa nihi nɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi kaa bi tsɔwi nɛ ɔmɛ mohu a nɔ́ ji Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ e hemi kɛ yemi be kaa bi tsɔwi nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ́ ɔ, e be Matsɛyemi ɔ agbo ɔ mi sɛe ligbi ko.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Niatsɛ ɔ kɛ e haomi ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ligbi ko ɔ Yuda no asafo nɔkɔtɔma ko bi lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ kpakpa, kɛ ma pee kɛɛ nɛ ma na neneene wami?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ ‘nɔ kpakpa’ a nɛ o ngɛ mi tsɛe ɔ o nuɔ sisi saminya lo? Nɔ ko be nɛ ji nɔ kpakpa ja Mawu nɔ kake too pɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />O le mlaa nyɔngma amɛ kulaa. Ekomɛ ji, ‘Mo ko bɔ ajuama, mo ko gbe nɔmlɔ, mo ko ju, mo ko ye lakpa, moo bu o fɔli’ kɛ nɔ́ nɛmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Nyumu ɔ de Yesu ke, “I ye mlaa nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa nɔ kɛ je ye jokuɛ mi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “E piɛ mo nɔ́ kake. Moo ya nɛ o ya jua o níhi kulaa nɛ o ngɛ nɛ o wo sika a ngɔ ke ohiafohi nɛ o ma na weto ni ngɛ hiɔwe konɛ o ba nyɛɛ ye se.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Se benɛ nyumu ɔ nu enɛ ɔ, e po e he nɛ e je mɔbɔmɔbɔ, ejakaa e ngɛ níhi fuu. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu hyɛ e kuɛ se mi mane nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ e he wa ha niatsɛ ha kaa e maa sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />E he wɛ ha afukpɔngɔ kaa e maa sɛ abui puɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ e he wa ha niatsɛ kaa e maa sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Benɛ ni ɔmɛ nu munyu nɛ ɔ, a bi ke, “Lɛɛ mɛnɔ yi wami nɛ a ma he mɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />E ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Nɔ́ nɛ he wa ha adesa a, e he wɛ ha Mawu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro de lɛ ke, “O na kaa wa si wa wehi nɛ wa ba nyɛɛ o se.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Niinɛ i; nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ si e we, e yo, nyɛmimɛ nyumuhi, fɔli loo bimɛ ngɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />a maa to lɛ ngwɔ he si abɔ ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi, nɛ e ma na neneene wami hulɔ ngɛ je nɛ maa ba a mi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ le kaa wa yaa Yerusalem, nɛ níhi kulaa nɛ blema gbali ɔmɛ gba ngɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ he ɔ maa ba mi ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ejakaa a ma je lɛ ngɔ wo je mi bimɛ a dɛ nɛ a maa pee lɛ nisɛ ni a ni; a maa ye e he fɛu, nɛ a maa la lada ngɔ pue e nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />A maa fiaa lɛ kpa nɛ a maa gbe le, nɛ ligbi nɛ ji etɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, e maa te si ekohu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Se kaseli ɔmɛ nui munyu ɔmɛ nɛ e tu ɔ ekoeko sisi. E pee mɛ kaa nɔ nɛ alobalo nɛ e ngɛ siae.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Benɛ a maa ho Yeriko ma a mi sɛmi ya a, a na hɛ ngmɛ yuyuilɔ ko nɛ hii si ngɛ blɔ ɔ he ngɛ ni bae. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Benɛ e nu kaa nihi fuu bee ɔ, e bi ke mɛni a ngɛ pee lo. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />A de lɛ ke Yesu Nazaret no ɔ nɛ e bee. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ bɔni ngmlaa kpami ke, “Yesu, David Bi, moo na mi mɔbɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ hlami ɔ bɔni lɛ demi kɛ e pee kɔ. Se si abɔ nɛ a ngɛ lɛ dee ke e pee kɔ ɔ, si abɔ nɛ ngmlaa a nya ngɛ wae ji lɔ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Benɛ Yesu ya su he nɛ e ngɛ ɔ, e ho da si nɛ e bi ke a wo hɛ ngmɛ yuyuilɔ ɔ kɛ ba e ngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni o ngɛ hlae nɛ ma pee ha mo?” E kpa lɛ pɛɛ nɛ e de ke, “Nutsɔ, i ngɛ hlae nɛ ma hyɛ nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo hyɛ nɔ koo! O hemi kɛ yemi tsa mo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, nɔmlɔ ɔ hɛ ngmɛ bli nɛ e bɔni nɔ hyɛmi. E nyɛɛ Yesu se kɛ bua jɔmi nɛ e bɔni Mawu yi jemi. Nɛ nihi kulaa nɛ na nɔ nɛ ba a, a wo sina kɛ yi jemi ngɔ ha Mawu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kɛ Zakeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Benɛ Yesu ya su Yeriko nɛ e ngɛ mi poe kɛ yaa Yerusalem ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />nyumu Yuda no ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Zakeo ɔ nu e he. E ji jua tsulɔ nɔkɔtɔma kɛ sikatsɛ, nɛ a le lɛ saminya. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />E ngɛ hlae nɛ e na Yesu, se akɛnɛ ni ɔmɛ hiɛ babauu nɛ e ji nɔmlɔ kpiti he je ɔ, e nɛ lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e tu fo kɛ sɛ hlami nɛ e ya kuɔ tso ko kaa kɔɔle tso ngɛ blɔ ɔ he haa he nɛ Yesu maa gu ɔ konɛ e nyɛ nɛ e na lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Se benɛ Yesu ya su tso ɔ sisi pɛ kɛkɛ nɛ e wo e hɛ mi nɔ nɛ e hyɛ Zakeo nɛ e tsɛ e biɛ pam ke, “Zakeo, o he nɛ sɔ nɛ o kple si, ejakaa o we ɔ mi nɛ i ma to mwɔnɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Zakeo he sɔ kɛ kple si nɛ e wo Yesu kɛ ho e we ɔ mi ya kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Se ni ɔmɛ bɔni nya si hɔɔmi ngɛ Yesu he, nɛ a de ke, e ho ya to nɔmlɔ yayami nubwɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Se Zakeo da si ngɛ Yesu hɛ mi nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Awetsɛ, i ma wo ye níhi nɛ i ngɛ ɔ tsuo mi dlami fiee kɛ ke ohiafohi. Nɛ i ngɛ si woe kaa ke i sisi nɔ ko nɛ i he sika ngɛ e dɛ pe bɔ nɛ sa a, i ma to nane mi ha lɛ ngwɔ he eywiɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa mwɔnɛ ɔ yi wami hemi ba we nɛ ɔ mi, ejakaa nyumu nɛ ɔ hu Abraham bimɛ nɛ laa amɛ eko ji lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ba nɛ e ba hla ni nɛmɛ nɛ laa amɛ nɛ e he a yi wami.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anɔkuale yemi he hiɔ womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Akɛnɛ Yesu maa ho Yerusalem sumi ya he je ɔ, e bu mɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ e kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ kaa tsa pi amlɔ nɛ ɔ mi nɔuu nɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ maa je sisi.<verse eid="LUK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />E de ke, “A tsɔ kɛ ba tsɛ ablade ko kaa e ba a matsɛ ma ngua mi nɛ a wo lɛ tsɛ nɛ e ye he nɛ e ngɛ ɔ nɔ; . <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Loko e maa hia blɔ ɔ, e tsɛ e sisi bimɛ a ti nihi nyɔngma nɛ e ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ sidi akpe enyɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke a kɛ hi ni tsue kɛ ya si e maa kpale kɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Se e sisi bi ɔmɛ ekomɛ sume lɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a tsɔ nihi kɛ fie e se nɛ a ya de lɛ ke a hla we nɛ e ye a nɔ matsɛ hu.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Benɛ e kpale kɛ ba a, e tsɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ e ha mɛ sika a konɛ a ba bu lɛ akɔtaa.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Kekle nɔ ɔ ba nɛ e ba de lɛ ke, ‘Nutsɔ, se nami nɛ i na ngɛ sika a nɔ ɔ peeɔ sika tso ɔ ngwɔ he nyɔngma.’<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Matsɛ ɔ de lɛ ke, ‘Ayekoo! Ni tsulɔ kpakpa; o ye anɔkuale ngɛ nɔ́ bɔbɔyoo nɛ i to kɛ wo o dɛ ɔ mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ma wo mo tsɛ ngɛ ma nyɔngma nya.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Nɔ nɛ ji enyɔ ɔ hu ba nɛ e ba de ke, ‘I na se; o sika a fu ngwɔ he enuɔ. Lɛ ji enɛ.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Matsɛ ɔ de lɛ ke, ‘Mo! O maa hyɛ mahi enuɔ nɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Se nɔ nɛ ji etɛ ɔ ba nɛ e ba de matsɛ ɔ ke, ‘O sika a ji enɛ; i buɛtɛ lɛ ngɔ fɔ si ha mo. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />I ye mo gbeye, ejakaa o sane wa. Nɔ́ nɛ pi o nɔ́ ɔ nɛ o woɔ; nɛ o kpaa ni ngɛ he nɛ o du we nɔ́ ko ngɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Munyu nɛ ɔ hua tsui ha matsɛ ɔ nɛ e de e sisi bi ɔ ke, ‘Nyɔguɛ yaya kɛ yi kpɛti wawɛtsɛ. O ke ye sane wa. Ja a pɛ nɛ i ke mo maa ye ɔ nɛ. Nɛ o le mi saminya kaa ye sane wa a, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />mɛni he je nɛ o wo we ye sika a kɛ ya tui sika tomi he ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma na kɛ mi womi?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Nɛ e de enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e plɛ nɛ e de ni ɔmɛ nɛ daa si ɔ ke, ‘Nyɛ he sika a ngɛ e dɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ ha nɔ nɛ na pe kulaa a.’<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Se ni ɔmɛ de lɛ ke, ‘Jamɛ a nɔ ɔ ngɛ fuu momo.’<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Matsɛ ɔ ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, ‘I le, se bɔ nɛ e ngɛ daa ji ja a nɛ; nɔ nɛ ngɛ fuu ɔ, a maa piɛ he ha lɛ; se nɔ nɛ e nɔ́ ɔ hiɛ́ɔ, bɔbɔyoo ɔ nɛ ngɛ e dɛ ɔ tete a ma he ngɛ e dɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ tsɔ atuã ke a hla we nɛ ma ye tsɛ ha mɛ hu ɔ, nyɛ wo mɛ kɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba poo a yi ngɛ ye hɛ mi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yerusalem sɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Benɛ e bu abɛ nɛ ɔ ta a, e sɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a hlami nɛ e pue Yerusalem blɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Benɛ a ya su Betfage kɛ Betania ngɛ Nuyoku ɔ he ɔ, e tsɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ enyɔ kɛ sɛ hlami. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ya kɔpe ɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ hɛ mi jee ɔ mi; nɛ nyɛ ma a mi sɛsɛ pɛ nyɛ maa na teji nɛ a muɔ lɛ si ngɛ blɔ ɔ he haa. E ji teji bi nɛ nɔ ko hi nɔ hyɛ lolo. Nyɛɛ pine lɛ nɛ nyɛ kpaka lɛ kɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko bi nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ he nɛ nyɛ ngɛ lɛ pinee ngɛ ɔ, nyɛ de lɛ ke, ‘E he hia Nutsɔ ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Kaseli ɔmɛ ya na teji bi ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ Yesu de mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Nɛ niinɛ, benɛ a ngɛ lɛ pinee ɔ, nítsɛ ɔmɛ bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ lohwe ɔ pinee?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />A de nɔ́tsɛ ɔmɛ kpiti ke, “E he hia Nutsɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Nɛ a kpaka lohwe ɔ kɛ ba ha Yesu nɛ a je a tadehi ngɔ ha lohwe ɔ se mi konɛ Yesu nɛ hi nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Kɛkɛ nɛ ni ɔmɛ je a tadehi ngɔ ha blɔ ɔ nɔ kɛ nyɛɛ e hlami hluu kɛ ho, nɛ e nyɛɛ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Benɛ a ya su he nɛ a ma bɔni Nuyoku ɔ kplemi ngɛ ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ asafo ɔ tsuo bɔni nyami kɛ lami kɛ ngɛ Mawu yi jee ngɛ nyakpɛ ni tsumi slɔɔtohi nɛ Yesu tsu ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Nɛ mɛ tsuo a de ke, “A gbaa Matsɛ ɔ nɛ ma ngɛ Mawu biɛ mi ɔ! A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Mawu ngɛ hiɔwe lokoo!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Se Farisi bi ɔmɛ ekomɛ de Yesu ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, mo ka nihi nɛ nyɛɛ o se ɔ a hɛ mi nɛ a jɔɔ níhi kaa ja a demi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Ke ni nɛ ɔmɛ pee kɔ ɔ, tɛ nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ he ɔ ma nya kɛ ngmlaa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Benɛ a ma saii nɛ jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ a kɛ Yerusalem kɛ we hu, nɛ e na ma a nɛ fɔɔ si paa ngɛ e hɛ mi ɔ, e bɔni ya fomi pue ma a nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />E fo ya nɛ e de ke, “Jinɛ neneene he jɔmi ma ha mo, se o ngmɛɛ he nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ be ɔ be. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ejakaa be ma nɛ o he nyɛli ɔmɛ maa te ba na mo; a maa hule o gbogbo ɔmɛ nɛ a ma sa o yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />A ma wo mo ngɔ fia si kɛ o mi bimɛ kulaa. A ma kpata o hɛ mi nɛ a maa ku o gbogbo ɔmɛ ngɔ pue si, ejakaa o kua he blɔ nɛ Mawu ha mo ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu sɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Jehanɛ ɔ e ya sɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e ya bɔni ni juali ɔmɛ fiemi ngɛ a gba amɛ a mi. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ngmami ɔmɛ de ke, ‘Ye We ɔ sɔlemi he i; se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ wo lɛ ngɔ pee juli a hi he.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e yaa Sɔlemi We ɔ daa ligbi ya tsɔɔ ni ngɛ lejɛ ɔ; se osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ bɔni e he ga hlami nɛ a kpata e hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Se a nɛ bɔ nɛ a maa pee, ejakaa a na paa kaa ni ɔmɛ suɔ lɛ saminya, nɛ e munyu ɔmɛ, ngɔɔ ngɛ a tue mi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ligbi ko ɔ, benɛ e ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ kpe mi nikɔtɔma amɛ ya na lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Nɛ a bi lɛ nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ nɔ nɛ ha lɛ he wami kaa e fie ni juali ɔmɛ kɛ je Sɔlemi We ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “I ma bi nyɛ nɔ́ ko, nɛ ke nyɛ ha mi heto ɔ, ami hu i ma tsɔɔ nyɛ he nɛ i na he wami ɔ kɛ je. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yohane ɔ nɛɛ, Mawu nɛ tsɔ lɛ aloo lɛ nitsɛ e he wami nya ni nɛ e ngɛ tsue?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />A hla munyu ɔ mi hluu nɛ a de a he ke, “Ke ji wa de ke Yohane fiɛmi ɔ Hiɔwe nɛ e je ɔ, e ma bi wɔ ke, ‘Nɛ mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ he we lɛ yi mɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Se ke wa de ke tsa pi Mawu nɛ tsɔ lɛ ɔ, ma a maa fiaa wɔ tɛ, ejakaa a he ye kaa Yohane ɔ gbalɔ ji lɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, heto nɛ a ha lɛ ji, “Wa li.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Lɛɛ ami hu i be nyɛ munyu nɛ nyɛ bi mi ɔ heto hae.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ nɛ e bu ni ɔmɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ ke, “Nyumu ko hu wai ngmɔ nɛ e ngɔ kɛ wo apaatsɛmɛ a dɛ nɛ e hia blɔ kɛ ho ma se tsitsaa he ko ya nɛ e se ya kɛ be saii nitsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Benɛ wai yiblii ɔ tsɔmi be su ɔ, e tsɔ e we bi ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake kɛ ho a ngɔ ya konɛ e ya wo e nɔ́ kɛ ba ha lɛ. Se apaatsɛ ɔmɛ fiaa e tsɔlɔ ɔ ni nɛ a fie lɛ kɛ e dɛ mi gu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />E tsɔ nɔ nɛ ji enyɔ; se apaatsɛ ɔmɛ pee le hu ja a kɛ. A kongo lɛ, nɛ a pue e hɛ mi si nɛ a fie lɛ nɛ a ha we lɛ ngmɔ ni ɔ eko. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />E tsɔ nɔ nɛ ji etɛ; lɛ hu a pee lɛ ja a nɔuu nɛ a plaa lɛ tete nɛ a fie lɛ kɛ je ngmɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ ngmɔtsɛ ɔ bi e he ke, ‘Kɛ ma pee kee? I ma tsɔ ami nitsɛ ye binyumu nɛ i suɔ lɛ saminya a kɛ ya apaatsɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ. Ye bi ɔ lɛɛ a maa bu lɛ.’<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Se benɛ bi nɛ ɔ yi je pɛ nɛ apaatsɛ ɔmɛ ke, ‘Wa bi, nyɛɛ ba; ni yelɔ ɔ nɛ ma nɛ ɔ nɛ. Nyɛɛ ba nɛ waa gbe lɛ, kɛkɛ ngmɔ ɔ maa pee wa nɔ́.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a sa lɛ kɛ je ngmɔ ɔ mi nɛ a ya gbe lɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Kɛ nyɛ susu nɛ ngmɔtsɛ ɔ maa pee kɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, e ma ba gbe apaatsɛ ɔmɛ nɛ e ma wo ngmɔ ɔ ngɔ ha ni kpahi.” Se nihi nɛ ngɛ lɛ tue bue ɔ de lɛ ke, “Kɛ apaatsɛ ɔmɛ maa pee nɔ́ kaa ja a kɛɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Se Yesu hyɛ mɛ too nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Lɛɛ kɛ Ngmami ɔ nɛ deɔ ke, ‘Tɛ ɔ nɛ tsu fiali ɔmɛ sake kɛ fɔ he ɔ ba plɛ pee kɔ nya tɛ’ ɔ sisi tsɔɔ kɛɛ?” <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma tɛ jamɛ a tɛ ɔ, e maa ku; se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ tɛ ɔ maa nɔ e nɔ ɔ,e maa wɛɛ lɛ kaa mamu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Se benɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ nu kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ, a hla nɛ a nu lɛ nɔuu, ejakaa a na kaa munyu ɔ kɔɔ a he; se a ya ye ma a gbeye kaa ke mɛ nitsɛmɛ a nu lɛ ɔ, basabasa maa te si. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a tsɔ e nya kaa e ma de nɔ ko nɛ a maa da nɔ kɛ po e nya kɛ ha Roma Amlaalo ɔ konɛ a nu lɛ lo.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a bɔni lɛ hwɔɔmi; nɛ a tsɔ nihi nɛ pee a he kaa anɔkualetsɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Nɛ a ya bi Yesu ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, wa le kaa moo lɛɛ nɔ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ pɛ nɛ o tsɔɔ, nɛ o hlɛ nimli a mi; Mawu anɔkuale blɔ ɔ pɛ nɛ o tsɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />E da kaa waa wo lapoo kɛ ha Roma amlaalo ɔ aloo e dɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Se Yesu na a ga a momoomo nɛ e de mɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Nyɛ wo kaplɛ ɔ eko kɛ ba tsɔɔ mi nɛ ma hyɛ ha. Mɛnɔ foto kɛ biɛ nɛ ngɛ nɔ nɛ ɔ?” A ha lɛ heto ke, “Kaisare nɛ ji Roma nɔ yelɔ ɔ nɔ i.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “Lɛɛ nyɛ wo Kaisare nɔ kɛ ha Kaisare, nɛ nɔ́ nɛ ji Mawu nɔ ɔ, nyɛɛ ngɔ kɛ ha Mawu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />A ga nɛ a tsɔ ɔ nui lɛ! Heto ɔ nɛ e ha mɛ ɔ pee mɛ nitsɛmɛ nyakpɛ nɛ a nɛ nɔ ko nɔ nɛ a maa da kɛ wo munyu ngɔ wo e he, kɛkɛ nɛ a nya jɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Saduki bi ɔmɛ, nihi nɛ ke mɛɛ a he we yi kaa ngɛ gbenɔ se ɔ, si temi ko ngɛ hwɔɔ se ɔ, mɛ hu a ba nɛ a ba bi Yesu ke, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Tsɔɔlɔ, Mose wo wɔ mlaa ke, ke ji nɔ ko ngɔ yo nɛ e gbo benɛ e kɛ lɛ be bi ɔ, e senɔ nɛ ngɔ yo ɔ nɛ e kɛ lɛ nɛ fɔ kɛ ha awetsɛ ɔ konɛ awetsɛ ɔ biɛ nɛ ko laa. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />E ba mi kaa nyɛmimɛ nyumuhi kpaago ko hi si. Tɛte ɔ ngɔ yo se e gbo kɛ je yo ɔ he nɛ e kɛ lɛ be bi. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Tɛtɛ ɔ ba ngɔ yo ɔ se lɛ hu e gbo kɛ je e he nɛ e kɛ lɛ fɔ we. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Tɛɛ ɔ hu ja, hluu kɛ ya si nyagbe nɔ ɔ nɔ; mɛ nihi kpaago ɔmɛ tsuo a ngɔ yo ɔ se a kɛ lɛ fɔ we. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, yo ɔ hu yi ba ta. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Jehanɛ ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ hlae nɛ waa le ɔ ji, ngɛ hwɔɔ se si temi ɔ mi ɔ, nyɛmimɛ nyumuhi kpaago nɛ ɔmɛ a ti mɛnɔ nɛ maa pee yo ɔ e huno, ejakaa mɛ tsuo a kɛ yo ɔ hi si?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Je nɛ ɔ mi pɛ nɛ nimli gbaa nɛ a ngɔɔ yo ngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Se ni nɛmɛ nɛ a ma tle mɛ si hwɔɔ se kɛ ya hiɔwe ɔ, a be yo ngɔe nɛ a be gbae. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Nɛ a be gboe hulɔ. A ngɛ kaa bɔfohi, nɛ a peeɔ Mawu bimɛ, ejakaa a tle mɛ si kɛ je gbenɔ mi kɛ ba wami he mi.<verse eid="LUK 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Se munyu nɛ nyɛ ngɛ bie ɔ tutuutu ji kaa hwɔɔ se ɔ si temi ko ngɛ lo? Nɛ enɛ ɔ, Mose nitsɛ e ngmami ɔmɛ tsɔɔ paa kaa si temi ko ngɛ. Ejakaa benɛ e tsɔɔ bɔ nɛ Mawu je e he kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ lɛ ngɛ hue ɔ nɛ ngɛ tsoe se e ngla we ɔ mi ɔ, bɔ nɛ e tsɛ Mawu ji, ‘Abraham Mawu kɛ Isak Mawu kɛ Yakob Mawu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ke a ke Mawu hine ni komɛ a Mawu kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ, se tsa pi be ko nɛ be ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa jamɛ a ni ɔmɛ ngɛ hɛ ngmengmle, tsa pi nihi nɛ gbo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Mlaa leli ɔmɛ ekomɛ nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ de lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, o ha heto tutuutu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, a nyɛ we lɛ nɔ ko nɛ a bi hu. <verse eid="LUK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ lɛ hu e bi mɛ ke, “Kɛ e ba kɛɛ nɛ a deɔ ke David bibimibi ji Kristo nɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ejakaa David nitsɛ ngma ngɛ e La Womi ɔ mi nɛ e de ke, ‘Mawu de ye Nutsɔ nɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ ke, “Moo hi si ngɛ ye hiɔ nine nɔ, <verse eid="LUK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma wo o he nyɛli ɔmɛ ba ngɔ wo o nane sisi.” ’ <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Kɛ e peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ Yiwamihelɔ kake ɔ peeɔ David Mawu kɛ e bibimibi kɛɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Kɛkɛ nɛ benɛ asafo ɔ ngɛ tue bue nɔuu ɔ, e plɛ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he nɛ hi ngɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa a suɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ a he nɛ nihi nɛ na mɛ. A woɔ tade ngua kɛ hii gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ nyɛɛe nɛ nihi nɛ hi si bae ha mɛ. Nɛ a suɔ ngua ma je himi ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ kɛ jeha yemi he ɔmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Benɛ a ngɛ sɔlee gagaaga kɛ gbi slɔɔto ko kaa nihi nɛ a nɔ dali be je nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, blɔ a ngɛ nihi nɛ be nɔ ko kɛ yihi nɛ a hunohi gbo ɔmɛ a he ga toe nɛ a kpɔ a weto níhi ngɛ a dɛ. I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke hwɔɔ se ɔ, a fɔ bumi maa kle.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Benɛ e daa si ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, e na ni ɔmɛ nɛ a wo a nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ ngɛ onia tsumi daka a mi woe. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Nɛ e maa hyɛ ɔ, e na yo ohiafo ko nɛ e huno gbo ɔ, nɛ lɛ hu e wo kaplɛ pɛsua enyɔ kɛ ba wo daka a mi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de ke, “Ngɛ anɔkuale mi ɔ, yo nɛ ɔ ha pe ni ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ́ ɔ nɛ a bla. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ejakaa mɛɛ lɛɛ ni nɛ a na nɛ be nɔ ɔ mi nɛ a je kɛ ha bɔbɔyoo nɛ he hia we mɛ; se yo nɛ ɔ lɛɛ sika kulaa nɛ ngɛ e dɛ ɔ nɛ e ngɔ kɛ ba ha nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tu nihi nɛ ma a he munyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e nu nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ bɔni Sɔlemi We ɔ tɛ gbogbo ɔmɛ kɛ afɛu nihi nɛ a kɛ dla he ɔ kɔmi.<verse eid="LUK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Be ma nɛ a ma puɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kɔe nɛ ɔ tsuo. A maa ywia tsu nɛ ɔ dukuduku ngɔ pue si nɛ a be tɛ kake po sie ngɛ eko nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, mɛni be nɛ a maa pee kikɛmɛ a nɔ́ nɛ ɔ, nɛ mɛni okadi wa maa na kɛ nyɛɛ hɛ mi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />E de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ hi nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko mlɔɔ nyɛ, ejakaa nihi fuu maa ba ngɛ ye biɛ mi, nɛ a ma de ke, ‘Be ɔ su.’ Se nyɛ ko he mɛ ye. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Nɛ ke nyɛ nu tahi kɛ atuã tsɔmi nɛ ngɛ si tee a he ɔ, nyɛ tsui nɛ ko po. Anɔkuale mi ɔ, tahi maa te si, se nyagbe be ɔ be bae amlɔ ɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ejakaa ma maa te si kɛ si ma, nɛ matsɛ yemi maa te si kɛ si matsɛ yemi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Nɛ zugba hosomi kɛ hwɔ nɛ nya wa kɛ gbenɔ hiɔ nɛ saa nɔ maa ba hehi fuu, nɛ a maa na nyakpɛ kɛ gbeye okadihi fuu ngɛ hiɔwe.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Se loko ji enɛ ɔ maa ba a, a maa nuu nyɛ nɛ a maa wa nyɛ yi kpɛti. A ma wo munyu kɛ wo nyɛ he nɛ a maa sa nyɛ kɛ ho matsɛmɛ kɛ amlaalohi a hɛ mi ya ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ nɛ a ya kojo nyɛ ngɛ ye he je. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Se kɛ gu enɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, je ɔ tsuo maa le Yiwamihelɔ ɔ nɛ a maa wo e hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Se nyɛ ko ye tsui ngɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ ma ya je nyɛ nya ha he, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />ejakaa i ma wo nyɛ nya nɔ́ nɛ sa kaa nyɛ de, nɛ i ma ha nyɛ juɛmi bɔ nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ wo nyɛ kɛ ya a be nyɛ nya nyɛe maa da. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Nyɛ wekuli kɛ nyɛ fɔli kɛ nyɛ nyɛmimɛ kɛ nyɛ huɛmɛ tete po maa tsɔɔ nyɛ se blɔ nɛ a ma ba nuu nyɛ; nɛ a maa tane nyɛ ti ni komɛ po nyɛ yi. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Nihi fuu maa nyɛ nyɛ, ejakaa ye nihi ji nyɛ nɛ a kɛ ye biɛ wo nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Se i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, nyɛ yi bwɔmi kake hu be laae. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ejakaa ke nyɛ da si kpɛii ɔ, nyɛ ma he nyɛ susumahi a yi wami.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Se ke nyɛ na kaa ta buli bɔle Yerusalem he pɛ, nyɛɛ le kaa ma a hɛ mi kpatami be ɔ su. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, nihi nɛ ngɛ Yudea a a tu fo kɛ sɛ yoku ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ mɛɛ a tu fo kɛ je ma a mi, nɛ nihi nɛ be Yerusalem ma a mi jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a ko de ke a ngɛ kpalee kɛ ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ejakaa jamɛ a be ɔmɛ ji yayami nane mi tomi behi, nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ gbali ɔmɛ a womi ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, e maa ba mi pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Se due ha bimwɔwi a nyɛmɛ kɛ yihi nɛ hɛɛ hɔ ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔmɛ a mi. Ejakaa e maa pee aywilɛho be ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />He nyɛli maa tane a yi basabasa aloo a maa nuu mɛ nyɔguɛhi kɛ ho majemaje ya. Nɛ nihi nɛ li Mawu ɔmɛ ma kpata Yerusalem hɛ mi nɛ a maa pee lɛ posoposo kɛ ya si be nɛ Mawu nitsɛ to ɔ maa su.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, nyakpɛ okadihi slɔɔtohi maa je kpo ngɛ hiɔwe ngɛ pu kɛ hlami kɛ dodoehi a mi. Nɛ zugba a nɔ ma tsaka, nɛ wo ma gli nɛ e ma hyi bɔ nɛ a nɛ eko hyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Nihi fuu maa ye gbeye nɛ a maa hɛli ngɛ okadi nɛ ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa Hiɔwe tete ma tsaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ a maa na Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ nɛ ma ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi kɛ he wami kɛ anunyami. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke nyɛ na nɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ, nyɛ wo nyɛ hɛ mi nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ hiɔwe, ejakaa nyɛ yi wami hemi be ɔ nɛ su ji lɔ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e bu mɛ abɛ nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛɛ to tso ko kaa mangoo tso ɔ kɛ tso kpa amɛ a he hɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ke a bɔni ba jemi pɛ gbiɛ nya su. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ja a kɛ ke okadihi nɛ i tu a he munyu nɛ ɔmɛ bɔni a he kpo jemi pɛ nyɛɛ le kaa Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ su si.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, ke ni nɛ ɔmɛ ba mi pɛ nyɛɛ le kaa yi nɔ nɛ ɔ nyagbe ɔ su. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Nɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba kulaa maa be kɛ ho, se ye munyu ɔmɛ maa hi si daa.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Nyɛ hɛ nɛ hi nyɛ he nɔ! Nyɛ ko ha nɛ ye bami ɔ nɛ ba ti nyɛ si tlukaa. Ma ko ba na nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kɛkɛ, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ fiɛe, nyɛ ngɛ da nue nɛ nyɛ kɛ je nɛ ɔ mi níhi pee nyɛ kɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Ejakaa ni nɛ ɔmɛ maa ba je ɔ tsuo nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Nyɛɛ hwɔɔ be fɛɛ be nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle wawɛɛ, nɛ ke e maa hi ɔ, nyɛɛ hi he wami nɛ nyɛ nyɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a mi nɛ nyɛɛ gu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Daa ligbi ɔ, Yesu yaa Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e ya tsɔɔ ni, nɛ gbɔkuɛ mi ɔ e yaa ya hwɔɔ Nuyoku ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Nɛ ke je na mɔtu pɛ ni ɔmɛ baa e ngɔ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ a ba buɔ lɛ tue.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu se blɔ tsɔɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ Hebemi yemi be ɔ maa ho sumi ya, be mi nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ yeɔ akpiti ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ bɔni ga tomi bɔ nɛ a maa pee nɛ a tane e yi ngɛ laami mi nɛ gidigidi ko nɛ ko ba.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Be nɛ ɔ mi nɛ Abosiami sɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yuda Iskariot ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Nɛ e ho ya na osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafoatsɛ ɔmɛ konɛ e kɛ mɛ nɛ susu bɔ nɛ e maa pee nɛ e ha nɛ a nine nɛ su Yesu nɔ nɛ a gbe lɛ he. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />A bua jɔ he saminya kaa e maa ye kɛ bua mɛ, nɛ a wo lɛ si kaa a ma ha lɛ sika. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, Yuda bɔni blɔ nɔ nɛ e maa gu nɛ e nine maa su e nɔ kɛ ha mɛ ngɛ kɔkɔɔ mi ɔ he susumi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ akpiti yemi ligbi nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Hebemi Gbijlɔ ɔ ba su. Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔ nɛ a gbee Hebemi to bi ɔ nɛ a kɛ yeɔ akpiti ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu tsɔ Petro kɛ Yohane kɛ sɛ hlami nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ya nɛ nyɛ ya pee Hebemi niye ni ɔ kɛ dla wa se.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />A bi lɛ ke, “Jije o maa suɔ nɛ wa ya to niye ni ɔ he blɔ nya ngɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />E de mɛ ke, “Ke nyɛ sɛ ma a mi pɛ nyɛɛ kɛ nɔ ko maa kpe nɛ e tloo nyu kɛ buɛ. Nyɛɛ nyɛɛ e se kɛ ya we mi he nɛ e yaa a, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />nɛ nyɛ ya de wetsɛ ɔ ke, ‘Wa Tsɔɔlɔ ɔ ke o tsɔɔ wɔ tsu nɔ́ nɛ mi nɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ maa ye Hebemi ni ɔ ngɛ ɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Nɛ e maa tsɔɔ nyɛ asa ngua ko nɛ a dla mi ngɔ fa si ha wɔ. Lejɛ ɔ i. Nyɛɛ ya mi nɛ nyɛ ya to wa niye ni ɔ he blɔ nya ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Kaseli ɔmɛ pue nɔ kɛ ho ma a mi ya nɛ a ya na nɔ́ tsua nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ e de mɛ ɔ; nɛ a to Hebemi niye ni ɔ he blɔ nya ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyagbe ni yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Yesu kɛ kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ hu bu a nɔ kɛ ho we ɔ mi ya. Nɛ benɛ ni yemi be ɔ su nɛ a ho hi si ngɛ okplɔɔ ɔ he ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />e de mɛ ke, “I hyɛ be nɛ ɔ blɔ kɛ he hiami, nɛ i ngɛ hlae nɛ i kɛ nyɛ wa pue si kaa kikɛ nɛ ɔ kɛ ye ni nɛ ɔ loko ye nɔ́ nami be ɔ nɛ ba su. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ejakaa i kɛ nyɛ be si hiɛ kikɛ ɔ kɛ ye ni nɛ ɔ eko hu kɛ ya si be nɛ nɔ́ nɛ niye ni nɛ ɔ daa si kɛ ha a maa ba mi ngɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e wo glaasi kɛ wai ɔ nɛ e na si ngɛ he nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ tsuo nyɛɛ nu eko. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kɛ je enɛ ɔ se kɛ yaa a, i be wai nue hu kɛ ya si be nɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ maa ba.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e wo abolo kake, nɛ benɛ e na Mawu si ngɛ he se ɔ, e poo mi nɛ e dla ngɔ ha mɛ, nɛ benɛ e kɛ ngɛ mɛ hae kakaaka a, e de mɛ ke, “Ye nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɛ a ngɔ kɛ ha ngɛ nyɛ he ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ; nyɛɛ ye nɛ nyɛ ngɔ kai mi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ngɛ niye ni ɔ se ɔ, e pa ha mɛ glaasi kɛ wai ɔ eko. Nɛ benɛ e kɛ ngɛ mɛ haeɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Enɛ ɔ ji ye muɔ nɛ a ngɔ pue si ha nyɛ kɛ ha Mawu somi he ɔ nɛ a ma kɛ he nyɛ yi wami ɔ e nɔ mi mami. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Se mohu nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ ye se blɔ ɔ hii si ngɛ wa kpɛti amlɔ nɛ ɔ kaa huɛ nɛ e kɛ mi ngɛ nine kae ngɛ okplɔɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ngɛ Mawu yi mi tomi ɔ nya a, e sa kaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ nɛ gbo; se due ha nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ ye se blɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Kɛkɛ nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ bɔni a he bimi ke, a ti mɛnɔ nɛ maa pee nɔ́ kaa kikɛ nɛ ɔ lo. <verse eid="LUK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Jehanɛ ɔ, a bɔni nya sami ngɛ a kpɛti kaa a ti mɛnɔ nɛ maa pee ngua pe kulaa ngɛ Matsɛyemi nɛ ma a mi lo.<verse eid="LUK 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Je nɛ ɔ mi bimɛ a nɔ yeli ɔmɛ nɛ ji matsɛmɛ kɛ nimli ngua amɛ yeɔ a nyɔguɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ nyɔguɛ ɔmɛ buu mɛ kaa a dloomi, nɛ a be nya jemi ko. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ nɔ́ be ja. Nyɛ ti nɔ nɛ sɔmɔɔ nyɛ pe kulaa a, lɛ ji nɔ nɛ maa pee nyɛ nɔkɔtɔma. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ɔ nutsɔ ɔ hii si ngɛ okplɔɔ he nɛ e we bi ɔmɛ sɔmɔɔ lɛ. Se ngɛ ye blɔ fa mi ɔ, tsa pi ja i, ejakaa ami lɛɛ i ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti kaa sɔmɔlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Se kɛ hu ɔ, kaa nyɛ ji ye he ngɛ ye kami be nɛ ɔmɛ a mi, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />nɛ akɛnɛ Tsaatsɛ ha mi Matsɛyemi ko he je ɔ, ami hu i ngɛ nyɛ he blɔ hae, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mi nɛ hi si nɛ nyɛɛ ye ni nɛ nyɛɛ nu ni ngɛ ye okplɔɔ ɔ he ngɛ jamɛ a Matsɛyemi ɔ mi; nɛ nyɛɛ kojo Israel wɛtso nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Simon, Simon, o nɛ, Abosiami bi nɛ a ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e sa nyɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ a saa ngma mi ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />se i sɔle nɛ i kpa pɛɛ kɛ ha mo bɔ nɛ pee nɛ o hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ko ta kulaa. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke o pia o he nɛ o kpale kɛ ba ye ngɔ ɔ, o wo o nyɛmi ɔmɛ a hemi kɛ yemi he wami.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petro de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, i dla ye he nɛ i kɛ mo maa ya he tsuaa he nɛ o maa ya, tsu mi jio, gbenɔ mi jio, i kɛ mo maa ya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Se Yesu de le ke, “Petro, i ngɛ mo dee anɔkuale mi ke, kɛ je amlɔ nɛ ɔ mi kɛ ya si hwɔɔ mɔtu ɔ, kungwɔ be kekle nɔ́ kpae makɛ nɛ o ma ka kita si etɛ ke o li mi tete po.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Benɛ i tsɔ nyɛ ke nyɛ ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ nyɛ hɛɛ we sika kɛ kotoku kɛ tade kɛ tokota a nɛɛ, nɔ́ ko he hia nyɛ lo?” A ha lɛ heto ke, “Nɔ ko he hia we wɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />E de mɛ ke, “Jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, ke mo nɔ ko o ngɛ kotoku ɔ, o hɛɛ kɛ sika kɛ to dɛ. Nɛ ke o be klaate ɔ, o jua o tade nɛ o kɛ he eko. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ejakaa be su nɛ nɔ́ nɛ a gba ngɔ fɔ si ngɛ ye he ke, ‘A maa bu lɛ ngɔ si mlaa tɔli a nɔ, nɛ a bu lɛ gbenɔ fɔ ɔ’, maa ba mi. Niinɛ, nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ ye he ɔ maa ba mi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ha lɛ heto nɛ a de ke, “Nutsɔ, wa ngɛ klaatehi enyɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ piɔ.” Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “E hiɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ kple si kɛ je hiɔwe tsu ɔ nɔ nɛ a ho Nuyoku ɔ nɔ ya kaa bɔ nɛ e pɔɔ peemi ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Benɛ a ya su lejɛ ɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ sɔle wawɛɛ nɛ nyɛ ko sɛ kami mi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e sa kɛ je a he bɔɔ maa pee tɛ fɔmi kɛmi nɛ e ya ho kpla si nɛ e sɔle nɛ e de ke, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Tsaatsɛ, ke o suɔ ɔ, mo ha nɛ amanehlu kplu nɛ ɔ nɛ e be ye yi. Se kɛ hu o pee bɔ nɛ moo suɔ, se pi bɔ nɛ ami i suɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mawu bɔfo ko je hiɔwe ba je e he kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ lɛ nɛ e wo lɛ he wami. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ejakaa e hao ngɛ e mumi mi tɔɔ nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sɔle kɛ he hiami kɛ ya si benɛ e he latsa plɛ kaa muɔ nɛ e ngɛ tslee kɛ ngɛ si puee. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Benɛ e sɔle ta nɛ e kpale kɛ ba e kaseli ɔmɛ a ngɔ ɔ, e ba na kaa kɔmɔ yemi kɛ pɔ tɔtɔɛ gbe mɛ nɛ a hwɔ mahe.<verse eid="LUK 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Mahe nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hwɔe lo? Nyɛɛ te si nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ ke ji a ka nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ nyɛ nya nɛ nyɛɛ da.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />E ngɛ munyu ɔ tue nɔuu kɛkɛ nɛ a maa hyɛ ɔ, ni komɛ ji nɛ nɛ Yuda, nɛ ji kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ɔ, nyɛɛ a hɛ mi kɛ ba. Yuda nyɛɛ kɛ ya na Yesu nɛ e fua lɛ atuu nɛ e fiɔ e nya he.<verse eid="LUK 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Se Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Yuda, mɛni peemi ji enɛ ɔ, nya he fiɔmi nɛ o ma kɛ tsɔɔ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ se blɔ lo?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Benɛ kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ na nɔ́ nɛ ma a, a bi lɛ ke, “Mawetsɛ, waa te kɛ kpee mɛ lo? Wa hɛɛ klaate ɔmɛ kɛ ba!” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Nɛ a ti nɔ kake ja Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a e tsɔlɔ ɔ, nɛ e po e hiɔ tue ngɔ fɔ si.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ ko nɔ hu.” Nɛ e ta tue ɔ ngwɔhe ɔ he nɛ e tsa tue ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu bi osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ he buli ɔmɛ a nya asafoatsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ nikɔtɔma kpa amɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi kɛ ba a ke, “Anɛ julɔ ji mi nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ klaatehi kɛ tso kpotihi ma mi numi nɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ nui mi ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ? Tsɛ i yaa lejɛ ɔ daa ligbi? Se nyɛ be ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, be nɛ Abosiami he wami ngɛ nɔ yee.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro kua Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a nu lɛ nɛ a kpaka lɛ kɛ ho Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a we ɔ mi ya; nɛ Petro hu nyɛɛ a se ngɛ se lokoo. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Soja amɛ slɛ la ngɛ kpo ɔ nɔ nɛ a hi si ngɛ hluie nɛ Petro hu ho ya piɛ a he.<verse eid="LUK 22:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Se yoyo tsɔlɔ ko na Petro nɛ e bɔni lɛ hyɛmi totooto. Nyagbe mi ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ yoyo ɔ de ji, “Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ hu kɛ Yesu nɛ nyɛɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Petro kplɛɛ we nɔ. E de lɛ ke, “Kpaoo, mamiyo, nɔmlɔ nɛ o ngɛ tsɔɔe nɛ ɔ, i li lɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Se be bɔɔ se ɔ, nyumu ko hu to Petro he hɛ nɛ e ngɔ ma e hɛ mi ke, “Tsɛ mo hu a ti nɔ eko ji mo!” Petro de lɛ ke, “Kpaoo! Tsa pi a ti nɔ eko ji mi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Maa pee ngmlɛfia kake se ɔ, nɔ kpa hu na Petro nɛ e ka nɛ e de ke, “I le nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ kaa lɛ hu a ti nɔ eko ji lɛ, nɛ nguane jemi ko be he. Ejakaa e kɛ lɛ tsuo nɛ je Galilea a nɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Se Petro de kɛ hɛ dɔ ke, “Hyɛ ha! Maminyumu, nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ, i li he nɔ́ ko.” Petro nya nɛ ke maa si pɛ nɛ kungwɔ kpa nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Jamɛ a hɛ ngmɛfia a mi nɔuu nɛ Yesu plɛ nɛ e hyɛ Petro. Nɛ Petro kai munyu nɛ e tu lɛ ɔ ke, “Loko ji kungwɔ ma kpa kekle nɔ́ makɛ ɔ, o ma de si etɛ ke o li mi” ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro te si kɛ je kpo nɛ e ya fo ya wawɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa nihi nɛ ngɛ Yesu he bue ɔ bɔni e he fɛu yemi. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />A fi e hɛ mi nɛ a si lɛ kɔ nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Ke gbalɔ ji mo ɔ, moo tsɔɔ wɔ nɔ nɛ si mo nɔ́ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Nɛ a tu jɛmi munyuhi fuu ngɔ si lɛ kɛ pue e hɛ mi si.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Benɛ je hɛ mi ke e tsɔɔ pɛ nɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kulaa nɛ ji kojoli ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kojomi he ngua pe kulaa a ba bua. A kpaka Yesu kɛ ba da si ngɛ kpe ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nɛ kpe ɔ bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ mo nɛ o ke mo ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ? Mo de nɛ waa nu mwɔnɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Ke i de nyɛ hu nyɛ be mi hee maa ye; nɛ nyɛ be mi blɔ hae hulɔ nɛ ma jaje ye nya mi munyu. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Se be ma, nɛ e be kɛe, nɛ a maa wo Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ matsɛ nɛ e maa hi Hewamitsɛ Mawu ɔ hiɔ nine nɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Munyu nɛ ɔ nɛ e tu ɔ pɛ nɛ kpe ɔ tsuo hia ngmlaa ke, “Lɛɛ o ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa Mawu Bi ji mo lo?” Yesu ha heto nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ee, Mawu Bi ji mi!”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Kɛkɛ nɛ mɛ tsuo a hia ngmlaa nɛ a de ke, “Odase kpa ko he hia we wɔ hu. Wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa nu nɔ́ nɛ e de ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kojomi kɛ e fɔ bumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Nɛ sihi he ɔ tsuo te si nɛ a kpaka lɛ kɛ ya ha Pilato nɛ ji Amlaalo ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Nɛ a ya bɔni e nya pomi. Ekomɛ ji, “Wa na nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ ma a tue puɛe. E ngɛ ma mi bi ɔmɛ dee ke a ko wo lapoo kɛ ha Roma amlaalo ɔ. Nɛ e de hu ke lɛ ji wa Matsɛ kɛ Yiwamihelɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato bi Yesu ke, “Anɛ mo ji Yiwamihelɔ kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a Matsɛ ɔ lo?” Yesu ha Pilato heto nɛ e de ke, “Ee, ja i kaa bɔ nɛ o de ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato plɛ nɛ e de osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ nimli asafo ɔ ke, “E pee we mlaa tɔmi nɔ́ ko nɛ i na ngɛ munyu nɛ ɔ he.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Enɛ ɔ nɛ e de ɔ puɛ ma a tsui nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Se e ngɛ ma mi bi ɔmɛ a yi mi woe kɛ si amlaalo ɔ kɛ níhi nɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe kɛ ngɛ Yudea tsuo kpae, kɛ je Galilea hluu kɛ ba pue Yerusalem ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Benɛ Pilato nu enɛ ɔ, e bi ke, “Anɛ Galilea no ji lɛ lo?”<verse eid="LUK 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Nɛ benɛ e na le kaa e je Galilea a, e ke a wo lɛ kɛ ya ha Matsɛ Herode, ejakaa Galilea ngɛ Herode nɔ yemi sisi; nɛ Herode hu ba Yerusalem jamɛ a be ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herode bua jɔ e he saminya kaa e na he blɔ nɛ e maa na Yesu, ejakaa e nu e he sanehi fuu nɛ e je lɛ hlami kɛ, nɛ e pee nyakpɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ e na.<verse eid="LUK 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e bi Yesu munyu slɔɔtohi fuu, se e ha we lɛ kake po heto. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ ngmlaa kpae kɛ ngɛ sane ɔmɛ poe kɛ ngɛ e nɔ fɔe.<verse eid="LUK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Jehanɛ ɔ Herode kɛ e soja amɛ hu bɔni Yesu ahlua bɔmi kɛ e he fɛu yemi. A wo lɛ matsɛ tade ko nɛ a kpale lɛ kɛ ya ha Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, Herode kɛ Pilato nɛ a kɛ a he yi pe be abɔ ɔ, a tsa.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Pilato tsɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ nihi nɛ ba bua a kulaa, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Munyu nɛ nyɛ ba wo nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ he ji, e ngɛ ma a tue puɛe. Nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ i kojo lɛ ngɛ, se i nɛ mlaa tɔmi nɔ́ ko kulaa ngɛ e he. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Herode hu ma nya si kaa e nɛ tɔmi ko ngɛ e he nɛ sa gbenɔ fɔ bumi; nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e kpale lɛ kɛ ba ha wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i ma ha nɛ a fiaa lɛ kpa nɛ ma ngmɛɛ e he.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Ejakaa e he hia kaa daa jeha yemi be ɔ, e ngmɛɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a wo mɛ tsu ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake he kɛ ha ma a. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Se asafo ɔ kpa ngmlaa kɛ gbi kake pe kekle ɔ ke, “Moo gbe lɛ nɛ o ngmɛɛ Baraba he kɛ ha wɔ!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baraba ji nɔ ko nɛ a wo lɛ tsu mi, ejakaa e nyɛɛ nihi a hɛ mi ngɛ Yerusalem nɛ a te si kɛ si amlaalo ɔ; nɛ e gbe nɔ hulɔ ngɛ basabasa peemi ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato kɛ mɛ sa nya ngɛ a bimi nɛ ɔ he, ejakaa e suɔ nɛ e ngmɛɛ Yesu he. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Se a kpa ngmlaa ekohu ke, “Moo sɛu lɛ! Moo sɛu lɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato bi mɛ nɔ́ nɛ ji si etɛ ke, “Mɛni tɔmi nɛ e tɔ nɛ tsɔɔ kaa e sa gbenɔ? I de nyɛ ke, i nɛ tɔmi ko ngɛ e he nɛ sa gbenɔ fɔ bumi; nɛ ja a he je ɔ, i ma ha nɛ a fiaa lɛ kpa nɛ ma ngmɛɛ e he.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Se ni ɔmɛ hia ngmlaa wawɛɛ pe kekle ɔ nɛ a de ke a gbe Yesu; nɛ a ngɔ a munyu ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Pilato bu Yesu gbenɔ fɔ kaa bɔ nɛ ni ɔmɛ bi ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Nɛ e ngmɛɛ Baraba nɛ a wo lɛ tsu ngɛ atuã nɛ e tsɔ kɛ nɔ nɛ e gbe ɔ he ɔ, ngɛ a bimi ɔ nya; nɛ e je Yesu he gbi kɛ ha mɛ nɛ a ya pee lɛ nɔ́ nɛ a suɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Benɛ a kpaka Yesu kɛ yaa nɛ a ya sɛu lɛ ɔ, a kɛ Kirene nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Simon ɔ kpe nɛ e je ngmɔ mi kɛ ma Yerusalem ma a mi nɛ a nyɛ e nɔ nɛ a wo Yesu sɛumi tso ɔ ngɔ tloo lɛ kɛ nyɛɛ Yesu se. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Nɛ nihi fuu kɛ yihi nɛ ngɛ ya foe nyɛɛ a se. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Se Yesu plɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Yerusalem bi yihi, nyɛ ko fo ya ha mi, se mohu nyɛ fo ya kɛ ha nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ he kɛ nyɛ bimɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ejakaa be ma nɛ a ma de ke, yosahi a he ngɛ ni saminya. <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, nimli ma kpa yokuhi pɛɛ ke a ku kɛ pue a nɔ nɛ a pɔtɔ mɛ, kɛ kpohi hu ke a ba ha a nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ejakaa ke a ngɛ tso mumu enɛ ɔ pee ɔ, lɛɛ tso gbigbli ɔ kɛ a maa pee lɛ kɛɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu sɛumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Nɛ a kpaka yayami peeli kpahi enyɔ hu nɛ a bu mɛ gbenɔ fɔ ngɔ piɛ e he kɛ yaa nɛ a ya sɛu mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Benɛ a ya su sɛumi ngwɔhe ɔ, he nɛ a tsɛɛ ke, “Yikokonohe” ɔ, a sɛu nihi etɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. A wo Yesu kɛ wo ni enyɔ ɔmɛ a kpɛti, nɔ kake ngɛ e muɔ nɔ nɛ nɔ kake hu ngɛ e hiɔ nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Se Yesu sɔle nɛ e de ke, “Tsaatsɛ, mo ngɔ ke mɛ, ejakaa a li nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ pee ɔ.” Soja amɛ hu fɔ sɔ kɛ dla e tade ɔmɛ ngɔ ha a he. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Nɛ ni ɔmɛ daa si ngɛ hyɛe be mi nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ e he fɛu yee ke, “Ni kpahi a yi wami nɛ e heɔ. Ke Mawu Bi kɛ Yiwamihelɔ ji lɛ tutuutu kaa bɔ nɛ e de ɔ, lɛɛ lɛ nitsɛ e he e yi wami mwɔnɛ ɔ nɛ waa hyɛ ha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Soja amɛ hu ye e he fɛu nɛ a wo wai nɛ nya wa ngɔ ha lɛ ke e nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Ke mo ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a Matsɛ ɔ, lɛɛ mo he mo nitsɛ o yi wami.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />A ngma ngɛ e sɛumi tso ɔ yi kpɛti ke, “Yuda bi ɔmɛ a Matsɛ ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Nɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ a sɛu kɛ piɛ e he ɔ a ti nɔ kake hu ye e he fɛu nɛ e de ke, “Pi o ke mo ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ? Mo je o he nɛ o je wɔ hu koo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Se nɔ kaketsɛ ɔ kã e hɛ mi nɛ e de lɛ ke, “O ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa kɛ ba si amlɔ nɛ ɔ kulaa nɛ o ngɛ gbenɔ mi nɛ ɔ, o yi Mawu gbeye lo? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Wɔɔ lɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ nae nɛ ɔ sa wɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ, se nyumu nɛ ɔ nɛɛ, mɛni lɛ hu e pee nɛ sa gbenɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de Yesu ke, “Nutsɔ, mo kai mi be mi nɛ o maa ba ngɛ o Matsɛyemi ɔ mi ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “I ngɛ mo si woe anɔkuale mi ke, mwɔnɛ ɔ o kɛ mi maa hi Paradeiso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, pu da se piani diblii wo kpii ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo kɛ ya si piani ngmlɛ etɛ nɛ peeɔ ngmlɛfia etɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Benɛ pu ɔ wo diblii ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ kpɛti bo titi ɔ mi gba kɛ je hiɔmi kɛ ba ma si.<verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Nɛ Yesu kpa ngmlaa nɛ e de ke, “Tsaatsɛ! I to ye mumi ɔ kɛ wo o dɛ mi.” Kɛkɛ nɛ e ma e nya.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Benɛ sojahi lafa a nyatsɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ na nɔ́ nɛ ba a, e ye Mawu gbeye nɛ e wo e hɛ mi nyami nɛ e de ke, “Anɔkuale ji kaa Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ dalɔ ji lɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Nɛ benɛ ni ɔmɛ nɛ ba nɔ́ hyɛmi ɔ na kaa Yesu ma nya a, a kpale kɛ ho a wehi a mi ya kɛ aywilɛho. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Se Yesu huɛmɛ kɛ yi ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ e se kɛ je Galilea kɛ ba a, daa si ngɛ se lokoo ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ hyɛe.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-52" />Nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yosef nɛ je Yudea ma ngua nɛ ji Arimatia a mi, nɛ e ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe ngua mi no se e kɛ ma nikɔtɔma amɛ kpa we gbi ngɛ Yesu sane ɔ yemi ɔ mi ɔ, lɛ nɛ e ya bi Pilato konɛ e ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e ya je Yesu gbogboe ɔ nɛ e ya dla. Yosef nɛ ɔ, e ji dalɔ nɛ lɛ hu e ngɛ Yiwamihelɔ ɔ bami ɔ blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Yosef ho nɛ e ya je gbogboe ɔ ngɛ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ nɛ e wo klala ngɔ blaa e he nɛ e wo lɛ ya ngɔ dla ngɛ gbogboe muɔ he nɛ a kpɛ ngɛ tɛ mi nɛ a dla we nɔ ko ngɛ mi hyɛ ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />E pee enɛ ɔ Soha pu pɛplɛ kɛ yaa pu si nɔnɔɛ be mi; nɛ ligbi ɔ ji he dlami ligbi kɛ ha Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Benɛ a wo gbogboe ɔ kɛ yaa dlami ɔ, Galilea yi ɔmɛ nyɛɛ se nɛ a na kaa a kɛ lɛ ya wo tɛ muɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpale kɛ ho we mi ya ya dla tsopahi kɛ nu je viahi nɛ a ma kɛ ya wo gbogboe ɔ. Se a gbi nya nɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ ba na mɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa a nya a, a jɔɔ a he ngɛ ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu te si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Hɔgba makɛ mla a, a wo tsopa kɛ he via amɛ nɛ a dla kɛ to ɔ kɛ ba yɔkɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />A na kaa a je tɛ agbo ɔ nɛ a kɛ tsi muɔ ɔ nya a. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a sɛ muɔ ɔ mi se a na kaa Mawetsɛ Yesu gbogboe ɔ be mi.<verse eid="LUK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />A pee yaa ke ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba a he susue; nɛ si kake too nɛ a maa hyɛ ɔ, nyumuhi enyɔ komɛ nɛ wo nɔ hiɔ, nɛ ngɛ kpɛe wawɛɛ daa si ngɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Yi ɔmɛ ye gbeye nɛ a ngɔ a hɛ mi kɛ bu si. Kɛkɛ nɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ba ngɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ hɛ ngmengmle ɔ hlae ngɛ ni gbogboehi a kpɛti? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />E be hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ. E te si. Anɛ nyɛ hɛ je nɔ́ nɛ e de nyɛ ngɛ Galilea a nɔ lo? <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Anɛ e de we nyɛ ke, a maa tsɔɔ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ se blɔ nɛ nimli yayamihi maa nu lɛ maa gbe, se e maa te si ekohu ngɛ ligbi nɛ ji etɛ ɔ nɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kai munyu ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />nɛ a kpale nɔuu kɛ ho ma a mi ya nɛ a ya bɔ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ kake nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ kɛ a bi kpa amɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba a. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Yi ɔmɛ nɛ ya muɔ ɔ nya amɛ ji, Maria Magdalena kɛ Yohana kɛ Maria nɛ ji Yakobo nyɛ ɔ kɛ yi kpahi fuu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Se munyu ɔ pe kaa nyazia ko kɛkɛ kɛ ha nyumu ɔmɛ, nɛ a he we yi.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Se Petro sa fo kɛ ho muɔ ɔ nya ya nɛ e ya hyɛ ha. E ya ba si nɛ e hyɛ muɔ ɔ mi, nɛ nɔ́ nɛ pɛ nɛ e na ji klala amɛ nɛ a kɛ ha gbogboe ɔ he ɔ; kɛkɛ nɛ e kpale kɛ ho ma a mi ya, nɛ e juɛmi sui nɔ́ nɛ ba a he.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ Hɔgba a nɔuu ɔ, Yesu kaseli enyɔ ngɛ si slaae kɛ yaa kɔpe ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Emao nɛ e kɛ Yerusalem kɛmi maa pee si tomi kpaago ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Benɛ a ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ kɛ yaa a, a ngɛ níhi nɛ ba ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔmɛ a mi nɛ kɔɔ Yesu gbenɔ ɔ he ɔ he ni sɛɛe. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />A ngɛ munyu ɔ tue nɔuu nɛ Yesu nitsɛ ba na mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Se a li e mi tso, ejakaa Mawu wo lɔ ɔ ngɔ laa mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni ni nɛ nyɛ ngɛ sɛɛe wawɛɛ kikɛ ɔ? Mɛni ngɛ nyɛ nya gbae?” A ho da si nɛ a hɛ mi pee mɔbɔmɔbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Kleopa a ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “E peeɔ mi kaa nubwɔ ji mo ngɛ Yerusalem, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, o nui sane gbeyegbeyehi nɛ ba ngɛ ma a mi ligbi etɛ nɛ ɔ mi he ma ji.”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni ba?” A ha lɛ heto nɛ a de ke, “Nɔ́ nɛ a pee Yesu nɛ je Nazaret ɔ. Gbalɔ kɛ Tsɔɔlɔ ji lɛ, nɛ e tsu nyakpɛ níhi slɔɔtohi nɛ o maa na paa kaa Mawu nɔmlɔ ji lɛ, nɛ Mawu kɛ nimli tsuo buu lɛ saminya. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Se osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ wa asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ nu lɛ kɛ ya ha Roma amlaalo ɔ nɛ a bu lɛ gbenɔ fɔ, nɛ a sɛu lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Wa susu kaa lɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ anunyamitsɛ nɛ ba Israel kpɔmi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:21">Se mohu ngɛ níhi kulaa nɛ ba mwɔnɛ ɔ ji ligbi etɛ ɔ se ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />wa kpɛti yi ɔmɛ ekomɛ nɛ ji e se nyɛɛli ɔ ya yɔkɔ ɔ he makɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Nɛ nyakpɛ amaniɛ nɛ a ba bɔ ji kaa gbogboe ɔ be muɔ o mi; se a na hiɔwe bɔfo komɛ nɛ a de mɛ ke Yesu ɔ te si. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, wa kpɛti nyumu ɔmɛ ekomɛ sa fo kɛ ya muɔ ɔ nya nɛ a ya na kaa gbogboe ɔ be muɔ ɔ mi niinɛ kaa bɔ nɛ yi ɔmɛ ba de ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ nɔ́ lemi se maa kɛ! Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ he we gbali ɔmɛ a munyu ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi yi ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Anɛ gbali ɔmɛ gbɛ kɛ fɔe si paa kaa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ maa na ni nɛ ɔmɛ loko e maa sɛ e neneene anunyami ɔ mi lo?”<verse eid="LUK 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nɛ Yesu gba mɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi sane kaa bɔ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ ngma kɛ je Mose Kekle Womi ɔ mi ngɛ e he ɔ, nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ a sisi fitsofitso.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a maa ho he nɛ a yaa nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Emao ɔ sumi ya. Yesu pee kaa nɔ nɛ lɛɛ e ngɛ mi poe kɛ yaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Se kaseli ɔmɛ tsi e nya nɛ a de lɛ ke du ngɛ bue, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ya hwɔ a ngɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e kɛ mɛ ho we ɔ mi ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Benɛ a hi si nɛ a maa ye ni ɔ, e ba Mawu gbaami ngɔ pue ni ɔ nɔ nɛ e wo abolo ɔ nɛ e po kɛ ngɛ mɛ hae. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Kɛkɛ nɛ si kake too ɔ, a hɛ ngmɛ bli nɛ a le e mi tso. Nɛ nɔuu nɛ e laa mɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Jehanɛ ɔ, a bɔni a si bi demi bɔ nɛ a tsui he dɔ la ha ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ benɛ e ngɛ mɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a sisi tsɔɔe ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpale a se kɛ ho Yerusalem ya nɛ a ya na kaseli nyɔngma kɛ kake ɔ nɛ piɛ ɔ kɛ ni kpa amɛ nɛ a bua a he nya. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a ya na ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ de mɛ ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ te si niinɛ. E je e he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ Petro.”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Nɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ je Emao kɛ ba a hu bɔ mɛ bɔ nɛ e ba na mɛ ngɛ Emao blɔ ɔ nɔ, kɛ bɔ nɛ e ke mɛ nyɛɛ kɛ ya su we mi se a li e mi tso kɛ ya si benɛ e po abolo ɔ ngɔ ha mɛ loko a le e mi tso ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Se benɛ a ngɛ a nyɛmi ɔmɛ amaniɛ ɔ bɔe ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu nitsɛ ba je kpo ngɛ a kpɛti, nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ he manye!” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />A tsui po saminya, ejakaa a susu kaa a na kpade.<verse eid="LUK 24:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Se Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ gbeye yee? Mɛni he je nɛ e ngɛ nyɛ pee kaa tsa pi ami i ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ ye ninehi kɛ ye nanehi ha. Nɛ nyɛ maa na paa kaa ami tutuutu i. Nyɛ ba ta ye he nɛ nyɛ maa na kaa tsa pi kpade ji mi, ejakaa kpade be Nɔmlɔ tso kaa bɔ nɛ i ngɛ nɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nɛ e wo e nine ɔmɛ kɛ e nane ɔmɛ ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ ke a hyɛ plɛɛko pa amɛ a nya ha.<verse eid="LUK 24:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Se loloolo ɔ, a yi mi tɛ mɛ ngɛ e he. A bua jɔ a he lɛɛ, se a he we yi. Kɛkɛ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni niye ni ngɛ nyɛ dɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Nɛ a ha lɛ lo sasɛɛ ko, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />nɛ e ye ngɛ a hɛ mi.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ kai we kaa benɛ i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ, i de nyɛ ke, nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ ye he ngɛ Mose Womi ɔmɛ kɛ gbali ɔmɛ a womi ɔmɛ kɛ La amɛ a mi ɔ maa ba mi lo?” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Nɛ e bli a juɛmi nya jehanɛ konɛ a nu Ngmami slɔɔto ɔmɛ a sisi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “A ngma blema lokoo kaa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ maa na nɔ́ nɛ e ma gbo se e maa te si ekohu kɛ je gbeje ngɛ ligbi etɛ se. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Nɛ ngɛ e biɛ mi ɔ, a maa fiɛ yi wami hemi munyu nɛ ɔ kɛ je Yerusalem kɛ tsɔɔ je ɔ tsuo ke, ‘Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ maa kpale kɛ ba ye ngɔ ɔ, a maa ngɔ e he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke lɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nɛ nyɛ na kaa gbami nɛ ɔmɛ ba mi.<verse eid="LUK 24:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Kaa bɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ wo si ɔ, i ma wo Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ blɔ kɛ mane nyɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ mlɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ma a mi kɛ ya si be nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma ba wo nyɛ he wami.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu sɛ a hlami nɛ a fie e se kɛ ya si a ya su Betania. Lejɛ ɔ nɛ e wo e nine nɔ ngɛ nɛ e gbaa mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Se benɛ e ngɛ mɛ gbaae nɔuu nɛ a wo lɛ kɛ je a ngɔ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Nɛ a ja lɛ nɛ a kpale kɛ ho Yerusalem ya kɛ bua jɔmi babauu nitsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, a pɔɔ a he nya buami ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ a hii Mawu yi jee.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>